Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玛丽安太太 - 是九码半的吗？\N{\rEng}- Mrs. Mariann. - You have the nine and a half?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 可给你找到了 - 太好了\N{\rEng}- Yeah, you're a lucky lady. - Oh, I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一双了 来 露个玉足吧\N{\rEng}Last pair. Let me see those beautiful feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,右脚还可以吧？\N{\rEng}The right foot's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,来 用力伸进去\N{\rEng}There you go. Get it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太小了 - 加油 加油\N{\rEng}- They're too tight. - It's okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这真是九码半？ - 对 九码半\N{\rEng}- Are these the nine and a half? - These are the nine and a half, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有大一号的吗？ - 唯独这牌子没有\N{\rEng}- Do you have the next size? - No, not in a Kerrybrooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不推荐凯步轩\N{\rEng}But that's why I don't like Kerrybrooke,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,穿他们鞋 跟裹小脚一样\N{\rEng}because they fit really small. They're made for dolls or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太不合脚了 - 好吧 脱下来吧 脱下来吧\N{\rEng}- They're too tight. - Okay, take 'em off. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 穿过朝阳吗？ - 没有\N{\rEng}- You ever try Vitality? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这牌子档次更高 更耐穿 - 稍等一下\N{\rEng}- It's a much better model if you want durable leather. - I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打扰了 - 拿来试试吧\N{\rEng}- Excuse me. Sorry. - I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找前几天卖我鞋的 戴眼镜的那位\N{\rEng}I bought a pair of shoes here the other day from him, with the glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 怎么了？\N{\rEng}- Marty. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有位顾客找你 前几天是你卖她鞋吗？\N{\rEng}This woman said she bought a pair of shoes from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对 是买了那双棕色玛丽珍吧\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah. You bought the brown Mary Janes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 鞋挺好的 - 合脚吗？\N{\rEng}- Yeah, I did. They're great. - How do they fit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我当时穿着就走了 - 好\N{\rEng}- I wore them out of the store. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后旧鞋就落在这里了 - 旧鞋长什么样？\N{\rEng}- So I left my old ones here. - Okay. What did they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,拼色高跟鞋 带小翅膀图案\N{\rEng}They're two-toned pumps, wingtips.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛伊 有见到那鞋吗？ - 没有\N{\rEng}- Lloyd, did you see her shoes? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不会被你们装回我没拿走的鞋盒\N{\rEng}Is it possible that you maybe put them in one of the boxes of the other shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,然后又塞回库房了吧？\N{\rEng}that I was trying on and restocked them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧... - 要是看见鞋盒 我就能认出来\N{\rEng}- Okay. All right. Um... - If I saw the boxes, I'd be able to recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让我同事来帮您选购好吗？\N{\rEng}Do you mind if my colleague helps you out for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 你帮忙接待一下这位行吗？\N{\rEng}Lloyd. Can you help with Mariann here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 等下\N{\rEng}Sure. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 跟我去仓库 - 谢谢 借过\N{\rEng}- Yeah, we'll check the basement. Come. - Thank you. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛伊会拿来朝阳的 - 好吧 我得考虑下价格\N{\rEng}- Lloyd's gonna help you. Get the Vitalities. - Okay. I'll think about the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您先坐会儿 我马上就来 - 好的 谢谢\N{\rEng}- I'll be right with you. Let me finish up here. - Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.70,0:01:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 嘘\N{\rEng}- What? - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是马蒂吧？ - 是 真倒霉\N{\rEng}- Marty. - Ah, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,给你看个东西 进来一下\N{\rEng}I wanna show you something. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 蹲下 赶紧蹲下\N{\rEng}- What? - Just get low. Go low.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我干嘛非得蹲着啊\N{\rEng}Why do I have to get low?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 忙吗？ - 马蒂 瞧瞧我给你准备的\N{\rEng}- How you doing? - Marty, look what I got for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西？\N{\rEng}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细瞧瞧\N{\rEng}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有啥特别的？\N{\rEng}What am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看看背面\N{\rEng}Turn it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 做管事？ - 对 管事\N{\rEng}- Manager? - Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 老默\N{\rEng}Come on, Murray.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 别告诉洛伊就行\N{\rEng}Whatever you do, just don't tell Lloyd about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是不尊重你 但把话讲明白\N{\rEng}Look, I've been very clear with you. I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这店子你经营得确实不错\N{\rEng}trying to be disrespectful. You built something very commendable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,现在别 别谈这些\N{\rEng}I don't wanna-- I don't wanna discuss this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别打断我 让我说完\N{\rEng}Stop. Stop. Let me say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这活确实让我学到不少\N{\rEng}It's been good for my soul to see this up close and personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但我不是来卖鞋的 - 我不想听这些\N{\rEng}- But I'm not a shoe salesman. - I don't wanna discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不是这块料 - 别扯这些 行吗？\N{\rEng}- I'm not a shoe salesman. - I don't wanna discuss this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,必须谈 等我飞回来 我就不干了\N{\rEng}I do wanna discuss it, 'cause when I'm back from my trip, this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能留在这行\N{\rEng}I'm not coming back and doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,说到这 工钱现在能结吗 我得去买机票\N{\rEng}Speaking of which, can we settle up now? I gotta buy my plane ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,打烊再结\N{\rEng}We'll settle at closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我得趁午休去买票\N{\rEng}I wanted to see the travel agent on my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到钱肯定不回来了\N{\rEng}You'll never come back after your lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你真把我看成那种人？\N{\rEng}That's what you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 你真以为我会跑了不回来吗？\N{\rEng}- Yes. - You think I would go and not come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我说了打烊再结 行吗？\N{\rEng}Yes. I said settle at closing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这样？ - 对 就这样 出去吧\N{\rEng}- That's it? - Yeah, that's it. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真会疼人\N{\rEng}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 等我一下\N{\rEng}- Come on. - Wait. Just wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:03:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我本来就...正要去你家的 - 啥？\N{\rEng}- I was about... I was about to come to you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 艾勒在家病着呢\N{\rEng}No, Ira's home sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂喂喂 什么病 别传染给我 - 什么？\N{\rEng}- Whoa, whoa, whoa. I can't get sick. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去打锦标赛 我可不能病\N{\rEng}I got the championships.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 他是吃坏肚子了 只是吃坏肚子了\N{\rEng}No, it's food poisoning. It's food poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真想把你塞进行李箱带走\N{\rEng}I wish I could hide you in my luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我也好想跟你走\N{\rEng}I wanna come with you so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手 反手\N{\rEng}Backhand. Backhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,正手 正手 正手\N{\rEng}Forehand. Forehand. Forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手 反手\N{\rEng}Backhand. Backhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,正手 正手\N{\rEng}Forehand. Forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手\N{\rEng}Backhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放高球\N{\rEng}And lob.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,正手\N{\rEng}Forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 干嘛\N{\rEng}- Marty! - What!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有电话 - 跟他说我20分钟前就走了\N{\rEng}- Phone! - Tell him I left 20 minutes ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不当你的传声筒 自己去接那该死的电话\N{\rEng}I'm not your goddamn messenger! Pick up the goddamn phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟不上 沃利 把白衬衫脱了\N{\rEng}I can't. Wally, take the white shirt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,白球配白衬衫 看不清\N{\rEng}I can't follow the white ball against the white shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别找借口 孬种才这样找借口\N{\rEng}Stop it. You're a fucking sun dodger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我孬种？怎么怕了 怕了？\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah? I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我是朱迪\N{\rEng}It's Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 朱迪\N{\rEng}Hi, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈病得很重\N{\rEng}Your mother, she's very sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的假的？ - 真的\N{\rEng}- Okay, really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她脸色苍白 满嘴胡话\N{\rEng}She's gray in the face. She's speaking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直喊你 你得赶快回家一趟\N{\rEng}She's asking for you. You should come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,听上去不行了 你们赶紧叫救护车吧\N{\rEng}Sounds really bad. You should probably call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谁陪她去啊\N{\rEng}Who's gonna go with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 你这么上心 你陪她去呗\N{\rEng}Uh, I don't know. You should probably go since you're so invested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 别挂\N{\rEng}Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他不吃这套\N{\rEng}He's not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说我断气了\N{\rEng}Just tell him I stopped breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行 太严重了 我不能这么说\N{\rEng}Absolutely not. That's ridiculous. I'm not saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说你正急着送我去医院\N{\rEng}Tell him you're taking me to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我得赶紧把她送去急诊\N{\rEng}Okay, fine. I'll take her to the emergency room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在那儿陪着 天知道要陪多久\N{\rEng}and sit there and wait for God knows how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你来负责伺候我丈夫 给他喂药\N{\rEng}And you can come here and give my husband his medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,“晚上给他翻身做按摩”\N{\rEng}and massage his feet all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,“跟他说我晕倒了”\N{\rEng}Tell him I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- “天呐 你妈刚刚昏过去了” - 你好啊 小姑娘\N{\rEng}- Oh, my God! Your mother, she just lost consciousness. - Hi, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,“你现在赶紧回家”\N{\rEng}You've gotta come home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 饭马上好\N{\rEng}Hi. Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,“朱迪 别闹了行吗”\N{\rEng}I don't know what you want me to say, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.81,0:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,“我正忙着 连午饭都还没吃呢”\N{\rEng}I'm busy. I'm on my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,“我妈就在你旁边指挥 我都听得见”\N{\rEng}I can hear her whispering. She's right there standing next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- “我都说她昏过去了” - “别来烦我了”\N{\rEng}- I told you she passed out. - It's annoying me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟谁通话呢？\N{\rEng}Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没人\N{\rEng}Oh. I'm not talking to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,朱迪一直占着电话好久了\N{\rEng}Judy's just been tying up the line for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你买了点热饭\N{\rEng}I got you some broth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都凉透了\N{\rEng}It's ice cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 买饭排了好久 买回来都凉了 - 你都不打草稿？\N{\rEng}- Yeah, 'cause the line was really long at the shop. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,信不信我现在打电话去核实？\N{\rEng}So that's what they'll say if I call down and ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是觉得我骗你\N{\rEng}You don't believe me? You calling me a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你就打电话核实去\N{\rEng}Pick up the phone and call them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不过看你怎么打 朱迪在占着电话 - 喔 行\N{\rEng}- You're gonna have to get Judy off the phone first. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 朱迪 把电话给我挂掉\N{\rEng}Hey, Judy, get off the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看 这颗是国际乒联标准球\N{\rEng}Okay, this is a normal IATT approved ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,盯紧这颗白球\N{\rEng}Try to follow the white ball against the white.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在白背景下挺难的吧\N{\rEng}Almost impossible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你眼珠都没动\N{\rEng}I don't even see your eyes moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我穿白衬衫 你连球都看不到\N{\rEng}If I'm wearing a white shirt, you can't see the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,换颗橙球试试 这是我自个儿想出来的\N{\rEng}Now, imagine it with an orange ball, which no one's ever thought of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 你盯得多牢 瞧他那眼神\N{\rEng}See? You're already following it way better. Look at his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见没？ - 嗯 看见了\N{\rEng}- See how his eyes are looking? - Yeah, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在盯得更紧了\N{\rEng}You're looking more engaged now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是机遇所在 目前桌球界\N{\rEng}So that's what we wanna do. Right now in the world of table tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为了盯住白球都得穿黑衣\N{\rEng}you're obliged to wear black, just so you can follow the white ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看看这个 这是泰德·贝利 - 他是谁？\N{\rEng}- Look at this. That's Ted Bailey. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾是英国冠军 世界第一\N{\rEng}That's ex-number one ranked player in the world right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,已经被我打败了\N{\rEng}He's the British champion. I've already beat him, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再看这个\N{\rEng}Now look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,网球界第一杰克·克雷默\N{\rEng}That's Jack Kramer, number one tennis player.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有啥区别？ - 他穿的是全白\N{\rEng}- What's the difference there? - He's wearing all white.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对 一身白 很绅士\N{\rEng}He's in all white. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫品味 这叫格调 这是卖点\N{\rEng}To me, that's luxury. To me, that's class. You could sell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 这种定制球得花不少钱\N{\rEng}Marty, a custom ball like that is gonna cost a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然得定制 奇人配奇球\N{\rEng}Of course it's custom. It's an original ball for an original guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是至尊马蒂牌 不是平庸马蒂牌\N{\rEng}It's the Marty Supreme ball, not the Marty Normal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你算过成本吗？\N{\rEng}But what's it gonna cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,钱不重要 咱别抠门\N{\rEng}It doesn't matter the cost. We can't cheap out on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,花不了多少钱的 加拉尼斯先生\N{\rEng}It's gonna be nominal, Mr. Galanis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是老说先花钱才能赚钱吗\N{\rEng}You always said we gotta spend money to make money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,给我端杯咖啡来\N{\rEng}Get me a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没门 让你秘书去弄\N{\rEng}No. Get your secretary to get ya a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,南希忙着呢 你去弄吧\N{\rEng}Nancy's busy. Just get me a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,才不 我正像大人那样谈生意\N{\rEng}Dad, we're talking like men about business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我才不给你端咖啡 - 赶紧去给老子端咖啡去\N{\rEng}- I'm not getting ya a cup of coffee. - Get me the damn coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 也给你来一杯？\N{\rEng}Marty, you want a coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 不用了 我不碰咖啡因\N{\rEng}No, I'm all right. I'm not drinking caffeine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\rEng}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我感谢你和我儿子的这份交情\N{\rEng}I appreciate you're friends with my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不成器\N{\rEng}He's limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,30岁还靠爹吃饭\N{\rEng}He's 30 years old. He's still living at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没啥名堂\N{\rEng}He hasn't done much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他也不懂做生意 就会乱花钱\N{\rEng}And he doesn't know business. He doesn't know the costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 盖拉尼斯先生 我不觉得他不成器\N{\rEng}I don't think he's limited, Mr. Galanis, respectfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看看您做生意的本事\N{\rEng}I mean, look at your business success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那是刻在骨子里的 迪翁也有\N{\rEng}That's in your DNA, and you passed that through to Dion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是还没显露出来 - 谁知道呢\N{\rEng}- It just hasn't been awoken yet. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是没把握\N{\rEng}I wouldn't be here trying to involve you in something that I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会拉您入伙的\N{\rEng}didn't fully in my bones believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很尊重您的钱 说来您可能不信\N{\rEng}And I have tremendous respect for your money. I know it's hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但这门运动在国外是火得不得了\N{\rEng}but I'm telling you, this game, it fills stadiums overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在美国火起来也只是时间问题\N{\rEng}And it's only a matter of time before it fills stadiums in the United States too,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我的广告会铺天盖地\N{\rEng}before I'm staring at you from the cover of a Wheaties box.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我对这行一窍不通\N{\rEng}I- I don't know nothing about this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,确实不通 所以更该信我\N{\rEng}No, you don't. That's why you gotta trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,下周这个时候 我就是首位赢下英国公开赛的美国人\N{\rEng}This time next week, I'll be the first American to ever win the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我就能一路杀到世锦赛 然后拿下世界第一\N{\rEng}That'll slide me into the number one ranking for the World Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候《生活》和《展望》都会报道\N{\rEng}Life magazine's gonna cover it. Look magazine's gonna cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是板上钉钉的事 《展望》就在捧我 他们都会捧我\N{\rEng}They have to. The editor of Look magazine, he loves me. They all love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我就是这项运动在美国的唯一代言人\N{\rEng}I'm uniquely positioned to be the face of the entire sport in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊\N{\rEng}Lloyd!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打样\N{\rEng}I'm closing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我来找我舅\N{\rEng}Yeah, I can see that. Just here to see my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\rEng}He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,走了？你什么意思？不回来了？\N{\rEng}He left? What do you mean he left? For the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他得带你妈去医院\N{\rEng}He had to take your mother to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了 她根本没病\N{\rEng}For crying out loud. She's not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 他还欠我工钱 说好了今天结清\N{\rEng}Hey, Lloyd, he owes me money. We were supposed to settle up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你午休了五个钟头\N{\rEng}Well, maybe if you didn't take that five-hour lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 兴许就能见着他 - 闭嘴吧你\N{\rEng}- you would have spoke with him. - Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁呀 - 吃了什么狗皮膏药 好得挺快的啊\N{\rEng}- Hello. - You're sounding a lot better, huh? That happened quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会挺过去的 别指望我靠你\N{\rEng}I'll live, no thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 别扯了 默里舅在你那儿吗？别骗我\N{\rEng}Enough, Mom. Are you with Murray? Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 但他好像准备出趟远门\N{\rEng}No. I think he left for his trip. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,出哪门子的远门？\N{\rEng}His trip? What trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他带着埃丝特要去库彻度假村过周末\N{\rEng}He's taking Esther to Kutchers for the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这算什么啊 - 只要我一句话 他就会留下\N{\rEng}- When this... - But he would have stayed if I asked him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没病 妈 他答应给我机票钱的\N{\rEng}You're not sick, Mom. He was supposed to give me my money for my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 那事我可不知道\N{\rEng}Well, I don't know anything about that, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别装蒜 否则我干嘛干这活？\N{\rEng}Yes, you do! Why do you think I'm working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是为了挣那笔钱\N{\rEng}I literally only accepted this job for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:11:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我可比窦娥还冤\N{\rEng}I have no idea what you are implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道你在干嘛吗？ - 我在干嘛？\N{\rEng}- You know what this is? - What, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在毁我 你在毁我前程\N{\rEng}This is sabotage. You're sabotaging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别扯了 你是在自毁前程\N{\rEng}Oh, please. You're sabotaging your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 什么？\N{\rEng}- What is that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然觉得我要抢你？\N{\rEng}Are you seriously thinking I'm gonna rob you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,职业反应\N{\rEng}Just a reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要真想抢你 你早死在血泊里了\N{\rEng}If I wanted to rob you, you'd be dead. You'd be in a pool of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来拿西装的 这是我特地为这趟比赛买的\N{\rEng}I came to grab my suit. You know I bought this specifically for my trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,打小乒乓还要穿西装 真长见识了\N{\rEng}Didn't know you need a suit to play ping pong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就要老默欠我的那700块\N{\rEng}I just want the $700 that Murray owes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不然呢？\N{\rEng}Yeah, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不然我就往你腿上来一枪 - 你不敢\N{\rEng}- Or I'm gonna shoot you in the leg. - No you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢赌吗？\N{\rEng}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是打我腿 你未来几年都得坐牢\N{\rEng}You shoot me in the leg, you'll be spending the next few years in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,行 那我就朝你脑门开枪\N{\rEng}Okay, I'll shoot you in the head instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你没那胆子\N{\rEng}You're not gonna do that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 听我说 我只拿走我的那700 绝不多拿\N{\rEng}Look, Lloyd, I just want what was promised to me, not a penny more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,回来我会带回十倍奖金\N{\rEng}I'm gonna be coming home with ten times that amount in prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,睁只眼闭只眼吧 让我拿走欠我的\N{\rEng}So just turn the other cheek, let me take what I'm owed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回来给你整整100\N{\rEng}and I'll give you an even $100 dollars when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不干\N{\rEng}Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 别这样 转过来\N{\rEng}Lloyd, come on. Look at me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,咱俩都清楚 你巴不得看我卷铺盖走人\N{\rEng}We both know you'd love nothing more than to see my ass get canned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你干这行的劲头比我大千万倍\N{\rEng}You're a thousand times more motivated than me to do this job,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可你看看吧\N{\rEng}and yet look at this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看看\N{\rEng}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老默给我的 看看背面\N{\rEng}Murray gave that to me. Flip it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,管事 我要当你管事了\N{\rEng}Manager. I'm gonna be your boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,公平吗？我能把你扫地出门\N{\rEng}How unfair is that? I could fire you whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还能叫你跪着扫地\N{\rEng}I could tell you to sweep the floor on your hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,任我差遣\N{\rEng}How about that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 我真拿枪指着你\N{\rEng}Lloyd, I'm actually pointing a gun at you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的在威胁你\N{\rEng}I'm actually threatening to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是实打实的抢劫 枪上有我的指纹\N{\rEng}This is a legit robbery like any other. My fingerprints are all over this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是铁证\N{\rEng}These are facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱柜打开 把该我的给我\N{\rEng}So open the safe, let me take what I'm owed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,回头你照实跟老默说\N{\rEng}and you can call Murray, tell him exactly what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,想把我轰走还是告我都随你 行吗？\N{\rEng}get me fired, press charges. Whatever you want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,行\N{\rEng}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给您 先生 - 谢谢\N{\rEng}- Here you go, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,垃圾\N{\rEng}You son of...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有单间吗？\N{\rEng}We don't get our own rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还冷得要死\N{\rEng}It's freezing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在给我正经点儿 眼睛看这里\N{\rEng}I really need you to be serious now. Eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,巴基斯坦 看这里\N{\rEng}Pakistan, I need you to look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,日本今年也派队来了？瞧见没？\N{\rEng}Wait, Japan brought a team this year? You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 小日本也来了\N{\rEng}Yeah. The Japs sent a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,出境管制呢？\N{\rEng}What about the travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定解禁了 - 出境管制解除了？\N{\rEng}- They must have lifted it. - No more travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 现在把球拍翻过来 露出国旗\N{\rEng}Okay, gentlemen, I want you to flip your paddles for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢配合\N{\rEng}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,准备 一 二 三\N{\rEng}Here we go. One. Two. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\rEng}Hold it still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 赛点\N{\rEng}Match point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 胜出\N{\rEng}Match, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我太多正手机会了 应该逼我打反手\N{\rEng}You let me get to my forehand too much. Should've tried to put me in my backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 几比几了？ - 19比4\N{\rEng}- What's the score here? - Nineteen-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 日本人领先？ - 那日本小子在揍烂贝利\N{\rEng}- The Japanese guy? - Japanese guy's trashing Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他手里是什么？那是什么球拍？\N{\rEng}What's he using? What's that paddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 没人见过\N{\rEng}I don't know, mate. No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没声音\N{\rEng}It's silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 静得出奇 - 哇\N{\rEng}- Like a ghost! - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,贝利 好好打\N{\rEng}Fuck, Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,赛点\N{\rEng}Match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩两局\N{\rEng}Two games.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,21比9\N{\rEng}21-9.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打得好 - 打得好 马蒂\N{\rEng}- Great game. - Great game, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 胜出\N{\rEng}Match, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那些在斯德哥尔胜出的人...\N{\rEng}The winners of the tournament at Stockholm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你是拉姆·塞西吧\N{\rEng}Hey. You're Ram Sethi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 您先等会儿\N{\rEng}Sorry, could you hold for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不介意吧？ - 请说 你有啥事？\N{\rEng}- You don't mind? - No. Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.57,0:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,打听个事 你们住在哪家酒店？\N{\rEng}I was just curious, where are you staying while you're in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这关你什么事？ - 没事\N{\rEng}- What business is it of yours? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是随便打听下\N{\rEng}I'm just saying, what hotel are you staying at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,国际乒联的官员都住丽兹酒店\N{\rEng}All the IATT representatives are stationed at the Ritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 丽兹酒店？别人也这么说 - 对\N{\rEng}- At the Ritz? Yeah, that's what I heard. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这么定了 你没意见吧？ - 什么就这么定了？\N{\rEng}- Do you think that's okay? - I don't know what you're implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你见过我住的那地方吗？ - 有啥问题吗？\N{\rEng}- Have you seen where they put me? - Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,客气说 那地方就是个狗窝\N{\rEng}Well, with all due respect, sir, it's a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉没有让你满意\N{\rEng}I'm so sorry it doesn't meet your high standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这儿给所有选手都是统一标准\N{\rEng}We offer complimentary housing to all our players, Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一一个来这抱怨的\N{\rEng}So far as I know, you're the only one to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你这口气 别把我当普通选手 好吗？\N{\rEng}You're talking to me like I'm any player off the street, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我得休息好 才能赢下比赛\N{\rEng}I need good rest so I can win the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚美国人赢对这项运动的好处\N{\rEng}You know perfectly well what an American win will do for the future of the sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是未来桌球的代言人 - 那就向美乒协反映呗\N{\rEng}- I'm good for table tennis, Mr. Sethi. - Appeal to the USTTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,美乒协有用吗？他们整个机构就那俩人\N{\rEng}There is no USTTA. The USTTA is two guys and a desk. It doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就不归我管了 - 就归你管\N{\rEng}- Well, that's not my problem. - It is your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要住你住的那家酒店 就这么简单\N{\rEng}I wanna stay where you're staying! That's what I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,您这番言论实在是太失礼了\N{\rEng}I am finding this whole exchange really offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我失礼？ - 对 您失礼\N{\rEng}- You're offended? - I am offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们才失礼呢 让明星选手住狗窝\N{\rEng}I'm offended! You're making your star player huddle in a rat's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉刚才被打断了\N{\rEng}I'm so sorry for that interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那咱们接着说锡兰和墨西哥的事...\N{\rEng}Um, back to Ceylon and Mexico...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这酒店真不赖 肯定很贵 - 是啊 确实不错\N{\rEng}- This is a nice hotel. Must cost a mint. - Yeah, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.33,0:17:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是国际乒联报销的吗？\N{\rEng}The IATT covers accommodations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明星选手才有这种待遇 - 是吗？那有多少名啊\N{\rEng}- Only for their star players. - Is that right? How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,明星选手？不知道 听说就一个\N{\rEng}Star players? I don't know. I haven't seen any others, so one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,进半决赛了 紧张吗？\N{\rEng}Any nerves, going into the semis?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张？对阵克莱茨基？别闹了\N{\rEng}Nerves? Against Kletzki? No. You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾连续三年夺冠\N{\rEng}Well, he's won the tournament for the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他名气可不小 - 我名气也不小\N{\rEng}- He's got quite the reputation. - I have quite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯维辛集中营都办不到的事 我要办成\N{\rEng}Look, I'm gonna do to Kletzki what Auschwitz couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看我怎么把他灭了\N{\rEng}Okay. I'm gonna finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 这话有点过了\N{\rEng}- Jesus Christ. - A little strong, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我能说 我也是犹太人\N{\rEng}It's all right. I'm Jewish. I can say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上你想想 我更像是希特勒的大噩梦\N{\rEng}In fact, if you think about it, I'm like Hitler's worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？\N{\rEng}And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我 我活得好好的\N{\rEng}Look at me. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还混到了上层 我就是希特勒失败的最终证明\N{\rEng}I did it, I'm on top. I'm the ultimate product of Hitler's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对 把这句话记下来 都记下来\N{\rEng}Yeah, write that down. That was good. Write that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不错 - “希特勒失败的最终证明”\N{\rEng}- Nice one. - "Ultimate product of Hitler's defeat."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你总是那么自信吗？ -一定把那这句放在我照片下面\N{\rEng}- Do you like that confidence? - Put that under a picture of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来谈谈你的出身吧 - 我的出身？\N{\rEng}- Tell us a bit about your background. - My background?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过说真的 我...我妈死于难产\N{\rEng}No, but seriously... My my my mother died in childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸就是个没出息的人 我两岁时他就丢下我走了\N{\rEng}My father was a compulsive loser who abandoned me when I was two years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我被纽约孤儿院来回折腾\N{\rEng}I got stuck in the New York City orphanage system,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,到处被赶来赶去\N{\rEng}got shuttled from one hellhole to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 难免有了案底 - 那不是凯·斯通吗？\N{\rEng}- Naturally, got in trouble with the law. - Isn't that Kay Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那破事可不能定义我\N{\rEng}I don't want any of that to define me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,采访呢 采访呢 看什么呢？\N{\rEng}Excuse me. Excuse me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看凯·斯通 - 就是她\N{\rEng}- It's Kay Stone over there. - That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\rEng}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,三十年代那阵儿的老牌女星\N{\rEng}Well, you know, the movie actress. Like, from the 1930s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 演《机缘巧合》的那个 - 《机缘巧合》?\N{\rEng}- Opportunities. - Opportunities?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 演得很好 - 是啊 佳片一个\N{\rEng}- That was good. - Yeah, yeah. Great movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有《黑匣子》 - 我爸特喜欢她\N{\rEng}- Black Box. - My dad loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 没错\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她当年很红吗？ - 红透半边天\N{\rEng}- She was big? - She was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,后来销声匿迹了\N{\rEng}Came and went. That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好莱坞就是这样 - 真是她\N{\rEng}- That's Hollywood, mate. - Yeah. It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是她\N{\rEng}It is indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有个什么湖的电影\N{\rEng}Something about a lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 《影湖》 - 嗯 那片也不错\N{\rEng}- Shadow Lake. - Yeah, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 漂亮 - 腿不错\N{\rEng}- Pretty. - Great legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,太漂亮了 太漂亮了\N{\rEng}Gorgeous, mate. Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是在看我吗？ - 不是\N{\rEng}- Think I have a chance, lads? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她肯定在看毛瑟\N{\rEng}I think she's looking Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 下个问题\N{\rEng}Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凯吗？ - 有事吗？\N{\rEng}- Kay? - Speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我是马蒂·毛瑟 我住在皇家套房\N{\rEng}Hey, it's Marty Mauser. I'm in the Royal Suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天在大堂见过你\N{\rEng}I saw you in the lobby yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们互相看了一眼 当时我在接受采访\N{\rEng}Yeah, we made eye contact. I was being interviewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不记得了 - 这么说吧\N{\rEng}- I don't recall. - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常仰慕您\N{\rEng}I'm a huge admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 要是没事我就挂了\N{\rEng}Okay. Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有点事 我刚把客房餐单上每样都点了一份\N{\rEng}Maybe. I just ordered one of everything off the room service menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人肯定吃不完\N{\rEng}There's no way I'll be able to eat it all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\rEng}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你想让我去你房间？\N{\rEng}So you'd like me to come up to your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 没错 - 要不我派我丈夫去吧\N{\rEng}- Mm-hmm. Yeah. - Perhaps I should send my husband instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 他来这里 我去你那里\N{\rEng}Sure. He can come up here, and I'll come down to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真一套套的 行了 再见 - 等等 我还想再说会儿\N{\rEng}- Okay, wonderful. Thank you. Goodbye. - Wait. I wanna keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么？\N{\rEng}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没跟真正的电影明星说过话\N{\rEng}Because I've never talked to an actual movie star.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你说过了 希望你如愿以偿了\N{\rEng}Well, now you have. I hope the experience was all you thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实也喜欢当焦点\N{\rEng}You know, I'm something of a performer too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是啊 你不信吗？\N{\rEng}- Are you? - Yeah. You don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\rEng}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么？怎么了嘛？\N{\rEng}You... What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你会演戏？\N{\rEng}You're a performer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对 会演 你手边有《每日邮报》吗？\N{\rEng}Yeah, I am a performer. You got the Daily Mailin front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.27,0:20:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还真有 怎么了？\N{\rEng}Uh, I do have it. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那你翻到第12页\N{\rEng}Okay. Well, turn to page 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等下\N{\rEng}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第12页\N{\rEng}Page 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 看什么？\N{\rEng}Okay. What am I looking at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看中间 正中间\N{\rEng}Down the middle, in the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是你？\N{\rEng}This is you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对“天选之子” 拍得不错吧？\N{\rEng}Yeah, "the chosen one." It's a nice picture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打小乒乓的？\N{\rEng}Ping pong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我打的是桌球 来这儿参加英国公开赛\N{\rEng}I play table tennis. I'm here competing in the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你多大了？ - 我23\N{\rEng}- How old are you? - I'm 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,才23岁\N{\rEng}Twenty-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我赌你都说不上来我演过什么吧\N{\rEng}I bet you can't name one film I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,凭啥这么肯定？\N{\rEng}What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我在你出生前就不演了\N{\rEng}Because I stopped acting before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？有点意思 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Really? That's really interesting. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,凯 你拿我的刮胡刀刮腿毛了吗？\N{\rEng}Kay, did you use my razor to shave your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刀钝了 我都划伤了 - 没拿\N{\rEng}- It's dull. I've cut myself. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁在说话？你丈夫？ - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Who's that? Your husband? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,难不成还有人偷偷溜进来用过它？\N{\rEng}I guess someone must've snuck in and chopped wood with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正打电话呢 - 天呐\N{\rEng}- I'm on the phone. - Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟谁打？ - 黛比\N{\rEng}- With whom? - Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 黛比 - 黛比？\N{\rEng}- Debbie. - Debbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,叫她少管闲事\N{\rEng}Tell her to get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他走了吗？ - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Is he gone? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为啥不演了？说说吧\N{\rEng}So, why'd you stop acting? Let's talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有事 我得挂了\N{\rEng}You know, I really have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明天来温布利看我打球吧 你肯定会喜欢的\N{\rEng}You must miss it, don't you? Come watch me play at Wembley tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我...我去不了\N{\rEng}I... I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 看看我怎么战胜世界第一\N{\rEng}Come on. You can watch me dethrone the number one ranked player in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我没空\N{\rEng}I'm not available.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦哟？你能有什么事？\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah? What you got going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有个大宣传会 我得陪我丈夫撑场子\N{\rEng}Actually, I have a big promotional event to attend to for my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好吧\N{\rEng}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,宣传什么？\N{\rEng}What's he promoting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,笔\N{\rEng}Pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卖笔？开什么玩笑 - 就是笔\N{\rEng}- Pens? Are you serious? - Pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 写字用的笔？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Like, writing pens? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个卖笔的？\N{\rEng}What, like, he's a pen salesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么住得起这种套房？\N{\rEng}How can you afford the suite you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他是罗克韦尔墨业的老板\N{\rEng}He owns Rockwell Ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那好吧...\N{\rEng}Oh. Okay. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听说过罗克韦尔墨业 - 你肯定知道\N{\rEng}- I know Rockwell Ink. - I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那活动内容是什么？\N{\rEng}Well, what's the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他请了阿加莎·克里斯蒂去哈查兹书店签名售书\N{\rEng}He's hired Agatha Christie to sign books at Hatchards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 哦\N{\rEng}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着就无聊\N{\rEng}That sounds really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没完没了了\N{\rEng}Oh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有完没完？ - 别挂 别挂 问你个事\N{\rEng}- What is it? - Don't hang up, don't hang up. Just one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你房间是朝街还是朝院子？\N{\rEng}Does your room face the street or the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,直说 朝街还是院子？\N{\rEng}Just answer the question. Is it facing the street or the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朝院子 - 好\N{\rEng}- The courtyard. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,去窗边看看\N{\rEng}I need you to go to the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你住几楼？\N{\rEng}What floor are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼吧\N{\rEng}I'm on the third floor, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼 好 正好\N{\rEng}Third floor. Okay, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,朝对面看看\N{\rEng}Look across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看见对面那开窗 桌上有果盘的屋了吗？\N{\rEng}You see the open window with a bowl of fruit on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗？ - 看到了\N{\rEng}- You see it? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了 我会让那果盘里凭空多出一个苹果\N{\rEng}Here's what's gonna happen. I'm gonna make an apple appear in that bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我办到了 你就推掉你那场会\N{\rEng}And if I do, you're gonna blow off your little rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 来看我比赛\N{\rEng}- No, no, no. - and come watch me play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会答应任何事\N{\rEng}I'm not agreeing to anything, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.85,0:22:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用答应 但看好了\N{\rEng}You don't have to agree to anything. I'm gonna do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了 一\N{\rEng}Okay? One...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\rEng}two...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.34,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,三\N{\rEng}three.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,票我留售票处 你去取\N{\rEng}I'll leave a ticket for you at the box office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.81,0:23:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 19比5\N{\rEng}Mauser. Nineteen to five
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,20比5\N{\rEng}Twenty to five.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基整场落后两局 零局比二\N{\rEng}Kletzki trails Mauser two games to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 局点兼赛点\N{\rEng}Game and match point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们找点乐子玩玩 - 好吧\N{\rEng}- Let's have a little fun with this one. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玩出花样来 - 收到\N{\rEng}- Have a little fun, all right? - Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,换克莱茨基发球\N{\rEng}Service switches to Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.01,0:24:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 诸位 谢谢大家 谢谢大家\N{\rEng}Very well, gentlemen. Thank you for that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基发球 当前局分6比20\N{\rEng}Kletzki serves 6-20.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟整场领先两局 两局比零\N{\rEng}Mauser leads two games to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.86,0:24:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,又是马蒂·毛瑟的赛点\N{\rEng}Match point again for Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.71,0:24:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,再次由你发球 克莱茨基\N{\rEng}Your service again, Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.07,0:24:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Mauser!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.39,0:24:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟以21比6赢下此局 以三局比零赢下整场比赛\N{\rEng}Mauser wins the game and match by 21-6. Three games to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.69,0:24:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟进入决赛 将对阵日本选手远藤功人\N{\rEng}Mauser's on to the finals where he will face Koto Endo of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.67,0:25:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别去看价钱 想吃什么随便点\N{\rEng}Get whatever you want. Don't even look at the prices, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.01,0:25:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你点什么？\N{\rEng}What are you getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我就来个威灵顿牛排和鱼子酱拼盘\N{\rEng}I'm gonna get the Beef Wellington and the caviar tasting plate
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要点就点最贵的\N{\rEng}because they're the most expensive items on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.36,0:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想再唠叨两句关于巡回表演队的事\N{\rEng}Listen, I would like to keep going back a little bit about the Globetrotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.35,0:25:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈林篮球队那事儿？ - 对\N{\rEng}- About the Harlem Globetrotters, again? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.95,0:25:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我跟你说过了 我不干 - 为什么？\N{\rEng}- I told you, I'm not interested. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.49,0:25:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是不想干\N{\rEng}'Cause I don't wanna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,报酬很高\N{\rEng}It's great money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们还能环游世界 你不想去威尼斯吗？\N{\rEng}And we will travel all over the world. Have you seen Venice?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我才不会去当马戏团的中场把戏 - 悉尼呢？\N{\rEng}- I don't wanna be doing trick shots for a halftime show - Sydney?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.83,0:25:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 观众上厕所时上场 - 巴塞罗那？\N{\rEng}- while people are going to the bathroom. - Barcelona?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.46,0:25:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真丢人 明白吗？\N{\rEng}That's beneath me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.55,0:25:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 观众相当捧他们的 - 服务员在哪儿呢？\N{\rEng}- They're treated like royalty. - Where's the waiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.59,0:25:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有个熟人干过这行 - 服务员\N{\rEng}- Listen, I know people who have done this. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,服务员\N{\rEng}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.41,0:25:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,机会难得 咱们得把握住\N{\rEng}It's a great opportunity. We should not miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.27,0:25:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂\N{\rEng}Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 请问需要帮助吗？\N{\rEng}Yes, sir. May I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.19,0:25:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可以点菜了吗？\N{\rEng}Hi. Can we order?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 我马上去叫这桌的服务员来\N{\rEng}Of course, sir. Let me fetch your waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.73,0:25:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 - 请说\N{\rEng}- Hang on. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚罗克韦尔的账由我来结\N{\rEng}Uh, I'll be taking care of the Rockwell tab tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.34,0:25:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把账记我房间上 皇家套房 马蒂·毛瑟\N{\rEng}Put it on my room. The Royal Suite. Marty Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟他们交代清楚 是我付的账 - 明白 先生\N{\rEng}- And make sure they know it's me, too. - I will. Leave it to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.41,0:25:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不许被回绝 - 没问题\N{\rEng}- Don't take no for an answer. - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.95,0:25:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂·毛瑟 皇家套房 去告诉他们 - 好的 先生\N{\rEng}- Marty Mauser. Royal Suite. Go tell 'em. - Will do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.27,0:26:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 看着我 别往那儿瞅 看着我\N{\rEng}Okay. Look at me. Don't look there. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗克韦尔是谁啊 - 就个傻瓜\N{\rEng}- Who's Rockwell? - Some bozo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.90,0:26:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看过去 别太明显 告诉我他在干啥？\N{\rEng}Look over now. Be subtle about it. What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.15,0:26:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉先生 他之前没来过我们酒店\N{\rEng}He hasn't been here before, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.03,0:26:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他在看这边\N{\rEng}He's looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.04,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好 继续跟我说话 别露馅\N{\rEng}Okay, keep talking to me. Be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说 再考虑一下\N{\rEng}Okay, fine. I want you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.66,0:26:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会是绝佳组合 我想跟你搭档\N{\rEng}We would be a great team. I wanna do this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.45,0:26:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛老想着哈林篮球队？\N{\rEng}Why are you so fixed on the Harlem Globetrotters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那群人干的真丢人\N{\rEng}It's very sad what they do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.43,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,本该是顶尖的运动员却成了杂耍的小丑\N{\rEng}Some of the premier athletes on the planet reduced to acting like circus clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.61,0:26:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再看看什么情况\N{\rEng}What's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他正朝这桌走来 - 他来了？\N{\rEng}- He's coming towards us. - He's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别紧张 表现得自然点 - 行 好的 明白\N{\rEng}- Just be normal. Act casual. - Okay, fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.39,0:26:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,劳驾 我认识你吗？\N{\rEng}Excuse me. Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.41,0:26:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不认识\N{\rEng}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.62,0:26:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然想请客？\N{\rEng}And you wanna buy dinner for my entire table tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 可以吗？ - 为什么？\N{\rEng}- Yeah. Is it okay? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.39,0:26:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫为什么？我还需要理由？\N{\rEng}What do you mean, why? Do I need a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.82,0:26:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我换个说法 你图什么？\N{\rEng}Let me rephrase that. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我什么都不图 只是想表示点谢意\N{\rEng}No, I don't want anything. It's just my small way of saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.19,0:26:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢我？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Thank you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.97,0:26:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,具体谢我什么？\N{\rEng}Thank me for what, specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.39,0:26:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您那些产品\N{\rEng}For all your products.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.97,0:26:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没了你们的笔 世界该怎么办？\N{\rEng}I mean, where would we be without pens?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我有不少本事 但最得意的就是\N{\rEng}You know, I have many talents, but the one I'm most proud of
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能大老远闻出屁话 - 不\N{\rEng}- is the ability to smell bullshit from a mile away. - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.85,0:27:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的都是真心话\N{\rEng}I'm being completely sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是哪儿人？ - 纽约人 你呢？\N{\rEng}- Where are you from? - New York. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.23,0:27:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也是纽约 你是做什么的？\N{\rEng}New York too. What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个职业运动员\N{\rEng}I'm a professional athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.51,0:27:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 哪项运动？ - 桌上网球\N{\rEng}- Really? What sport? - Table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.62,0:27:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,桌球？这也算运动？\N{\rEng}Table tennis? That's a sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.07,0:27:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然算 我来参加英国公开赛的\N{\rEng}Of course it is. I'm here competing in the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.99,0:27:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天要在温布利打决赛\N{\rEng}I'm playing at Wembley tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.31,0:27:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对阵日本 明天赛场座无虚席\N{\rEng}in front of a sold-out crowd in the finals against Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我代表美国出赛 - 等一下\N{\rEng}- I'm here representing the United States. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.50,0:27:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,日本？日本也来了？\N{\rEng}Japan? Japan has a team here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.10,0:27:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我刚才不是说了吗 - 那出境管制呢？\N{\rEng}- That's what I just said. - How'd they get around the travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为桌球在亚洲增长最快\N{\rEng}Because table tennis is the fastest growing sport in Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.51,0:27:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边火得不行\N{\rEng}It's huge over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,说个有意思的事\N{\rEng}Oh, you're gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们怎么握拍的吗？\N{\rEng}Do you know what they call their grip? The way they hold their rackets?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.64,0:27:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 他们管那叫直笔握拍\N{\rEng}- No. - They call it penholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样？\N{\rEng}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.72,0:27:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以拿去用\N{\rEng}You can use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.08,0:27:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用来干嘛？\N{\rEng}Use it for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去当宣传素材 我哪知道 我又不是生意人\N{\rEng}For an advertisement or something. I don't know, you're the business guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有点失礼 这位是我搭档贝拉·克莱茨基\N{\rEng}I'm being rude. This is my associate, Béla Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,幸会 先生\N{\rEng}Nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.69,0:27:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是打桌球的？\N{\rEng}I assume you're a table tennis player also?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.90,0:27:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错 我是1935到39年的世界冠军\N{\rEng}I am. I am. Actually, I was the World Champion from '35 to '39.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.53,0:27:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,前世界冠军 我今天把他打败了\N{\rEng}He was the World Champion. I beat him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.19,0:27:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他赢了我 他比我年轻得多\N{\rEng}He beat me. But he's much younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.91,0:28:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,也强得多 更有天赋\N{\rEng}I'm much better than him, much more talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到这个纹身 你是不是进过集中营？\N{\rEng}I can't help but notice this tattoo. You were in one of the camps, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.88,0:28:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯威辛二号营区 没错 怎么问这个？\N{\rEng}Auschwitz-Birkenau. Yeah. Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.41,0:28:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子为了解放你们付出了生命\N{\rEng}My son lost his life liberating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我深表遗憾\N{\rEng}I'm sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是苏联人解放你们的\N{\rEng}I thought you were liberated by the Soviets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确实是 是苏联 - 并不是美国人\N{\rEng}- We were. It's Soviets. - It wasn't the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.81,0:28:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是字面意思 我儿子在太平洋战场\N{\rEng}I didn't mean it literally. He was serving in the South Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那他后来怎么了？\N{\rEng}Well, what happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.93,0:28:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还能怎么了 他被杀了\N{\rEng}What do you mean? He was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.79,0:28:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这好笑吗？\N{\rEng}You find that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 不是 我有时一紧张就会笑\N{\rEng}Oh, God. No, I just get nervous laughter sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.92,0:28:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,说句安慰话\N{\rEng}If it's any consolation,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.15,0:28:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天会送给他们第三颗原子弹\N{\rEng}I'll be dropping a third atom bomb on their heads tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你这套安慰话 顶多忽悠你妈\N{\rEng}Yeah, I'm sure his mother's gonna get a lot of comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让她不反对你去打小乒乓\N{\rEng}that you're playing ping pong in his honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您操心我家事\N{\rEng}It's not that big of a deal, but I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他讲讲...他以前给纳粹拆弹\N{\rEng}Tell him-- He used to diffuse bombs for the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.45,0:28:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他讲讲那故事\N{\rEng}Tell him the story you told me about--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我那桌还有人等我 我得走了 - 别走 别走\N{\rEng}- I've got a whole table of people waiting. - No, no, no, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.93,0:28:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他会喜欢的 讲给他听\N{\rEng}You're gonna love this story. Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想听吗？ - 不太想 但快说吧\N{\rEng}- You wanna hear it? - Not really, but go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.67,0:28:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别停 快说 是好故事\N{\rEng}No, tell him. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.12,0:28:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行 那我长话短说\N{\rEng}Okay, I'll make it quick. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.02,0:28:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我进集中营被分配住处的时候\N{\rEng}when I first got to the camp, I was put into housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.72,0:29:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好有个军官认出我\N{\rEng}Lucky for me, there was an officer who recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.64,0:29:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他在1935年布拉格世锦赛上见过我\N{\rEng}He had seen me in 1935 at the World Championships in Prague.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是真心崇拜我 真心的\N{\rEng}This guy was a real fan. I mean, a real fan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.92,0:29:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他居然因为你会打小乒乓就让你活着？\N{\rEng}You're telling me he let you live because you played ping pong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.82,0:29:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很佩服我的本事 没错\N{\rEng}They respected my skills, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他们教我拆圆柱高爆炸弹\N{\rEng}So then, they taught me how to dismantle SC bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\rEng}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.24,0:29:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,每天早上他们把我和炸弹送到营外的树林里\N{\rEng}Each morning, they would send me into the woods with the bombs
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.83,0:29:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就算炸了也伤不到别人\N{\rEng}on the outskirts of the camp where I could only do damage to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.61,0:29:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有一回\N{\rEng}So one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我尾随一只蜜蜂\N{\rEng}I followed a honeybee.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.59,0:29:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么蜂？\N{\rEng}A bee?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂\N{\rEng}A honeybee,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.37,0:29:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一路跟它到了蜂巢\N{\rEng}all the way to its hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我用烟把蜜蜂全都熏跑\N{\rEng}And I smoked all the bees out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.99,0:29:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,接着我把巢掰开\N{\rEng}And then broke it open,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我把蜂蜜抹满全身 胸口 胳膊全抹上了\N{\rEng}and I smeared the honey all over my chest, my arms, everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.11,0:29:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上回去后\N{\rEng}'Cause later that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:30:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我就让室友把我身上的蜜舔掉充饥\N{\rEng}I let all my bunk mates to lick the honey off of me for nourishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,押正面\N{\rEng}Heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.64,0:31:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真倒霉 - 远藤 轮到你选了\N{\rEng}- Fuck. - Endo, choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.23,0:31:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）发球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.71,0:31:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我选那边\N{\rEng}I'll go to that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 右侧... - 加油 马蒂 加油\N{\rEng}- On my right... - Come on, Marty! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.98,0:32:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是美国选手马蒂·毛瑟 世界排名第二\N{\rEng}...Marty Mauser of the United States, ranked second,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.76,0:32:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,对阵日本选手远藤功人 未列排名\N{\rEng}versus Koto Endo of Japan, unranked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.33,0:32:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛为五局三胜\N{\rEng}The gentlemen will battle to the best of five
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.40,0:32:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,单局21分制\N{\rEng}in games to 21 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.41,0:32:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,每局须至少领先两分才能取胜\N{\rEng}Each game shall be won by at least two points.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.82,0:32:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,祝二位好运\N{\rEng}Good luck, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.05,0:32:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请保持安静\N{\rEng}Quiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.89,0:32:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛开始\N{\rEng}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.97,0:32:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 1比0\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. One-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 美国人\N{\rEng}Come on, America!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.36,0:32:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 2比0\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. Two-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.77,0:32:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂\N{\rEng}All right, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.73,0:32:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 马蒂\N{\rEng}Come on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.64,0:33:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 3比0\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. Three-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 4比0\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. Four-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.52,0:33:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂\N{\rEng}Come on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.09,0:33:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 5比0\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. Five-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.06,0:33:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,换马蒂·毛瑟发球\N{\rEng}Service switches to Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.12,0:33:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,9比19 美方发球\N{\rEng}Nine serving 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.21,0:34:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分 10比19\N{\rEng}Point, Mauser. 10-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.49,0:34:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的 马蒂\N{\rEng}Okay, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.99,0:34:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 20比10\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. 20-10.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.16,0:34:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,局点\N{\rEng}Game point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.95,0:34:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快发球\N{\rEng}Go! Serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.86,0:35:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 21比10\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. 21-10.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.88,0:35:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,本局远藤胜\N{\rEng}Game, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.56,0:35:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤以两局比零领先\N{\rEng}Endo leads two games to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.51,0:35:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\N{\rEng}Point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.85,0:35:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,18比16\N{\rEng}Eighteen-16.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.10,0:35:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分 17比18\N{\rEng}Point, Mauser. 17-18.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.29,0:35:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂 加油\N{\rEng}Go, Marty! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.58,0:35:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,换马蒂·毛瑟发球\N{\rEng}Service switches to Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 17比19\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. 17-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.86,0:36:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼了\N{\rEng}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.90,0:36:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 得分 17比20\N{\rEng}Point, Endo. 17-20.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.66,0:36:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,赛点\N{\rEng}And match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.07,0:36:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,请安静\N{\rEng}Quiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.62,0:36:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐好 保持安静\N{\rEng}Quiet. Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.13,0:36:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟发球\N{\rEng}Your service, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.88,0:36:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 马蒂\N{\rEng}Come on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.01,0:37:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\N{\rEng}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.73,0:37:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这是胡闹 不行\N{\rEng}No, bullshit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.66,0:37:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就给我重赛 用正规硬拍\N{\rEng}I want a rematch right now with a standard-league hard-bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.33,0:37:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这太不像话了\N{\rEng}That is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.52,0:37:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我装了机械臂呢？\N{\rEng}What if I had a mechanical arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.25,0:37:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我在球上涂胶水呢？这合规吗？\N{\rEng}What if I put glue on the ball? Would that be kosher?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.27,0:37:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他全场都被教练指点 这太不像话\N{\rEng}Why, he was getting coached the entire time! That is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.45,0:37:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我打的可是正经桌球 正经桌球 \N{\rEng}I play real table tennis! Real table tennis!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.56,0:37:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,胡闹啊\N{\rEng}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.99,0:37:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,胡闹啊\N{\rEng}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.08,0:37:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,本届英国公开赛冠军是...\N{\rEng}...British Open champion from Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.42,0:37:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧你\N{\rEng}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.52,0:37:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...日本选手远藤功人\N{\rEng}...Koto Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.29,0:37:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）第19届英国桌球公开赛上 日本首次问鼎冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.55,0:37:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这是自太平洋战争结束以来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.90,0:37:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）首位日本选手在国际赛场上夺得胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.14,0:37:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）获胜者为远藤功人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.82,0:37:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这位无名的日本挑战者 他在决赛中
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:38:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）以3比0的压倒性优势击败夺冠热门的美国强手
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.65,0:38:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）东京十万民众涌上街头
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）宛若庆典游行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.86,0:38:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）热烈欢庆他的凯旋
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.31,0:38:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤却以谦逊自持 愿以一名普通工匠身份回国
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.09,0:38:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）而非受封为所谓英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.02,0:38:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤16岁遭遇东京大轰炸 失去听觉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.74,0:38:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）他在无声之中磨砺感官 最终以钢铁般意志征服赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.80,0:38:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）如今 世界桌球的目光聚焦于我邦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.42,0:38:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）本年度世界锦标赛主办地已定为东京
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.11,0:38:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）美国选手必将卷土重来 誓要洗刷败绩
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.70,0:38:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）但远藤并非孤军奋战
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.07,0:38:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）他背靠的是与他一道齐心实现民族愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.44,0:38:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）共怀不屈精神的八千四百万同胞
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.77,0:39:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,（法语）您好先生 有什么需要吗？\N{\rEng}Bonjour monsieur, Est‑ce que je peux vous aider?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.64,0:39:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,米尔顿·罗克韦尔订的桌子在哪儿？\N{\rEng}Do you have a Milton Rockwell reservation?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.42,0:39:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- （法语）您说什么？ - 请查下米尔顿·罗克韦尔的订位\N{\rEng}- Excusez-moi? - Milton Rockwell reservation, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.71,0:39:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（法语）您是说罗克韦尔吧？\N{\rEng}Ah, Rockwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 马蒂 我得亲自谢谢你\N{\rEng}So, listen, Marty, I wanna personally thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.14,0:39:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你带我接触桌球\N{\rEng}for introducing me to table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.31,0:39:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我压根儿没想到 这玩意能在亚洲火成那样\N{\rEng}I had no idea what a phenomenon it was in the Asias.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.95,0:39:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 对 对 - 尤其在日本\N{\rEng}- Oh, yeah. I know. - And how big it is in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我早跟你说了 火得很\N{\rEng}That's what I was trying to tell you. It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我打算把桌球列进\N{\rEng}So, I'm thinking of incorporating it into some of the promotional events
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.29,0:39:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,秋季在那边的宣传项目里\N{\rEng}we're gonna be doing over there in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.40,0:39:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备怎么安排？\N{\rEng}How so? What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.77,0:39:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想在世锦赛期间\N{\rEng}What I wanna do is stage an exhibition match
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.53,0:39:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,安排一场你和远藤的表演赛\N{\rEng}around the time of the World Championships between you and Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.33,0:39:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 你肯定会喜欢的\N{\rEng}- Mmm. - I think you'd like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.28,0:39:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你开个价\N{\rEng}So I'm gonna make you an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,1000美金酬劳\N{\rEng}I'll pay you a thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.70,0:39:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还安排你住东京帝国饭店\N{\rEng}I'll put you up at the Imperial Hotel in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.21,0:39:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你从纽约出发 还可以坐我的私人飞机\N{\rEng}And if you're leaving from New York, I'll give you a seat on my private plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.02,0:39:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,让你这辈子体验一回什么叫奢华\N{\rEng}and you'll fly in luxury for the first time in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,钱的事之后再商量\N{\rEng}Okay, we can negotiate my price later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.67,0:40:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但这安排是在赛前还是赛后？\N{\rEng}But this would be before or after the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.42,0:40:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赛前一周左右 - 不行 必须是赛后\N{\rEng}- About a week before the event. - No, it's gotta be after.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.22,0:40:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能在紧要关头前陪他演戏\N{\rEng}I can't face off against the guy in public before it actually counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.38,0:40:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏要留到关键时候\N{\rEng}Drama is very important to me. I can't undercut the drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.91,0:40:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,先别纠结细节\N{\rEng}Let's not get tied up in minutiae.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.33,0:40:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只是想知道你有没有兴趣参加 - 有啊\N{\rEng}- I just want to find out if you're interested in participating. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.48,0:40:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有 凡是能让我露一手的机会我都不会错过\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah. Of course. I'm interested in any opportunity to show off my talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.16,0:40:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 这回我一定完胜他\N{\rEng}And you don't have to worry either, 'cause this time I'm gonna obliterate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.98,0:40:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,主要是球拍的问题\N{\rEng}It's really the racket that I'm playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.67,0:40:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但我保证 准能赢\N{\rEng}but I can assure you, it's gonna be a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.30,0:40:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 听着 你得明白这是怎么回事\N{\rEng}Okay, listen. I need you to understand what this thing's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.51,0:40:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是正式比赛\N{\rEng}This is not an official match.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.09,0:40:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,连真打都算不上\N{\rEng}It's not even a real game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.84,0:40:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是纯粹的宣传 目的就是讨好日本人\N{\rEng}This is purely promotional, to entertain the Japanese people,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.03,0:40:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好让他们多买我的笔 明白吗？\N{\rEng}so they buy more of my pens, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.95,0:40:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你上去打几局 你会很亮眼\N{\rEng}You're gonna play a few games. You're gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.72,0:40:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但别把远藤的风头给抢了 - 你让我故意输给他？\N{\rEng}- But you can't play better than Endo. - You want me to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.44,0:40:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 给你看样东西\N{\rEng}Marty, let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.19,0:40:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,日本头号杂志\N{\rEng}Biggest magazine in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.53,0:40:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你把远藤捧成了国民英雄\N{\rEng}You made Endo a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.16,0:40:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着... - 你什么意思？\N{\rEng}- Listen-- - Why are you showing me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.20,0:40:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这会让我甘心输掉？我只会更想赢\N{\rEng}Do you think this makes me wanna lose? This makes me wanna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.18,0:40:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要以退为进\N{\rEng}Sometimes, when you lose you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.06,0:40:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听我解释一下 - 我比远藤强上万倍\N{\rEng}- Let me explain. Let me explain. - I'm ten trillion times better than Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.48,0:41:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,打败我的不是人 而是那把球拍\N{\rEng}You understand that, right? It's the racket that beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.44,0:41:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他水平很一般 - 我不在乎\N{\rEng}- He's a mediocre player. - I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.15,0:41:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不在乎桌球 这都不算体育\N{\rEng}I don't care about table tennis. This is theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.34,0:41:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你担心什么？ - 我的名声\N{\rEng}- What are you worried about? - My reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的名声？ - 没错 我的名声\N{\rEng}- Your reputation? - Yes, my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.49,0:41:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会为你糟蹋我的名声 没门\N{\rEng}I don't wanna throw my reputation in the trash for you. I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.95,0:41:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不就在当小丑吗？\N{\rEng}Aren't you playing in a vaudeville circus act right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.62,0:41:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么小丑？把话说清楚\N{\rEng}What do you mean, vaudeville? Finish that sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.85,0:41:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思？ - 你不过是人家中场休息时的把戏\N{\rEng}- What are you implying? - You're the halftime show, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.15,0:41:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是哈林篮球队 都是世上最顶尖的运动员\N{\rEng}Of the Harlem Globetrotters! The finest athletes on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.22,0:41:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,从一月到现在 至少有八万观众看过我的表演\N{\rEng}I've probably played in front of 80,000 people since January.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.80,0:41:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这好笑吗？\N{\rEng}That's funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.13,0:41:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 你很可笑\N{\rEng}No. You're funny to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.63,0:41:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我可笑？你知道什么最可笑吗？\N{\rEng}I'm funny to you? You know what's funny to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.48,0:41:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么低三下四去讨好日本人\N{\rEng}That you want to entertain the Japanese so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.34,0:41:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们杀了你儿子 这才叫可笑\N{\rEng}and they murdered your son. That's funny to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.00,0:41:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 咱俩互揭伤疤 扯平了 行吗？\N{\rEng}Look, you struck a nerve, I struck a nerve. Okay? Now we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.53,0:41:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\rEng}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.93,0:41:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你还欠我一顿饭\N{\rEng}Nah, I think you owe me a meal first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.83,0:42:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,（塞克语）让我们热烈欢迎小乒乓登场
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.73,0:42:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（塞克语）他们将上演“一闪一闪亮晶晶”
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.78,0:42:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快来 教练\N{\rEng}Yeah, Coach, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.97,0:42:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一 说茄子\N{\rEng}Three, two, one. Say cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.02,0:42:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,茄子\N{\rEng}Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.07,0:42:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（法语）接下来毛瑟 对阵 海豹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.15,0:43:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,借过\N{\rEng}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.25,0:43:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也不打招呼\N{\rEng}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.86,0:44:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别在我房间吃喝 会生虫子\N{\rEng}Please don't eat or drink in my room. It attracts bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.20,0:44:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是进去打扫卫生 别多想\N{\rEng}I just go in there to clean. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.41,0:44:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,见到我你一点都不高兴啊\N{\rEng}Well, you don't seem happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.30,0:44:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你不也不高兴吗\N{\rEng}Yeah, and you don't seem happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.12,0:44:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要留这儿住吗？\N{\rEng}So, now are you going to be staying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.40,0:44:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 不行吗？\N{\rEng}What, is that not okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.82,0:44:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我过几周就走 不烦你\N{\rEng}Don't worry. I'll be out of your hair in a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.96,0:44:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,懂点事吧\N{\rEng}Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.94,0:44:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走去哪儿？过几周有什么事？ - 世锦赛\N{\rEng}- Why? What's in a few weeks? - World Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.58,0:44:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿办？ - 东京\N{\rEng}- So, where's that gonna be? - Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.52,0:44:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,日本的东京？\N{\rEng}Tokyo, Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.26,0:44:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他东京吗？\N{\rEng}Are you asking me if Tokyo's in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.34,0:44:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你没正经问题吗？\N{\rEng}Is that a serious question?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.89,0:44:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来累坏了\N{\rEng}You look very tired to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.26,0:44:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚跑了大半个地球 能不累吗\N{\rEng}Yeah, 'cause I just traveled halfway around the world. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.47,0:44:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我很忙 忙着工作 忙着挣钱\N{\rEng}I was busy. I was working. I was making money.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.27,0:45:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,趁着这会儿楼里没人用热水\N{\rEng}You know, while everybody is at work in the building,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.36,0:45:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,去好好洗个热水澡吧\N{\rEng}it would be a good time for you to take a nice, long, hot shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.42,0:45:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 这是什么？\N{\rEng}- Here. - What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.85,0:45:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,专门带给你的\N{\rEng}I got you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.44,0:45:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是从真金字塔上敲下来的\N{\rEng}It's from an original Egyptian pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.46,0:45:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得小时候吗？\N{\rEng}We built that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.04,0:45:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.43,0:46:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 利维 又长高了\N{\rEng}Hey, Levi. You got a lot taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.62,0:46:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 有啊\N{\rEng}- No, I didn't. - Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.35,0:46:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是哪位 有事吗？ - 有 跟我走\N{\rEng}- Excuse me. Can I help you? - Yeah. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.94,0:46:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 赶紧的 - 你干嘛？\N{\rEng}- Come on, come on. - Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.54,0:46:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我走 快走 - 不 你搞什么鬼？\N{\rEng}- Let's go, let's go. Let's go. - No! What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.81,0:46:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你被捕了 - 我没有\N{\rEng}- You're under arrest. - No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.19,0:46:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 被捕了 过来 别乱动 - 凭什么逮捕我？\N{\rEng}- Yes, you are. Come here. Stop moving! - What am I under arrest for?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.23,0:46:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是我的洗漱用品 哎呦 - 你被捕了\N{\rEng}- That's my toiletries! Ow! - You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 犯了什么事？ - 持械抢劫 走吧\N{\rEng}- For what? - Armed robbery. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.49,0:46:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,持械？你胡说什么呢？\N{\rEng}Armed rob-- What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.82,0:46:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不想受伤就别动了\N{\rEng}You're gonna hurt yourself if you keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.26,0:46:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么回事？ - 走\N{\rEng}- What is going on? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.34,0:46:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老默 我妈在哪？ - 我叫她先走开一下\N{\rEng}- Murray, where's my mother? Murray. - I asked her to leave for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.05,0:46:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么？到底搞什么鬼？抓我？帮帮我！\N{\rEng}You told her-- What the fuck is going on? I'm getting arrested! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.21,0:46:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,萨尔 萨尔 我跟他单独谈谈 你先回避下\N{\rEng}Sal, Sal. I wanna talk to him in private. Excuse us. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.89,0:46:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去哪儿？ - 萨尔？ 你认识这人？\N{\rEng}- What do you want me to do? - Sal? You know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.47,0:46:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先去屋里待会儿 - 好\N{\rEng}- Just go in the back for a while. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.06,0:46:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,关上门\N{\rEng}Close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.33,0:46:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,行 情况不对就喊我\N{\rEng}All right, if it gets crazy just holler.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.23,0:46:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼 我拿的那钱是你欠我的\N{\rEng}What the fuck is going on, Murray? That money I took, you owed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.68,0:46:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别胡扯 那钱是你持枪抢的\N{\rEng}No, no, no, no. It was money you stole at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.82,0:46:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 你答应过我的 听我说 - 不 你根本没...\N{\rEng}- No, you promised me... Excuse me. - No, you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.85,0:46:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那钱本来就该给我的\N{\rEng}That was my money and you took--
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.66,0:46:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过要给我的 我没胡扯\N{\rEng}You promised me that money. I'm not... Why would I make this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.16,0:46:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是去英国的路费 - 哦 比赛怎么样？\N{\rEng}- It was money for my trip to England. - What happened on your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.62,0:46:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\rEng}What do you mean, what happened on my trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.85,0:46:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你输了 - 我没输\N{\rEng}- You lost! - No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.25,0:46:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就是输了 - 听谁说的？\N{\rEng}- You did! - Where did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.73,0:46:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 对手作弊了 - 你知不知道我多少次\N{\rEng}- No, I got cheated against. - Do you know how many times
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.40,0:46:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 半夜得替你... - 行了 别扯了\N{\rEng}- in the middle of the night... - No, no. Stop with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.17,0:47:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 好好听着 - 少教训我\N{\rEng}- Shut up and listen to me! - Don't lecture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.13,0:47:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\rEng}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.74,0:47:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道我多少次半夜被叫醒\N{\rEng}You don't know how many times I had to get woken up
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.87,0:47:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 替你擦屁股 - 谁让你管的？\N{\rEng}- and bail you out. - When did I ask you to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.39,0:47:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我求过你吗？ - 你确实没求过我\N{\rEng}- When have I ever asked for your help? - You never asked me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.43,0:47:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 但我还是帮了\N{\rEng}- Exactly! - But I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.24,0:47:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你都多大了 你该懂事了\N{\rEng}And now, you're gonna be a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.56,0:47:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你得成器了 - 成器？\N{\rEng}- It's your turn. - A big boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.06,0:47:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你竟然教育我？ - 没错 听好了\N{\rEng}- Did you really just say that to me? - Yeah. Yeah, you know, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.71,0:47:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能永远供着你妈\N{\rEng}I can't support your mother for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.48,0:47:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁让你操心了 - 哦 那谁操心？\N{\rEng}- You're not gonna have to. - Oh, yeah? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.24,0:47:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来承担 - 你承担？怎么承担？\N{\rEng}- Because I'm gonna step up. - You're gonna step up? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.59,0:47:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让我妈妈荣华富贵\N{\rEng}In a way you can't imagine. She's gonna be living on Fifth Avenue
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.87,0:47:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,住进有电梯的豪宅\N{\rEng}in an apartment and building with a elevator,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.64,0:47:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还有门童 还有专人伺候\N{\rEng}and a man who works in the elevator that takes her every time she needs to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.45,0:47:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,得了得了 听好了\N{\rEng}Sure, sure, sure. All right, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.39,0:47:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你两个选择 你自己选\N{\rEng}I'm gonna give you two options, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.50,0:47:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该能接受第一个\N{\rEng}I think you'll like the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.52,0:47:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,回鞋店干活\N{\rEng}You come back to the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.34,0:47:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这回别再不务正业了\N{\rEng}This time, no more bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.76,0:47:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别再耍你那小乒乓了 明白吗？\N{\rEng}None of this ping-pong mishegoss, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.57,0:47:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你更大的权责\N{\rEng}I'm gonna give you much more responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.53,0:47:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 你卖鞋挺有一手的\N{\rEng}because truth be told, you're an amazing salesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.04,0:47:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我都能卖鞋给蛇\N{\rEng}I could sell shoes to an amputee.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.02,0:47:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样 我偏不干 第二个选择呢？\N{\rEng}So what? What's the other option?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.77,0:47:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我就控告你 - 你才不会\N{\rEng}- I press charges. - You're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.38,0:47:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛伊是证人... - 你不会那么干的\N{\rEng}- Lloyd is a witness... - You're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.35,0:47:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...然后你去蹲大牢\N{\rEng}...and you go to jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.44,0:47:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？对你亲外甥这么狠？你疯了吗？\N{\rEng}Really? You'd do that to your own kin? Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.93,0:48:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 得让你尝尝教训 - 萨尔 出来 萨尔\N{\rEng}- We'll see... You took it upon yourself. - Hey, Sal! Sal!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.80,0:48:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛？ - 他给你多少钱来吓我？\N{\rEng}- What? - How much is he paying you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.83,0:48:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说什么 什么钱？\N{\rEng}What are you talking about, paying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.36,0:48:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我舅给你多少钱来吓我？\N{\rEng}How much is my uncle paying for you to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.98,0:48:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不管多少 我出双倍 快来跪下给我舔吧\N{\rEng}'Cause whatever it is, I'll double it for you to suck my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.53,0:48:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 给我舔\N{\rEng}- What? - Suck my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.04,0:48:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你口臭真难闻 - 嘴放干净点 你这...\N{\rEng}- You have terrible breath. - Watch your mouth, you--
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.48,0:48:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 该死 - 走 现在就走\N{\rEng}- Ow! Fuck! - Let's go. We're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.52,0:48:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他刚打了我 - 住手 行了行了\N{\rEng}- He just hit me! - Stop. Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.50,0:48:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老默 他打我 - 停下\N{\rEng}- Murray, he hit me. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.63,0:48:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都商量好了\N{\rEng}We worked everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.38,0:48:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,听见没 我们商量好了\N{\rEng}You were in the other room. You didn't hear. We already worked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.63,0:48:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会补偿一切 - 粗鲁\N{\rEng}- He's paying back everything. - Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.20,0:48:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他把钱给我了 都没事了\N{\rEng}He gave me the money, and everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.48,0:48:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你从哪儿拿的钱？ - 你行李箱里\N{\rEng}- Where did you get that? - I got it from your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.37,0:48:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 那是我去日本的钱\N{\rEng}Are you out of your mind? That's my money for Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.55,0:48:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是傻了？ - 走 赶紧走\N{\rEng}- Are you out of your fucking mind? - Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.02,0:48:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,押到局里 把他押走\N{\rEng}Just take him downtown, damn it! Take him downtown!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.54,0:48:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 好 我听你的 停下 - 你玩完了 彻底完了\N{\rEng}- Okay. All right! Okay! I'll stop! - You're done. You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.95,0:48:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 停下 停下 - 跟我走\N{\rEng}- Please. Stop. Stop. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.66,0:48:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 放开他 放开他 - 放开他？\N{\rEng}- All right. Let him go. Let him go. - Let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.90,0:48:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放开他 放开他 - 坐好\N{\rEng}- Let him go. Let him go. - Sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.34,0:48:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 道个歉\N{\rEng}Listen, apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.45,0:48:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,行 对不起 我错了\N{\rEng}Okay, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给他解开手铐\N{\rEng}Take his cuffs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.38,0:48:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 接下来这样安排 听好 - 好\N{\rEng}- This is what's gonna happen, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.60,0:48:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们去花园咖啡馆见你妈\N{\rEng}We're gonna meet your mom at the Garden Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.87,0:49:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们好好吃顿饭\N{\rEng}We're gonna have a really nice dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.09,0:49:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,之前的破事儿就翻篇了 行吗？\N{\rEng}And let's just put all this shit behind us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.56,0:49:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,行 没问题\N{\rEng}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.61,0:49:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我错了 我错了 真错了 - 你知错了？\N{\rEng}- I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I'm sorry. - You're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.05,0:49:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的事慢慢解决 赶紧穿衣服\N{\rEng}We'll take care of everything. Just get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.31,0:49:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 舅舅爱你 - 行 我也爱你\N{\rEng}- Come on. I love you. - All right. I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.32,0:49:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你外甥真是个废物\N{\rEng}Your nephew's a piece of shit, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.19,0:49:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 天呐 实在对不住\N{\rEng}Oh, Jesus. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.87,0:49:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再给你十块\N{\rEng}Here another ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.87,0:49:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好 行吧\N{\rEng}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.87,0:49:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,花园咖啡馆啊 点什么馅三明治？\N{\rEng}Garden Café, huh? What do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.64,0:49:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,烟熏肉啊 还能什么？\N{\rEng}The pastrami, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.32,0:49:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 烟熏肉 - 你点什么馅？\N{\rEng}- Ah, pastrami. - What do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.00,0:49:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,英式烤牛肉\N{\rEng}Roast beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.75,0:49:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 英式烧牛肉？ - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Roast beef? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.20,0:49:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,（意第绪语）你这吃洋饭的条子\N{\rEng}Goyishecop!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.63,0:49:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.36,0:49:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,开门 别磨蹭\N{\rEng}Open up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.75,0:49:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把门撞开 - 你确定？\N{\rEng}- Break it down. - Break it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\rEng}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.58,0:49:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你往哪儿跑？\N{\rEng}Hey! Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.69,0:49:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\rEng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.73,0:49:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？ - 他从窗户跑了\N{\rEng}- What happened? - He went out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.96,0:49:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？怎么回事？ - 弗兰基\N{\rEng}- What? Wait! - Frankie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.54,0:50:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 他沿着消防梯下去了\N{\rEng}- What? - He's coming down the escape right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那儿 别让他跑了\N{\rEng}There he goes! Down the escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.88,0:50:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 快追 快追 快追\N{\rEng}- Oh, shit. - Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.30,0:50:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来 摸摸它 - 我去后头打个电话\N{\rEng}- You hold it. - I'm just gonna use the phone in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.88,0:50:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这兔子多喜欢你啊\N{\rEng}See how much he likes you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.04,0:50:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 嘿 沃利 最近怎样 我是马蒂\N{\rEng}- Hello? - Hey, Wally. How you doing? It's Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.52,0:50:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今晚出车吗？ - 废话 当然出\N{\rEng}- Are you working tonight? - Of course I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.16,0:50:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,行 好 开着车 多带现金\N{\rEng}Okay, great. Bring your cab and as much cash as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.31,0:50:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,到28街的哈尔西碰头 明白吗？\N{\rEng}I want you to meet me at The Halsey on 28th Street, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.79,0:50:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？你又想去骗局子？\N{\rEng}What? You wanna go hustling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.97,0:50:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\rEng}Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.15,0:50:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 还记得上次多惨吗？\N{\rEng}No, no, no. I got my ass kicked last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.00,0:50:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们跑去史坦顿岛\N{\rEng}We went all the way to Staten Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.51,0:50:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟你就被认出了 你还想回去？\N{\rEng}and within ten minutes, they recognized you, and now you want to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.07,0:51:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不去 这次去新泽西那边 奎因提过的那个地方\N{\rEng}No, It's fine. We're gonna go to that place that Quinn was talking about in Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.96,0:51:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,坏主意\N{\rEng}That's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.10,0:51:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是你的新宠物了 - 不 妈妈 我想要个犰狳\N{\rEng}- That's your new pet. - No, Mom, I want the armadillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.84,0:51:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们商量过...\N{\rEng}No, I already--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.93,0:51:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 我给你拿个犰狳\N{\rEng}You know what? I'm just gonna get you the armadillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.08,0:51:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你抱好 你自己挑\N{\rEng}I'm gonna give him to you, and then you can make a decision. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.21,0:51:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是哺乳动物啊\N{\rEng}They're not reptiles. They're mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.96,0:51:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,行 太好了 你真是个大好人 一个半小时后见\N{\rEng}Okay, great. You're a beautiful man. I'll see you in an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.97,0:51:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪儿？ - 哈尔西见 就这样 好哥们\N{\rEng}- Where? - At the Halsey. Okay. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.02,0:51:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 再见\N{\rEng}Thank you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.49,0:51:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你来了\N{\rEng}Okay, good. Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.85,0:51:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有后门可以出去？\N{\rEng}Is there a way I can go out the back or something, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.85,0:51:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛 你那眼神啥意思？\N{\rEng}What? Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.69,0:51:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你不打算说点什么吗？\N{\rEng}Aren't you gonna say something to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.72,0:51:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 恭喜是吧？\N{\rEng}What, congratulations?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.61,0:51:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Congratulations? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.61,0:51:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你傻吗？ - 你想让我说什么？\N{\rEng}- Are you kidding me? - What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.24,0:51:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这八个月我一直在找你\N{\rEng}I've been trying to get in contact with you for eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.19,0:51:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 这招没用的\N{\rEng}Okay, I see what you're trying to do. It's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.00,0:51:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 那孩子跟我没关系\N{\rEng}- Excuse me? - That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.30,0:51:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绝对是你的 - 不可能 我都拔出来了\N{\rEng}- It is absolutely yours. - No, it's not. I pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.11,0:51:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是你的 - 你丈夫艾勒也拔出来吗？\N{\rEng}- Yes it is. - Does Ira pull out?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.09,0:51:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么说？ - 如实回答\N{\rEng}- What do you want me to say to that? - It's a simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.10,0:51:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他和你上床时会拔出来吗？\N{\rEng}Does he pull out when he has sex with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.70,0:51:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回答我 - 你竟然要我答这个？\N{\rEng}- Answer it. - You want me to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.01,0:51:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 快回答 他拔不拔出来\N{\rEng}Yes! Answer it. Does he pull out when he...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.69,0:51:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起 不哭 不哭\N{\rEng}I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.80,0:51:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我陷入麻烦了 瑞秋 到处麻烦缠身\N{\rEng}I'm a mess right now. I'm really a mess, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.77,0:51:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我在伦敦输了后...\N{\rEng}I lost in London, by the way--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.37,0:51:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rEng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.40,0:52:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\rEng}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.68,0:52:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛呢？\N{\rEng}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.40,0:52:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他爸爸过世了\N{\rEng}His father died.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.62,0:52:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放屁 - 她是我从八岁起的朋友\N{\rEng}- Bullshit! - This is my friend since I was eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.69,0:52:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你了吗？\N{\rEng}Am I talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.68,0:52:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,艾勒 我从八岁就认识她了\N{\rEng}Ira, I've known her since I was eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.54,0:52:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸刚走 她在安慰我\N{\rEng}My father just died. She was consoling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.07,0:52:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 没事的\N{\rEng}Honey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.72,0:52:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 别碰我 - 你跟老婆就这样说话吗？\N{\rEng}- Shut up! Don't touch me! - That's how you talk to your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.33,0:52:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对 有意见吗？\N{\rEng}Yeah, that's how I talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.18,0:52:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行 - 有意见吗？\N{\rEng}- Okay. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.09,0:52:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来 来 来 把意见大声说出来\N{\rEng}No, no, no! Come on. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.94,0:52:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说出来 - 马蒂 别说了\N{\rEng}- Keep going. - Marty, just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.23,0:52:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看我不撕烂你的臭脸\N{\rEng}I'll rip that unibrow right off his fucking forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.12,0:52:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你想动手吗？跟个禽兽一样？\N{\rEng}You wanna get physical? Like an ape?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.66,0:52:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,艾勒\N{\rEng}Ira.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.98,0:52:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,艾勒 回来 快进来 你要干嘛？\N{\rEng}Ira! Come back inside. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.54,0:52:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谁去把条子叫来 快点\N{\rEng}Somebody get the fucking cops over here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.59,0:52:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要干嘛？ - 该死 我得赶紧溜\N{\rEng}- What did you do? - Fuck! I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.01,0:52:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要躲警察\N{\rEng}Why are you running from the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.12,0:52:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在这儿 快去抓\N{\rEng}Come on, he's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.55,0:52:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有后门吗？\N{\rEng}There's no way out the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.07,0:52:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 后什么？ - 瑞秋 专心点 有没有？\N{\rEng}- What? What-- - Please! Come on. Rachel! Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.57,0:52:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,从这出去 走吧\N{\rEng}It leads out the back. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.11,0:52:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,行 行 谢谢 谢谢\N{\rEng}Okay. Okay. Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.38,0:52:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 我上哪找你？ - 回头再说 回头再说\N{\rEng}- Where do we meet? Where? - I'll tell you later. I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有看到一个戴眼镜的白小子从这儿出来？\N{\rEng}Guys, you see a white kid with glasses come through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.24,0:53:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没人看见？\N{\rEng}Nobody saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.26,0:53:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听不懂英语？\N{\rEng}No English, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.84,0:53:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如需继续通话 请投币五分\N{\rEng}Please insert a nickel if you'd like to continue the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.15,0:53:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要五分？电话要断了\N{\rEng}A nickel? They're gonna cut us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.34,0:53:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有五分吗？ - 没\N{\rEng}- Do you have a nickel? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.77,0:53:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 真没骗你 我保证这次是最后一次了\N{\rEng}Mom, I'm not lying. I promise you this will be the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.42,0:53:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我眼花了 这不是我的小毛毛吗？\N{\rEng}Are my eyes broke, or is that motherfucking Mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.18,0:53:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 近来怎样？\N{\rEng}- Thank you. - What's up, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.37,0:53:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太谢谢了 你要帮大忙了 谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you so much. I really appreciate it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.51,0:53:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一身臭味 - 我知道\N{\rEng}- You smell like a fish, Marty. - I know, that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.82,0:53:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以咱们得开个房 我得洗个澡\N{\rEng}we gotta get a hotel room. I need to get a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.73,0:53:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 麻烦开一间房\N{\rEng}How you doing? Hey, can we get a hotel room, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.75,0:53:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四块 - 你刚还说三块呢\N{\rEng}- Four dollars. - You said it was three dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.40,0:54:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是刚才那间价格 现在四块 - 怎么现在变四块了？\N{\rEng}- That was for the last room. It's four. - Why is it four dollars now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.36,0:54:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,先借我四块 我保证还你\N{\rEng}Let me get four bucks. I'll pay you back, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.05,0:54:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说 我们只有十块本钱可以赌\N{\rEng}I'm telling you right now, we only got ten to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.98,0:54:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就带了十块？搞什么鬼？\N{\rEng}You brought ten dollars? What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.35,0:54:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一小时前才通知我 - 那咱们怎么赢钱？\N{\rEng}- You gave me a hour notice. - How are we supposed to make money?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.23,0:54:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 我得养娃呢 我就是个开出租的\N{\rEng}Nigger, I got kids! I'm a fucking taxi driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.34,0:54:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有便宜点的房吗？不用讲究\N{\rEng}Do you have a cheaper room? It doesn't have to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.59,0:54:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,五楼还有间 但不准洗澡\N{\rEng}There's a room on the fifth floor, but you can't use the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.89,0:54:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那好 多少钱？ - 两块五\N{\rEng}- Okay, how much is that? - Two fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.48,0:54:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 借我三块 谢谢 - 别赖账\N{\rEng}- Let me get three dollars. Thank you. - You better pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.29,0:54:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放心 放心 - 多亏你还有我这个哥们\N{\rEng}- Yeah, I will I will. - You lucky I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.09,0:54:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吉米 吉米 - 待会从赢的钱里扣\N{\rEng}- Jimmy. Jimmy. - It's coming out your winnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.19,0:54:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把钥匙递来\N{\rEng}Give me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.31,0:54:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这啥味儿？\N{\rEng}What's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.37,0:54:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呦 我去\N{\rEng}Oh, my God! Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.65,0:54:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去 怎么那么臭 - 天呐\N{\rEng}- Wow! What is that? - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.36,0:54:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,出了点小意外\N{\rEng}He had a little accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.92,0:54:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪是小意外啊\N{\rEng}God! He had an enormous accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.68,0:54:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,难闻死了\N{\rEng}That's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.32,0:54:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟掉粪坑里一样 - 我去\N{\rEng}- Smells like shit! - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.84,0:54:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 你才掉进过粪坑\N{\rEng}Jimmy, you smell like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.32,0:54:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你嘴比你那狗还臭 - 能把钥匙给我了吗？\N{\rEng}- Is that your breath or the dog? - Can I get my key, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.77,0:54:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不许带那狗上电梯 走楼梯\N{\rEng}Do not go in the elevator with that dog. Take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.25,0:54:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹 - 赶紧洗狗\N{\rEng}- Are you kidding me? - Wash that dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.82,0:54:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 吉米\N{\rEng}Goodbye, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.82,0:54:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她肚子有多大了 - 非常大 大得吓人\N{\rEng}- How big is she, Marty? - Very big. Big.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.80,0:54:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大到明天就生吗？\N{\rEng}Is she popping out tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.94,0:54:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道什么时候生 我只知道孩子不是我的\N{\rEng}I don't know when she's popping out. Look, all I know is it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.42,0:54:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我太了解她了 她有她的小算盘\N{\rEng}She has an agenda. You don't know her like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.96,0:54:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她婚姻不幸 生活惨淡\N{\rEng}She's stuck in a miserable marriage. She has a horrible life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.98,0:54:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她想借我逃避\N{\rEng}She's trying to pin it down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.08,0:54:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,从八岁起 她就想把我套牢\N{\rEng}Since we were eight years old, she's trying to get me stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.62,0:55:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 套你这穷光蛋？ - 没错\N{\rEng}- Your bummy ass? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.49,0:55:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那她真有毛病\N{\rEng}Yeah, she is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.48,0:55:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,从生理上讲那孩子绝不可能是我的\N{\rEng}It's a biological impossibility that that kid is mine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.90,0:55:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你戴套了？ - 没 我不需要\N{\rEng}- So, you using raincoats? - No, I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.96,0:55:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那你多半是废了\N{\rEng}So you must be shooting blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.96,0:55:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道“定海锁脉功”吗？\N{\rEng}Do you know what continence is, Wally? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.51,0:55:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,每次尿一半我就憋着\N{\rEng}Every time I take a piss, I pull back,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.86,0:55:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然后默唱首生日歌\N{\rEng}I hold my urine in, and I count to ten Mississippi.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.97,0:55:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 专练那块肌肉 - 我去\N{\rEng}- That's how you build up the muscle. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.24,0:55:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是专练膀胱炎的\N{\rEng}That's how you get a fuckin' bladder infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.77,0:55:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢？那是我的信\N{\rEng}What are you doing? That's my mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.88,0:55:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瞎看什么\N{\rEng}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.65,0:55:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你得用尿布了\N{\rEng}You need to grab them goddamn diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.27,0:55:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不用\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.48,0:55:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你得理智点\N{\rEng}And get a fucking grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.83,0:55:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不当什么爹\N{\rEng}I'm not a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.29,0:55:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哟 马蒂 - 干嘛？\N{\rEng}- Yo, Marty. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.58,0:55:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹酒店是哪出？\N{\rEng}What's the Ritz?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.84,0:55:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛问这个？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你被国际乒联\N{\rEng}You got a $1,500 fine
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.28,0:55:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,罚了1500美金\N{\rEng}from the International Table Tennis...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.29,0:55:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - ...他们说...\N{\rEng}- What? - ...Association and...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.17,0:55:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们还... - 快拿给我\N{\rEng}- And they... - Bring it in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.89,0:56:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们还把你给禁赛了 - 给我\N{\rEng}- And they banned your scrawny ass. - Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.27,0:56:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 你他妈从哪冒出来的？\N{\rEng}- Are you okay? - Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.58,0:56:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快来帮我 快抬起来\N{\rEng}God! Help me! Get this fucking thing off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.27,0:56:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的狗\N{\rEng}My dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.48,0:56:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 见鬼 出啥事了\N{\rEng}- Holy shit! - Shit! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.41,0:56:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 从浴缸滚出来帮我\N{\rEng}Come on! Get outta that fuckin' tub and help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.59,0:56:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我狗要淹死了 赶紧 帮我\N{\rEng}My dog's drowning, man. Come on! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.44,0:56:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我要抬了 准备抽手\N{\rEng}Okay, I'm flipping it. Take your arm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.59,0:56:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一 二 - 快抬\N{\rEng}- One. Two. - Lift it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.18,0:56:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,三\N{\rEng}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.89,0:56:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快把手抽出来 - 疼死了 疼死了\N{\rEng}- Take your arm out! - Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.24,0:56:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,操 操\N{\rEng}Fuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.40,0:56:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呦 你的胳膊\N{\rEng}Oh, fuck, your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.83,0:56:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,坐好 坐好 别看伤口\N{\rEng}Lean back. Lean back. Don't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.02,0:56:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我得弄个止血带 - 噢 操\N{\rEng}- I need to make a tourniquet. - Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.03,0:56:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过来 把手给我 - 你要干嘛？\N{\rEng}- Come here. Give me your arm. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.36,0:56:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要干嘛？ - 手给我\N{\rEng}- What are you doing? - Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.89,0:56:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 我的狗呢？\N{\rEng}- Fuck. - Where's my dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.31,0:56:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别管那狗了 手给我\N{\rEng}Don't worry about the dog! Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.73,0:56:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摩西 - 别乱动 别乱动\N{\rEng}- Moses. - Do nothing. Do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.01,0:56:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在呢 别担心\N{\rEng}I got you. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.31,0:56:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 快叫救护车\N{\rEng}Wally, call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.59,0:56:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？ - 不 我一点也不好\N{\rEng}- Are you good? - No, I'm not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.85,0:56:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的眼镜呢？\N{\rEng}Where are my glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.96,0:57:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你受伤没？你刚从楼板掉下去了\N{\rEng}I mean, are you hurt? You just fell through the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.62,0:57:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼 我得把房钱要回来\N{\rEng}Fucking horseshit. I'm getting our money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.81,0:57:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 咱们闯大祸了 得赶紧溜\N{\rEng}Marty, we gotta get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.91,0:57:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,才两块五 你别傻了\N{\rEng}It's $2.50. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.29,0:57:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的可不止两块五 你没懂吗？\N{\rEng}I'm asking for way more than $2.50. You see what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.60,0:57:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在这等着 等着\N{\rEng}Wait here. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.71,0:57:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等多久? - 十秒钟\N{\rEng}- For how long? - Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.88,0:57:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鞋 我的衣服\N{\rEng}My shoes, my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.65,0:57:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,全湿透了 你们怎么搞的\N{\rEng}Everything's soaking wet. It's a mess in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.81,0:57:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴吧 - 你得感谢没砸到你屋\N{\rEng}- Why don't you put a sock in it? - You wanna switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.41,0:57:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 是你 我跟你说过不能洗澡\N{\rEng}- Hey. - You! I... I told you not to use the fucking shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.95,0:57:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你才没说 是你把房租给我的 懂吗？\N{\rEng}No, you didn't. You're the one that rented me the room, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.01,0:57:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点摔死\N{\rEng}I could have broken my neck falling out of that ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.35,0:57:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再闹你现在也能死\N{\rEng}That can fucking still happen too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.92,0:57:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在威胁我吗？ - 对 对\N{\rEng}- Are you threatening me right now? - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.33,0:57:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 居然敢威胁我？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Rellay? You want to threaten me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.28,0:57:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地下室锁了 - 谁拿了钥匙？\N{\rEng}- Basement is locked! - Who's got the fucking key?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.26,0:57:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给我听好了 听好了 把房钱还给我\N{\rEng}Listen, man! Listen! I want my money for my room...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.11,0:57:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救护车来了 - ...我还要赔偿\N{\rEng}- Ambulance. - ...and I want a reimbursement
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.67,0:57:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的东西都毁了 - 你当真？\N{\rEng}- for my shit that got ruined. - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.92,0:57:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 废话 - 一分都不会给你\N{\rEng}- Yes! - You're not gonna get your shit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.39,0:57:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一共七块五 - 一分钱也不给\N{\rEng}- $7.50! - You'll get nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.48,0:57:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点帮我 - 医护来了\N{\rEng}- Come on. Help me! - Paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.71,0:57:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们可来了 - 病人在哪儿？\N{\rEng}- Good, you're here. - Where's the patient at?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.49,0:57:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那儿 手臂受伤了 流了好多血\N{\rEng}He's in here. It's his arm. He's lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.97,0:57:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\rEng}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.44,0:57:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 浴缸砸他身上了 - 浴缸砸他身上了？\N{\rEng}- Bathtub fell on him. - Bathtub fell on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.47,0:57:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我胳膊没知觉了\N{\rEng}I can't feel my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.71,0:57:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 你得替我照看好摩西\N{\rEng}Yo, Jimmy. Come on, you gotta help me with this dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.96,0:58:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我这儿没人手 - 那就送他去兽医那儿\N{\rEng}- I don't got nobody free. - We gotta get him to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.94,0:58:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真腾不出人手 - 他是我的家人\N{\rEng}- I got nobody free right now. - He's my family, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.50,0:58:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 把两块五还我 我就走 七块五不要了\N{\rEng}Listen, now. Just give me the $2.50, and I'll get outta here. Forget the $7.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.60,0:58:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把两块五给我就行 - 我做不了主\N{\rEng}- Just give me $2.50. - I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.06,0:58:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,明天找老板要\N{\rEng}See the owner tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.25,0:58:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小子 - 都怪你的\N{\rEng}- Kid. - It's your shitty ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.36,0:58:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 烂地板 - 小子 小子\N{\rEng}- in this crummy hotel. - Kid. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.06,0:58:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么都不给 - 什么？\N{\rEng}- I ain't giving you nothing. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.26,0:58:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 帮我把狗送到兽医那儿\N{\rEng}Kid. Come on. Just bring the dog to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.78,0:58:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我得工作 有活要干\N{\rEng}I can't. I got work. I got a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.59,0:58:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能被开除 - 你有工作？\N{\rEng}- I can't get fired. - You got a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.66,0:58:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我出双倍工钱 - 不 行不通 不行\N{\rEng}- I'll give you double what you're getting. - No, I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.59,0:58:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那就三倍 来吧\N{\rEng}I'll give you triple. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.14,0:58:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别乱动 别乱动 - 行吧\N{\rEng}- Take it easy. Calm down. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.86,0:58:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好 打开那个包 椅子上的包\N{\rEng}Okay, look in that bag. See the bag on the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.05,0:58:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对 把包打开\N{\rEng}Yeah, go in that bag, okay? Open it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.57,0:58:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我得给你上个止血带\N{\rEng}I'm gonna apply a tourniquet to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.31,0:58:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,换掉原来的\N{\rEng}I'm gonna remove the other tourniquet right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.28,0:58:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拿50给你自己\N{\rEng}Take 50 for yourself. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.19,0:58:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再拿50给兽医 明白吗？\N{\rEng}Bring 50 for the vet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.41,0:58:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有血喷出来\N{\rEng}We got blood squirting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.68,0:58:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,兽医在13街和1大道交口\N{\rEng}He's on 13th and 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.23,0:58:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他我一完事就赶过去 懂吗？\N{\rEng}And tell him I'll be there as soon as I can get there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.86,0:58:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然要给他钱？\N{\rEng}You're gonna give this motherfucker money?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.93,0:58:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是这混蛋砸的你\N{\rEng}He's the one who fuckin' dropped the tub on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.77,0:58:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过他别洗澡了\N{\rEng}I told him not to get in the fuckin' bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.54,0:58:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 你一看就靠谱\N{\rEng}Fucking mensch, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.10,0:58:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,准备抬 送他去贝尔维尤医院\N{\rEng}Stretcher ready? We'll take him to Bellevue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.85,0:58:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一看就靠谱\N{\rEng}Fucking mensch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.74,0:58:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在掉头送他去兽医还来得及\N{\rEng}We can still turn around and take him to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.82,0:58:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 不用\N{\rEng}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.89,0:59:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 50块绰绰有余了 - 什么比50大？是100块\N{\rEng}- Fifty dollars is more than enough. - You know what's better than 50? 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.21,0:59:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,100本钱能让咱大赚一笔\N{\rEng}We can clean house with a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你个贪心的犹太鬼\N{\rEng}Don't be greedy, you fucking Jew.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.24,0:59:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有1500美元罚款 你亲自拿给我的 别忘了 - 别叫了\N{\rEng}- No, no. It's a $1,500 fine. You're the one that showed it to me. - Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.08,0:59:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且我们还得连赌两周夜场 - 我们？\N{\rEng}- By the way, we gotta do this every night for two weeks, - "We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.53,0:59:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 否则我就去不了日本了 - 不 不 不\N{\rEng}- or else I can't go to Japan. - Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.93,0:59:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会因为你的错 为你耽误两周工作\N{\rEng}I'm not taking two weeks off work 'cause you fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.11,0:59:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来 吃点这个 吃点这个\N{\rEng}Hey. Take this, boy. Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.11,0:59:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吧 好孩子\N{\rEng}There you go. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.14,0:59:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把这狗的项圈解开\N{\rEng}Loosen up the collar on this motherfucker, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.30,0:59:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 他都喘不过气了\N{\rEng}- All right. - He sound like a radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.39,0:59:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们先去赌\N{\rEng}We're gonna go play,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.45,0:59:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,回来顺路再送他去兽医\N{\rEng}we'll drop him off at the vet on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.96,0:59:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这也就几个小时 - 马蒂 我有接送安排 别忘了\N{\rEng}- What's a couple of hours to this guy? - Marty, I got rides set up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.96,0:59:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,叫摩西\N{\rEng}Huh. Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.96,0:59:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,到你了 三号球道\N{\rEng}Lane three. That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.81,0:59:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 要点什么？\N{\rEng}- Hi, how you doing? - Could I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.61,0:59:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还有球道吗？\N{\rEng}Can I get a lane?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.49,1:00:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大概得等三四十分钟样子\N{\rEng}Probably gonna be a half hour, 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.63,1:00:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 你确定能等？\N{\rEng}- That's okay. - You all right with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.81,1:00:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在拿鞋吗？ - 我待会儿再拿\N{\rEng}- You want shoes? - I'll just grab 'em later.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.49,1:00:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,结束 输了\N{\rEng}Done. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.55,1:00:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,弱得可怜 给钱\N{\rEng}Fucking pathetic. Pay up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.44,1:00:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来下一局？\N{\rEng}Who wants next?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.67,1:00:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我来一局 嘿 怎么玩？\N{\rEng}Can I play? Hey! Can I play?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.69,1:00:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一块钱一局 - 行吧\N{\rEng}- It's a dollar a game. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.38,1:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么？ - 塞思\N{\rEng}- What's your name? - Seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.18,1:00:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,先来几回热热身吧\N{\rEng}Let's get a warm-up rally going.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.46,1:00:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 要打就押钱 否则滚蛋 我不白陪打\N{\rEng}Nah. Put up or shut up. I don't play for free.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.60,1:00:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 没听过这规矩\N{\rEng}All right. Never heard of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.86,1:00:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我管账 - 钱给他\N{\rEng}- I'm holding. - He's holding.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.17,1:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你管账？凭什么让他管？\N{\rEng}You're holding? Why is he holding?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.17,1:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你带钱了吗？ - 不许耍赖\N{\rEng}- Have you got yours? - Can I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.35,1:00:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 没问题\N{\rEng}Trust me, you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.83,1:00:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这句谁对谁？ - 塞思对阵罗杰\N{\rEng}- Where are we at? - All right, Seth vs. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.05,1:00:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一块钱一局\N{\rEng}Dollar game.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.69,1:00:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我发球\N{\rEng}I serve.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.37,1:00:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢？我还没准备好\N{\rEng}What are you doing? I'm not even looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.63,1:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1比0 - 我刚才都没看\N{\rEng}- One-zip. - I wasn't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.45,1:00:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 不能用手接球 - 什么？\N{\rEng}- No, you can't do that. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.08,1:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是接不到球\N{\rEng}You gotta let the ball hit the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就得让球自己落地 我得分\N{\rEng}You can't catch it with your paddle. My point.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.07,1:00:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在扯什么？ - 手接球不算\N{\rEng}- What are you talking about? - You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.50,1:01:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拍子接不住就得让球落地\N{\rEng}You gotta let the ball fall off the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.18,1:01:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 胡说八道 - 你犯规了\N{\rEng}- That's ridiculous. - You're cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.54,1:01:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我犯规了？ - 对 这就叫犯规\N{\rEng}- I'm cheating? - Yeah, that's called cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.35,1:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没按规矩来 - 行吧 分给你\N{\rEng}- You're not following the rules. - Fine. Take the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.02,1:01:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 把球给我 - 1比1\N{\rEng}- Thank you. Give me the ball. - One-one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.12,1:01:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\rEng}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.20,1:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好险 - 打得好 打得好\N{\rEng}- That was close. - That was good. That was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.64,1:01:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不 不 不\N{\rEng}Oh. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.39,1:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,收着吧 收着吧\N{\rEng}No, no. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.53,1:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我本该让你五分的 伙计\N{\rEng}I should have spotted you, like, five points, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.91,1:01:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天够倒霉了 留着吧\N{\rEng}You've had a rough enough day already. Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.35,1:01:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计 谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you, brother. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.69,1:01:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没事儿\N{\rEng}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.15,1:01:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,打得不错\N{\rEng}Good game.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.18,1:01:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 亚当 亚当 该你了\N{\rEng}All right, Adam. Adam, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.49,1:01:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想押多少？ - 五毛\N{\rEng}- What do you want to put on? - I can go 50 cents.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.83,1:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你手里有球吗？\N{\rEng}You got a ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.98,1:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你鼻子怎么回事？\N{\rEng}What happened to your nose?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.41,1:01:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我有球 我有球\N{\rEng}I got one, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.81,1:01:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有人赖账跑了\N{\rEng}Fare ran out on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.28,1:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,赖什么账？怎么回事？\N{\rEng}Fare from what? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.71,1:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我开出租的 曼哈顿来的\N{\rEng}I'm a taxi driver. From Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.79,1:01:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼哈顿？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Manhattan? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.10,1:01:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那路费可不便宜 伙计\N{\rEng}That's an expensive trip, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是 大概20块到25块呢\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah. $20, $25.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.89,1:01:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,碰上有钱的主儿\N{\rEng}Well, the high rollers tip five,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.82,1:01:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再给5块小费\N{\rEng}so that's five in tips. And...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚把他送到 那人从后面掐住我脖子\N{\rEng}I fucking get to the spot, the guy chokes me out,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.15,1:01:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朝我后脑勺猛揍 - 不会吧\N{\rEng}- punching me in the back of the head. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.07,1:01:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后抢了钱就跑\N{\rEng}Takes my money and run the fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.54,1:02:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我追上那混蛋 你猜怎么着\N{\rEng}Caught up to the motherfucker, and, boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.69,1:02:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他揍得眼冒金星\N{\rEng}I beat the brights off that motherfucker, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.33,1:02:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他搜刮了个遍\N{\rEng}And I took what he had.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.08,1:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他搜刮了？\N{\rEng}You took what he had?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.11,1:02:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然 谁他妈的会放过\N{\rEng}Hell, yeah! You fucking damn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.55,1:02:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你把钱踹你兜里？ - 当然了\N{\rEng}- You added that to your roll? - Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.02,1:02:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那厚厚一大摞钞票\N{\rEng}To that fat roll I've seen you pulling out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.49,1:02:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是原则问题 他妈的原则\N{\rEng}It's principle. It's fucking principle!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.87,1:02:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 但是建议你把钱藏好\N{\rEng}I understand that. I would keep it hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿这种地方 最好别显摆\N{\rEng}I would keep that down, if I were you, in this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.45,1:02:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是谁都像他那么面善\N{\rEng}Not everybody's as nice as Christian is, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.79,1:02:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这分是我的\N{\rEng}That's my point.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.49,1:02:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那打球的臭小子是谁？\N{\rEng}What about that asshole right there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.46,1:02:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道那是谁\N{\rEng}I don't know who the fuck that guy is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.36,1:02:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能这么发球 - 为什么不能？\N{\rEng}- You can't serve like that. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.30,1:02:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么发球都好几年了\N{\rEng}I've been serving like that for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.52,1:02:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 罗杰 罗杰 给你说话呢 - 你们的规则真荒唐\N{\rEng}- Hey, Roger. Roger. Hello. - That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.36,1:02:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再打一分钟 - 球道轮到我们了\N{\rEng}- Give me one more minute. - Our lane is open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.89,1:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回来再打保龄球 - 不行 现在就得去\N{\rEng}- The lane can wait. It's fine. - No, we gotta go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.98,1:02:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要不然就让给别人了 - 我正打乒乓呢\N{\rEng}- They're gonna give it away. - I'm playing now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.74,1:02:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为了打保龄球我都等一晚上了 赶紧的 快走\N{\rEng}I have been waiting all night to bowl. Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.14,1:02:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰\N{\rEng}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.85,1:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我得分 - 瞎喊什么的\N{\rEng}- My point. - Look what you made me do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.83,1:02:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不玩了\N{\rEng}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.79,1:02:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 把那一块钱还我\N{\rEng}- What do you mean you gotta go? - Give me my dollar back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.11,1:02:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛还没打完呢\N{\rEng}We're in the middle of a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.33,1:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你走就算弃权 把我的钱也给我\N{\rEng}You forfeit the game, then. Give me my dollar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.18,1:02:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把我的钱也给我 - 别激动 退后点\N{\rEng}- Give me my dollar back! - Relax. Back up, back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.11,1:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他弃权了 - 打完再给\N{\rEng}- He's gonna leave the game? - You didn't finish the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.42,1:02:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 那你接着打 你来打\N{\rEng}All right, then you play. Then you play.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.67,1:02:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没钱了 最后十块都给他了\N{\rEng}I'm broke, man. I gave him my last ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.41,1:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你打\N{\rEng}I'll play you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.52,1:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔\N{\rEng}Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.11,1:03:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哇塞 你们这种人也会玩桌球了\N{\rEng}Oh, wow. I didn't know you guys played table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.88,1:03:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一块一局 你玩得起吗？\N{\rEng}Put up a dollar. Do you have a dollar?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.74,1:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去你的 我押五块 - 你哪来的五块钱\N{\rEng}- Fuck you. Put up five. - You don't have five dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.70,1:03:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哇塞 你肯定是抢来的吧\N{\rEng}Oh, wow. You must have robbed someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.74,1:03:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有种你也把钱亮出来\N{\rEng}Put your money where your mouth is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.01,1:03:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我亮出家伙 教你做人\N{\rEng}Why don't I put my penis where your mouth is?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.29,1:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,计分的 沃利对阵这个混蛋\N{\rEng}Red shirt, Wally and whatever the fuck his name is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.61,1:03:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,先别计分 回来再打\N{\rEng}Mark it blank, baby. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.54,1:03:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪？\N{\rEng}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.49,1:03:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先不计分\N{\rEng}I will mark it blank!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.13,1:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看什么热闹呢？\N{\rEng}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.31,1:03:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这黑小子要把钱输光了\N{\rEng}The colored boy is about to lose all his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.12,1:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 都输给这混蛋了\N{\rEng}Yeah, to this asshole right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.98,1:03:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 赛点\N{\rEng}- Fuck! - Match point.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.48,1:03:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赛点 来了 - 沃利 加油\N{\rEng}- Match point. Here we go. - Wally! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.53,1:03:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 加油别泄气\N{\rEng}Don't get upset though, Wally. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.24,1:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了\N{\rEng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.48,1:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,球擦边了 都他妈看见了吧\N{\rEng}It grazed the edge. You fucking saw that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.94,1:03:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没擦边\N{\rEng}It didn't graze the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.30,1:04:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 球变向了 这看见了吧 - 没擦边\N{\rEng}- It changed. You saw that. - It didn't graze the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.90,1:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱给我 - 搞什么鬼?\N{\rEng}- No, give me my money. - What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.09,1:04:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱给我 - 这简直...\N{\rEng}- Give me my money. - This is b--
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.95,1:04:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我 钱给我\N{\rEng}Give me the money. Give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.62,1:04:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱给我 - 求你了\N{\rEng}- Pay me. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.71,1:04:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,留我五块油钱行吗？\N{\rEng}Let me hold five for gas money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.70,1:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你没钱还赌\N{\rEng}No. You shouldn't bet with money you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.87,1:04:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 车没油了 我怎么回家？ - 用脚\N{\rEng}- How the fuck am I gonna get home? - Walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.57,1:04:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就给他留五块吧\N{\rEng}Just let him keep five.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.85,1:04:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 你今晚够混蛋了\N{\rEng}- No. - You've been a dick all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.04,1:04:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给钱 - 别再贪这点钱了\N{\rEng}- Give me my money. - Just stop being greedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.18,1:04:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 留他五块回家钱吧 - 太坑人了\N{\rEng}- Just give him five to get home! - This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.39,1:04:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是厚颜无耻 - 去死吧你\N{\rEng}- And you're fucking smiling. - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.40,1:04:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我 把钱给我\N{\rEng}Give me the money. Give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.17,1:04:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\rEng}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.99,1:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 给他留五块吧 - 不给\N{\rEng}- Yo, give him his five. - I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.79,1:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么回家啊\N{\rEng}How the fuck am I gonna get home?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.35,1:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你吹牛的下场\N{\rEng}That's what happens when you talk shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.74,1:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 滋味不好受吧？ - 混蛋\N{\rEng}- It stinks, doesn't it? - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.04,1:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗杰在哪儿 快出来？ - 该死\N{\rEng}- Where's-- Where's Roger? - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.79,1:04:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来了 - 快来 罗杰\N{\rEng}- Yeah, I got it. - Yeah, Rog!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.49,1:04:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,跟这混蛋打一局 把他油钱赢回来\N{\rEng}Play this numbnuts for his gas money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.35,1:04:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你得跟罗杰打 明白吗？\N{\rEng}You're gonna play Roger now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.29,1:04:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油 罗杰 - 加油\N{\rEng}- Let's go, Roger. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.68,1:04:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 别磨蹭 - 你？\N{\rEng}- Let's go right now. - You?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.78,1:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不跟你打 你太厉害了\N{\rEng}I won't play you. You're too good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.26,1:04:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你4分\N{\rEng}I'll spot you four points.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.02,1:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,行 赌40块\N{\rEng}Fine. Forty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.60,1:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,40块？我没这么多钱\N{\rEng}Forty dollars? I don't have forty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.45,1:04:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爱打就打 不打拉倒 我得走了\N{\rEng}You want it? Take it or leave it. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.65,1:04:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 40块 - 一 二 三...\N{\rEng}- Forty dollars. - One, two, three...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.67,1:04:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谁还有钱 谁还有钱？\N{\rEng}Come on, who's got cash? Who's got cash?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.82,1:04:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我帮你 - 都帮沃利出点\N{\rEng}- I got you. - It's Team Wally. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.59,1:04:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,来 来 来 都凑一凑 凑一凑 送他回家\N{\rEng}Pitch in, pitch in. Let's get him home. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.64,1:05:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 真谢谢大家\N{\rEng}Thank you, everybody. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.18,1:05:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一定给你赚出回家钱 一定\N{\rEng}We're gonna get you home. We're gonna get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.41,1:05:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 你们不出钱吗？\N{\rEng}All right. Great. Great. Nothing? This whole row?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.35,1:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我跟你单下一注\N{\rEng}Yo, I'll put a side bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.73,1:05:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,赌多少？\N{\rEng}How much?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.84,1:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五块 - 你就这点钱？\N{\rEng}- Five dollars. - You don't got more than that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.42,1:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,十块 哟 还有点钱嘛\N{\rEng}Ten. Ooh, you got a little bit of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.51,1:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 非常感谢\N{\rEng}Thank you. Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.73,1:05:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,174 175 176\N{\rEng}One seventy-four, 175, 176,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.70,1:05:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,177 178 179 180 181...\N{\rEng}177, 178, 179, 180, 181...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.90,1:05:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,181 182 183...\N{\rEng}181, 182, 183...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.37,1:05:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小毛毛回来了 宝贝 - ...184 185...\N{\rEng}- The Mouse is back, baby. - ...184, 185...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.01,1:05:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - ...186\N{\rEng}- Yeah! - ...186
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.71,1:05:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小毛毛回来了 宝贝 - ...187 192...\N{\rEng}- The Mouse is back, baby! - ...187, 192...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.87,1:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 我最爱这段 - ...197 202 207...\N{\rEng}- Oh, this is my part. - ...197, 202, 207...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.34,1:05:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\N{\rEng}What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.72,1:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\rEng}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.60,1:06:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,白跑了 关门了\N{\rEng}Fuck. It's closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.25,1:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去下个镇子吧 - 下个镇子？马上就没油了\N{\rEng}- Let's just go to the next town. - Next town? That shit is 20 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.94,1:06:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真是乖孩子 真是乖孩子\N{\rEng}You see what we do? Who's a good boy? Who's a good boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.34,1:06:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 400... - 过来 宝贝\N{\rEng}- 400... - Come over here, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.79,1:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...401 402 403...\N{\rEng}...401, 402, 403...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.47,1:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他呼吸顺畅多了\N{\rEng}His breathing's a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.06,1:06:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们也许不用给兽医送钱了\N{\rEng}We might not have to give the vet any money.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.49,1:06:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...407 408\N{\rEng}...407, 408.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.45,1:06:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,408块 每人204块 咱俩平分\N{\rEng}408. That's 204 each. That's 50-50.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.52,1:06:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,给 拿着\N{\rEng}Here, here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.82,1:06:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 要不你先把钱都给我\N{\rEng}Wally, I was thinking. If you give me the full amount now,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.09,1:06:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我从日本回来给你十倍\N{\rEng}I can give you ten times that when I get back from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.27,1:06:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹 小毛毛 - 你什么意思？\N{\rEng}- Stop, stop. Stop, Mouse. - No, no, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.69,1:06:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别想拿坑别人的那套来坑我\N{\rEng}You're not gonna fuck me like you do everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.00,1:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到罚单了 别忘了 - 毛毛\N{\rEng}- You saw the fine. You saw it. - Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.74,1:06:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来还你十倍\N{\rEng}I'm gonna be coming home with ten times that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.26,1:06:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我给你买个出租车牌照 - 别拿牌照忽悠我 毛毛\N{\rEng}- I'll buy you a medallion. - I don't want no fucking medallion, Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.94,1:06:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那给你买辆新车 别难为我\N{\rEng}I'll buy you a new cab. Don't give me a hard time about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.61,1:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿\N{\rEng}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.06,1:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,逮到你了 王八蛋\N{\rEng}Hey, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.75,1:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,完了 马蒂 马蒂 快上车 快上车\N{\rEng}Oh, fuck. Marty. Marty, let's go. Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.05,1:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别慌 别慌 - 快上车\N{\rEng}- Okay, just let me do the talking. - Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.01,1:07:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,逮到他了 搞死这王八蛋\N{\rEng}Look who it is! Let's get this motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,几位 晚上好\N{\rEng}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.79,1:07:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？哥几个还好吧？\N{\rEng}What's going on? How are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.76,1:07:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱还我们 - 你们在说什么？\N{\rEng}- Give us our money! - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.48,1:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正给这哥们加油呢 - 看看这是谁\N{\rEng}- I'm giving this guy some gas. - Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.14,1:07:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别玩这套!\N{\rEng}Don't pull that shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.31,1:07:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你他妈设局坑我们 - 我没设局\N{\rEng}- You fucking hustled us! - I didn't hustle anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.79,1:07:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我认出你了 你是他妈的马蒂·毛瑟\N{\rEng}I know who you are! You're fuckin' Marty Mauser!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.10,1:07:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 冷静点 - 我就没听说过这个名字\N{\rEng}- Relax! - I don't know who that is!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.60,1:07:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰 住手 住手\N{\rEng}Roger! Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.08,1:07:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别冲动 有话好说\N{\rEng}No, relax. Relax. Relax. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.83,1:07:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出这破车\N{\rEng}Out of the fucking car!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.29,1:07:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出这破车 你这黑鬼\N{\rEng}Get out of the fucking car, nigger!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.17,1:07:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凭什么要我... - 滚出来\N{\rEng}- Why I gotta be-- - Get the fuck out!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.77,1:07:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,去你们的\N{\rEng}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.35,1:07:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 赶快上车 - 去你们的\N{\rEng}- Marty, let's fucking go! - Fuck yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.43,1:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走 快走\N{\rEng}Go, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.77,1:07:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 注意 注意 电线杆\N{\rEng}Wally, watch out! Watch out! The pole!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.80,1:07:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\rEng}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.10,1:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 狗掉了 狗掉下去了 沃利\N{\rEng}Wally, the dog. The dog, Wally.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.95,1:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 管他的狗 - 不能丢下那狗\N{\rEng}- Fuck that dog! - I need the dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.09,1:07:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的狗\N{\rEng}Fuck the dog,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.19,1:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 不 不 - 也去你的 去你的\N{\rEng}- Oh, no. No! - and fuck you, man! Fuck you, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.13,1:07:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我这回赔大了\N{\rEng}They'll take this out of my paycheck!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.69,1:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,车都废了 得从我工资里扣 我要丢工作了\N{\rEng}My car's fucked up, man! I'm gonna lose my fucking job!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.91,1:08:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我全部生计 我还有家要养呢\N{\rEng}This is all I got! I got people depending on me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.71,1:08:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有一大堆担子要扛 - 我也有啊\N{\rEng}- I got real responsibilities! - I got responsibilities too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.12,1:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有个屁 - 你他妈觉得...\N{\rEng}- No, you don't! - What the fuck you think--
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.82,1:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太感谢你了 太感谢了\N{\rEng}Thank you so much. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.76,1:08:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的\N{\rEng}I'm gonna make it up to you. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.05,1:08:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别生我气 行吗?\N{\rEng}Don't be mad at me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.97,1:08:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你买辆新出租 真的\N{\rEng}I'm gonna get you a new cab. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.81,1:08:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 沃利 我的好兄弟\N{\rEng}Don't worry about it. Wally, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.61,1:08:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,关门好吗\N{\rEng}Close my door.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.05,1:09:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 马蒂\N{\rEng}Hey, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.30,1:09:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 泰德 - 嘿 马蒂 近来怎样？\N{\rEng}- Hey, Ted. - Hey, Marty. How you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.03,1:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 劳伦斯在吗？ - 听说令尊的事情了 请节哀\N{\rEng}- Is Lawrence here? - Sorry about your loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.57,1:09:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 劳伦斯来了吗？\N{\rEng}It's all right. Is Lawrence here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.99,1:09:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来了 应该就在里边吧\N{\rEng}Uh, yeah. He's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.76,1:09:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 我去找下 谢了 - 行 行\N{\rEng}- Okay. All right. Thank you. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.70,1:09:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回来伙计 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Good to see you, man. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.38,1:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 近来可好？\N{\rEng}- Hi, Marty. - How you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.56,1:09:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好久不见 - 你好 你好\N{\rEng}- Nice to see you. - Hello, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.44,1:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚能借住你后屋吗 求你了\N{\rEng}Hey, can I stay in your back room tonight, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.13,1:09:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 你的小妞在后头呢 知道吗？\N{\rEng}Hey, hey. Got your girl in the back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.30,1:09:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她怀孕了 现在心情挺糟的\N{\rEng}She pregnant. She real upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.03,1:09:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 好吧 知道了\N{\rEng}Oh, God. Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.03,1:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去看看她\N{\rEng}Uh, let me go talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.53,1:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但你千万别走开 我马上回来\N{\rEng}but then please don't leave without finding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.18,1:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放心 我就在这儿 - 好 很高兴见到你\N{\rEng}- Yeah, I'll be here. Okay. - All right. Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.14,1:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也很高兴见到你 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- All right, good to see you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.65,1:10:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你来这干嘛啊？\N{\rEng}Hey. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.06,1:10:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想麻烦你 我知道你很忙\N{\rEng}I don't mean to bother you. I know you're really busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.72,1:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这脸怎么回事 谁干的？ - 我真没地方落脚了\N{\rEng}- What the hell happened to your face? - I didn't really have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.35,1:10:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 他突然就开始...\N{\rEng}- Let me see. - He just started...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.54,1:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他突然就开始朝我大吼\N{\rEng}he just started yelling at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.04,1:10:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跟疯了一样 还扯我的衣服不撒手\N{\rEng}And he was really mad and he was ripping my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.59,1:10:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他打的？ - 他把我吓坏了\N{\rEng}- He did this to you? - He was really scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.92,1:10:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我真没别处可去了\N{\rEng}I just didn't know where else to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.99,1:10:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你会怪我吗？\N{\rEng}Are you mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.34,1:11:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋？\N{\rEng}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.70,1:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是瑞秋 是马蒂 开门\N{\rEng}No, it's not Rachel. It's Marty. Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.16,1:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等下\N{\rEng}Okay. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.56,1:11:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么来...\N{\rEng}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.81,1:11:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,活该\N{\rEng}Shame on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.95,1:12:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 迪翁 你好啊 真是打扰了\N{\rEng}Hey, Dion. How you doing, man? I really appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.74,1:12:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我妹妹 瑞秋\N{\rEng}This is my sister Rachel, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.26,1:12:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 这是我朋友 也是我生意伙伴迪翁\N{\rEng}Rachel, this is my buddy, my business partner, Dion.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.43,1:12:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\rEng}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.68,1:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她家被水淹了\N{\rEng}Her place flooded.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.02,1:12:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她得借宿一晚 不麻烦吧？\N{\rEng}She needs a place to crash for the night. That's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.21,1:12:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我说不好\N{\rEng}I don't know, man, it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.29,1:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 但我不能让她住在都发霉有毒的地方啊\N{\rEng}I know, but I can't have her exposed to mold and spores and shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.32,1:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 帮个忙 她都怀孕八个月了 懂吗？\N{\rEng}D, come on, she's eight months pregnant, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.51,1:12:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,帮个忙\N{\rEng}Come on...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.76,1:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子是我外甥\N{\rEng}That's my nephew.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.20,1:12:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我家规矩不让带别人回来的\N{\rEng}I'm not supposed to have people over.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.80,1:12:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她家真没法住了 我不能让她回去 求你了\N{\rEng}She's got a bad situation at home. I can't have her going back there. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.20,1:12:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 那就住一晚\N{\rEng}All right. Come on. You can spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.79,1:12:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但明天我爸妈回来前就得离开\N{\rEng}You just gotta be out of here by tomorrow before my parents get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.23,1:12:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\rEng}Okay. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.31,1:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们得趁碰这次碰面好好商量下\N{\rEng}We should take advantage of the time we have together.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.07,1:12:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把生意计划好好商量一下\N{\rEng}You know, really firm up our business plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.57,1:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你爸一回来 肯定对你另眼相看\N{\rEng}That way, when your dad gets back, he sees how organized we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.90,1:12:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 他挺失望的\N{\rEng}Yeah, he's pretty upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.26,1:12:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这堆货丢这儿 你八个月都没管\N{\rEng}You left us with all of this inventory for eight months.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.01,1:12:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 几周后我拿下世界冠军\N{\rEng}That's fine. In a few weeks I'll take the championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.03,1:12:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会重回正轨\N{\rEng}We'll be right back on track.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.12,1:12:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 球就都在这儿 - 真的？哪儿？\N{\rEng}- Balls are right in here. - Really? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.89,1:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,最上头的箱子\N{\rEng}The top box.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.54,1:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.67,1:13:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 你做出橙球了？ - 是\N{\rEng}- Whoa. You did the orange? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.05,1:13:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做的？\N{\rEng}How'd you do the orange?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.15,1:13:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我联系了哈克斯公司\N{\rEng}I contacted someone at Halex.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.72,1:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给塑料上的色\N{\rEng}They colored the celluloid for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.28,1:13:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么办到的？ - 花钱 宝贝\N{\rEng}- How? - Money, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.76,1:13:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我老爸都看好你\N{\rEng}Me and my pop, we believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.45,1:13:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们投了钱的 你消失了 所以他挺生气的\N{\rEng}We're invested. That's why he's been so mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.02,1:13:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个 瑞秋\N{\rEng}Check it out, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.70,1:13:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来 看看这包装\N{\rEng}Here, check out the packaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,“至尊马蒂牌 马蒂·毛瑟冠军赛官方用球”\N{\rEng}"Marty Supreme. The official Marty Mauser championship table tennis ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.48,1:13:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,“精心打造 橙球...”\N{\rEng}Professionally made. Orange..."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.88,1:13:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这宣传词 你想出来了？\N{\rEng}Orange spheres? You came up with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.61,1:13:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不错吧\N{\rEng}Yeah. Pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.76,1:13:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不错吧？迪翁 这让我刮目相看\N{\rEng}Pretty good? Dion, this is... I'm stunned.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.13,1:13:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刮目相看\N{\rEng}I'm stunned.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.33,1:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且还是手绘的 - 你画的？\N{\rEng}- Hand-drawn too. - You drew this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.10,1:13:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 真是神来之笔\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - It's inspired.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.51,1:13:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖\N{\rEng}I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.38,1:13:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不知道自己多有能耐\N{\rEng}I don't think you know what you're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.35,1:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你瞧瞧 - 过奖\N{\rEng}- Check it out. - Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.88,1:13:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\rEng}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.15,1:13:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很漂亮\N{\rEng}it's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.71,1:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是你房间？ - 不是 是我弟弟的\N{\rEng}- This is your room? - No, it's my brother's.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.79,1:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有弟弟？你怎么没跟我说过\N{\rEng}You have a brother? You never told me you had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.24,1:13:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经毕业了 搬出去住了\N{\rEng}It's a younger brother. He moved out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.67,1:13:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那这房间空着？\N{\rEng}So his room is free?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.26,1:13:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 对 - 我先去安顿一下我妹\N{\rEng}- Uh, yeah. - Let me get my sister situated.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.72,1:13:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五分钟后去找你 - 行\N{\rEng}- I'll come find you in five minutes. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.20,1:13:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,马上见\N{\rEng}Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.43,1:13:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 你真让我刮目相看\N{\rEng}I'm really impressed, D.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.01,1:13:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过奖 - 真佩服你\N{\rEng}- Thank you. - Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.38,1:13:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙真不一般\N{\rEng}Special guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.69,1:14:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我去把床弄好 你就安心躺着吧\N{\rEng}Let me get the bed comfortable for you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.03,1:14:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就要走了吗？\N{\rEng}So are you gonna go out there now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.32,1:14:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我得琢磨下明天的计划\N{\rEng}Yeah, I gotta figure my plan out for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.40,1:14:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？什么计划？\N{\rEng}Why? Plan for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.65,1:14:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把心态收拾好\N{\rEng}Well, I need to get my head together.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.65,1:14:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么个收拾法儿？\N{\rEng}How so?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.16,1:14:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有个有钱佬找我干活 我打算联系他\N{\rEng}This rich guy hit me up for a job. I think I'm gonna get in touch with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.94,1:14:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 是啊\N{\rEng}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.13,1:14:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么活？干什么？ - 不重要 能去日本就行\N{\rEng}- A job for what? What job? - It doesn't matter. Just to get to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.28,1:14:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去打世锦赛吗？ - 对\N{\rEng}- For the championship? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.33,1:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\rEng}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.15,1:14:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,生活一团糟 我会找到出路的\N{\rEng}Everything in my life is falling apart, but I'm gonna figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.13,1:14:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗？我可以帮你\N{\rEng}Do you need any help? I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.98,1:14:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事 不用了 - 要帮忙吗？\N{\rEng}- No, it's all right. It's all right. - Can I do anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.80,1:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你饿吗？\N{\rEng}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.14,1:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不饿 - 确定？\N{\rEng}- No. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.87,1:14:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你休息吧 我就在隔壁\N{\rEng}Uh, I'll just be in the other room, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.14,1:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迪翁 这球是绝无仅有的 - 我就说吧 老兄\N{\rEng}- Dion, I've never seen anything like this. - I told you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.90,1:14:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 咱们得好好叙叙旧\N{\rEng}Man, we have to have a big catch-up
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.38,1:14:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是八个月来我经历的最好的事\N{\rEng}'cause this is the greatest thing that's happened to me in the last eight months.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.27,1:14:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,找哈克斯 真天才啊\N{\rEng}Who would've thought? Halex?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.50,1:15:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 罗克韦尔墨业公司\N{\rEng}Good morning. Rockwell Ink.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.34,1:15:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你好 麻烦帮我接米尔顿·罗克韦尔先生\N{\rEng}Yes, hi, can I speak to Milton Rockwell, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.82,1:15:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他暂时不在 需要留个言吗？\N{\rEng}He's not in at the moment. Can I take a message?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.90,1:15:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他什么时候回来？\N{\rEng}Okay, when are you expecting him?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.19,1:15:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他今天外出\N{\rEng}Well, he's working off-site today.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.13,1:15:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要不要留言？ - 小心烫\N{\rEng}- Again, can I take a message? - It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.99,1:15:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太感谢了\N{\rEng}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.32,1:15:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等我妹醒了 能给她也弄份吗？\N{\rEng}Can you make some for my sister for when she wakes up?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.22,1:15:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她肯定饿得要命 - 喂？\N{\rEng}- She'll be really hungry. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.81,1:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚说他外出 具体在哪儿？\N{\rEng}You said off-site where?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 这个信息我不能透露\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, I can't give you that information.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.08,1:15:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您到底要不要留言？ - 要\N{\rEng}- Would you like to leave a message or not? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.00,1:15:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能替我向他道个歉吗？\N{\rEng}Can you apologize to him on my behalf?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.48,1:15:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是原本今早要和他一起吃早饭的\N{\rEng}I was the young gentleman that was supposed to have breakfast
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.48,1:15:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那个年轻人\N{\rEng}with him this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.59,1:15:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我对这事不熟 - 就是他儿子那个营的\N{\rEng}- I'm not familiar. - From his son's battalion.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.00,1:15:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我 我对此一无所知\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, I-- I don't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.82,1:15:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我手上有他儿子的遗物 要交给他\N{\rEng}I have some personal belongings of his son's I was supposed to give to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.74,1:15:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,信件啊纪念品什么的 但我睡过头来不及了\N{\rEng}Letters and mementos and such, but I messed up and I overslept.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.85,1:15:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天就要走了 要不我回头寄给他？\N{\rEng}I'm leaving town today, but I could mail it to him if that's easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.81,1:15:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 不行 - 不行？好的\N{\rEng}- No, no, no. - No? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.88,1:15:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 你给莫罗斯科剧院打个电话问问\N{\rEng}How about this, why don't you try giving a call over to the Morosco Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.54,1:15:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好 莫罗斯科剧院\N{\rEng}The Morosco Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.92,1:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我算什么？我这是干嘛啊\N{\rEng}So, I'm like what? What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.51,1:15:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真不该来 好好晚上被你毁了\N{\rEng}Coming up here to wreck my night.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.36,1:15:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 妈 你怎么会在这种地方\N{\rEng}Honest, Mama, I didn't even know you were coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.82,1:15:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了你这套把戏\N{\rEng}I'm through with you playing games.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.08,1:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是来找点乐子\N{\rEng}I was just coming for a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.33,1:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听说应召女郎都在这儿\N{\rEng}I heard this was where all the call girls gather.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.81,1:16:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力攒钱重建生活 你不明白吗？\N{\rEng}I'm trying to rebuild my life here. Don't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.63,1:16:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是出卖自己吧\N{\rEng}More like selling out to the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.91,1:16:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你没资格评判我 小杰\N{\rEng}You've got no right to judge me, Jed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.42,1:16:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我拼尽全力才换来那么一点幸福\N{\rEng}I fought tooth and nail for every shred of happiness
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.63,1:16:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我拼尽全力... - 那你给过我什么？\N{\rEng}- I've ever found while you... - Right, and what did you give to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.92,1:16:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你从没相信过我 一次都没有\N{\rEng}You never believed in me. Not once!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.25,1:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,少装可怜 你自生自灭吧\N{\rEng}You wanna wallow in self-pity? Well, here's an oven, Jed!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.58,1:16:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔玛 别\N{\rEng}Alma!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.69,1:16:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 亨利\N{\rEng}I'm all right, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.77,1:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我们点时间 - 我妈就是个婊子\N{\rEng}- Just give us a minute, please. - My mama is a dirty bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.11,1:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴放干净点 杰迪代亚\N{\rEng}Be careful now, Jedidiah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.10,1:16:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你给她的那身花衣服 只是掩盖她的耻辱\N{\rEng}And that fancy dress you put her in is the only thing keeping in the stench!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.64,1:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别打我儿子\N{\rEng}Don't you lay a hand on my child.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.91,1:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我...抱歉\N{\rEng}I-I'm sorry, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.55,1:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 完蛋了\N{\rEng}Mama, what did I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.79,1:16:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快跑\N{\rEng}Go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.42,1:16:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁把门锁了 - 真会打断\N{\rEng}- The door is locked. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.84,1:17:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谁锁的啊\N{\rEng}You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.22,1:17:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,正演戏呢？谁干的 谁给锁的啊\N{\rEng}For Christ's sake, did somebody put a latch on the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.52,1:17:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢天呐 - 我们刚进入节奏\N{\rEng}- Oh, God. - I thought we had a good rhythm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.02,1:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,进入节奏？演成这样叫节奏？还我们？\N{\rEng}A good rhythm going? On what planet is that a good rhythm
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.29,1:17:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不顾其他人吗？ - 我入戏了\N{\rEng}- if you're alone in a room? - I was in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.73,1:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得跟我不在场一样 入戏？独角戏？\N{\rEng}It's like I wasn't even there. In it? In what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.49,1:17:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 格伦 我连句台词都插不进去 - 我懂 咱们会解决的\N{\rEng}- Glenn, I couldn't get a word out. - I understand. We're gonna fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.32,1:17:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 排练就是为了解决这些 - 真绝了\N{\rEng}- That's what a rehearsal process is for. - Fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.68,1:17:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,先停一下吧 大家休息五分钟\N{\rEng}Let's lose this, by the way. Everybody take five.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.89,1:17:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,帮个忙 各位...\N{\rEng}Do me a favor, everybody...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.33,1:17:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,得有人跟他说说这事\N{\rEng}Somebody needs to tell him something.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.62,1:17:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真离谱 - 真离谱\N{\rEng}- It's impossible. - Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.94,1:17:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喝水吗？ - 喝\N{\rEng}- Do you want some water? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.75,1:17:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去给你拿点 - 天呐\N{\rEng}- Let me bring you some. - God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.81,1:17:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 凯\N{\rEng}Hey, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.41,1:17:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 马蒂\N{\rEng}Hey, it's Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.75,1:17:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦那个\N{\rEng}From London.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.50,1:17:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么跑这了？\N{\rEng}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.68,1:17:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来见个朋友 他搞舞台的\N{\rEng}Well, I got a friend in the stagehands union.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.34,1:17:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我过来给他送点东西\N{\rEng}I was dropping something off for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.64,1:17:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚才看了吧 - 看了 没关系吧\N{\rEng}- You watched that? - Yeah, I hope that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.77,1:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.90,1:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你又开始演戏了\N{\rEng}Hey, I can't believe you're acting again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.23,1:17:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那不叫演戏 他老抢我戏\N{\rEng}That wasn't acting. He won't let me act.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.40,1:17:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,挺气人的 那家伙什么来头？\N{\rEng}Yeah, no, that looked frustrating. What's the deal with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.07,1:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别提了\N{\rEng}Don't get me started.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.35,1:18:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,即便被抢戏 你也比他演得好\N{\rEng}Yeah, you were running circles around him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.89,1:18:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那还用说\N{\rEng}Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.12,1:18:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对 演得真好\N{\rEng}Yeah. It was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.75,1:18:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他连续三天不睡觉\N{\rEng}He stays up for three days in a row
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.41,1:18:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了要演得累\N{\rEng}because his character is supposed to be tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.75,1:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是疯了 - 对啊\N{\rEng}- It's obnoxious. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.01,1:18:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他要真投入 怎么会因为那锁打断？\N{\rEng}If he's so committed, why'd he stop the scene?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.11,1:18:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛不一脚踹开？\N{\rEng}Why didn't he punch his hand through the screen,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.01,1:18:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,接着演呢？\N{\rEng}unlock it from the other side?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.66,1:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对吧？换我会这么干 - 格伦\N{\rEng}- Right? That's what I would've done. - Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.76,1:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就来 - 格伦\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.70,1:18:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 来了 - 我跟你说句话\N{\rEng}- Yes. Thank you. Yes. - I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.26,1:18:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 你说怎么了\N{\rEng}- Yes, what? - What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.57,1:18:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这小子比他更懂这个角色\N{\rEng}This kid understands the character better than he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.04,1:18:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\rEng}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.28,1:18:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把你刚说的话告诉他 - 不 我不想说\N{\rEng}- Tell him what you just told me. - No, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.64,1:18:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 告诉他\N{\rEng}No, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.45,1:18:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你不像是真入戏了\N{\rEng}I was just saying you didn't really seem like you were in the scene is all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.63,1:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他懂不懂戏？ - 当局者迷\N{\rEng}- Uh, who is this? - He's nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.34,1:18:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 旁观者清 - 而且 在我看来\N{\rEng}- That's the point. - Also, you know, in my experience,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.02,1:18:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只有玩过家家才这样拿刀\N{\rEng}only children hold a knife like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.89,1:18:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要是真打 刀该这样拿\N{\rEng}If it's a serious fight, you hold your knife like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.58,1:18:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刀要在上面 - 这又不是街头斗殴\N{\rEng}- with the blade square to your wrist. - This is not a street fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.97,1:18:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 既然你们不求真的话\N{\rEng}Okay, well, if you're not going for realistic,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.41,1:18:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还得再加点花样\N{\rEng}you might as well add a little flair.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.97,1:19:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\rEng}Like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.14,1:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹了 - 对吧 凯？\N{\rEng}- Cut it out. - Right, Kay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.50,1:19:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 行了 谢了你的教程 谢谢\N{\rEng}Yeah, okay. Thanks for the tutorial. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.76,1:19:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太感谢了 抓紧走吧 谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you very much indeed. That's all we need today. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.87,1:19:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油 凯 - 送他出去\N{\rEng}- Best of luck, Kay. Best of luck. - Get him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.65,1:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不需要你了 谢谢 抓紧走吧\N{\rEng}We no longer require your presence. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.69,1:19:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言...\N{\rEng}Well, with all due respect...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.07,1:19:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,每套布景竟然都要5000多块\N{\rEng}And yet every set cost more than $5,000.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.90,1:19:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要让您太太高兴又少花钱 真办不到啊\N{\rEng}I can't just snap my fingers and get your money and your wife into alignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.39,1:19:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那我花钱雇你干嘛\N{\rEng}I pay you to say no.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.90,1:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让她感觉有主导权 又要控制她开销\N{\rEng}She seems to think that this is carte blanche.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.83,1:19:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本做不到啊\N{\rEng}I can't just perform the impossible here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.55,1:19:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你做不到 我就另请他人\N{\rEng}If you can't control her, I will find someone else who can.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.24,1:19:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\rEng}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.49,1:19:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,罗克韦尔先生 请等一下\N{\rEng}Mr. Rockwell. Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.11,1:19:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干什么？ - 是我 马蒂·毛瑟 又见面了\N{\rEng}- What? - Hey. Marty Mauser. Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.74,1:19:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是你冒充我儿子战友给我办公室打的电话？\N{\rEng}Did you call my office and say you're friends with my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.62,1:19:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 但是... - 混蛋\N{\rEng}- Yes. But... - Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.00,1:19:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我没别的办法联络您了 请您听我说\N{\rEng}I had no other way to get in touch with you. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.08,1:19:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想再谈谈去日本的事\N{\rEng}I wanna revisit our conversation about Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.73,1:19:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我重新考虑过了 我想去 我觉得主意不错\N{\rEng}I reconsidered it and I wanna do it. I think it's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.96,1:19:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛就在下周 我已经有别的计划了\N{\rEng}The event's next week. I've made alternate plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.88,1:19:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别的计划？这最初可是您的主意\N{\rEng}What other plans? Okay, it was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.59,1:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这主意棒极了 求您给我两分钟谈谈\N{\rEng}It's a fantastic idea. Let's just have a conversation about this for two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.63,1:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么呢？嘿 嘿 罗克韦尔先生\N{\rEng}What are you doing? Hey. Hey. Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.24,1:20:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,求您了 咱们务实些\N{\rEng}Please, let's both be pragmatists about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.16,1:20:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把私人感情放一边\N{\rEng}Put your personal feelings about me aside for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.33,1:20:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,您也知道 我和远藤合作能带来多少好处\N{\rEng}You and I both know how much value I would add with Endo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.41,1:20:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在他的主场打表演赛？\N{\rEng}In an exhibition on his home turf?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.29,1:20:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,势必会引爆全场\N{\rEng}Imagine it. I'd be like a stick of dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.21,1:20:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不管您的备选计划是什么\N{\rEng}Whatever you have planned, the alternative,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.79,1:20:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都比不上这个\N{\rEng}it's gonna pale in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.15,1:20:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我两分钟\N{\rEng}Please give me two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.38,1:20:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还能达成共识 求您了\N{\rEng}We have enough common ground to figure this out. Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.53,1:20:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行吧 上车说 - 真的？谢谢\N{\rEng}- All right, get in the car. - Really? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.09,1:20:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,汤米 开车\N{\rEng}Tommy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.43,1:20:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\rEng}Hey. Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.44,1:20:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你这王八蛋 桌球还是我给你引荐的\N{\rEng}You son of a bitch. I gave you the idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.22,1:20:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 凯·斯通女士让我转告你\N{\rEng}I'm sorry. Ms. Stone wanted to let you know
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.93,1:20:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她想与您共进午餐\N{\rEng}that she'd love to have lunch with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.78,1:20:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凯·斯通？ - 是的\N{\rEng}- Ms. Stone? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.10,1:21:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 我迟到太久了\N{\rEng}My God, I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.62,1:21:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在意这些干嘛\N{\rEng}Come on. What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.22,1:21:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你可是主角 心里应该爽才对\N{\rEng}You're the star. Gotta feel pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.75,1:21:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,话说 你当初为啥退出演艺圈？\N{\rEng}I mean, why'd you even stop in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.62,1:21:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要个保障 结果怀孕了\N{\rEng}I wanted security, and I got pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.13,1:21:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他又给我压力 我就答应了\N{\rEng}and he pressured me, and I settled.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.94,1:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下你是走对路了\N{\rEng}Well, I mean, clearly, you're doing the right thing now
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.36,1:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他看起来正加倍补偿你\N{\rEng}and it sounds like he's paying you back with interest.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.53,1:21:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁补偿？ - 你丈夫\N{\rEng}- Who is? - Your husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.70,1:21:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的演出都是他出钱吧？\N{\rEng}I mean, he's funding your whole show, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.28,1:21:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哪来的这种想法？\N{\rEng}Where'd you get that idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.37,1:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我在走廊无意听到他嘟囔这些\N{\rEng}I overheard him complaining about it in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.20,1:21:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘟囔？ - 是的 抱怨开销太大\N{\rEng}- Complaining? - Yeah, about the costs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.33,1:21:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让他滚一边去吧\N{\rEng}He can go fuck himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.56,1:21:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 彻底滚蛋\N{\rEng}Completely. You know what you should do,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.21,1:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该把他榨干\N{\rEng}you should leech him for every penny he's worth,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.11,1:21:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己捧成最红的星\N{\rEng}assume your place as the biggest star on the planet,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.92,1:21:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后狠狠打他那张自大嘴脸\N{\rEng}and then you rub it in his smug little face.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.80,1:21:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我可不想听你的人生建议\N{\rEng}Thank you, but I'm really not looking for life advice from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.92,1:21:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我只是说 你根本不用靠他\N{\rEng}No, I'm just saying you clearly never needed him in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.45,1:21:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我 绝不靠谁帮忙\N{\rEng}Like with me, I'm never accepting anyone's help.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.64,1:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我只靠我自己 靠我的手艺\N{\rEng}I gotta do it completely on my own. Purely on the basis of my own talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.77,1:21:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不然的话 奖杯都被玷污了\N{\rEng}Otherwise it's, like, the success won't even count.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.94,1:22:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是我自己的观念\N{\rEng}But that's just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.13,1:22:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来倒是容易\N{\rEng}Yes, well, that's very easy to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.44,1:22:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来容易 做起来可真难\N{\rEng}Well, it's easy to say but it's sure not easy to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.32,1:22:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的 所以你才拿钱退圈了\N{\rEng}I mean, you know that. That's why you cashed out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.05,1:22:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你个事\N{\rEng}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.06,1:22:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你靠这门小桌球挣到钱了吗？\N{\rEng}Do you make money at this little table tennis thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.66,1:22:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还没呢 - 你有工作吗？\N{\rEng}- Not yet. - Do you have a job?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.35,1:22:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我是说 桌球就是我的工作\N{\rEng}No. I mean, table tennis is my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.52,1:22:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那你靠什么糊口？\N{\rEng}How do you live?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.63,1:22:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠信念\N{\rEng}I live with the confidence
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.69,1:22:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我相信自己 钱自然会来的\N{\rEng}that if I believe in myself, the money will follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.50,1:22:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,归根结底 我奋斗的重点不是钱\N{\rEng}Ultimately, my struggle isn't even about money.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.05,1:22:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么交房租？ - 不交\N{\rEng}- How do you pay rent? - I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.22,1:22:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是在回避问题 - 不 我没回避\N{\rEng}- You're avoiding the question. - No, I'm not avoiding anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.39,1:22:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天你打算怎么吃饭？\N{\rEng}How do you plan on eating food today?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.32,1:22:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我打算你一走就叫客房送饭来\N{\rEng}Honestly, I was gonna order room service the second you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.46,1:22:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真行啊 - 是啊 是啊\N{\rEng}- Nice. - Yeah. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.08,1:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你这梦想行不通 你有什么打算？\N{\rEng}And what do you plan to do if this whole dream of yours doesn't work out?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.78,1:22:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我压根不会想这种事情\N{\rEng}That doesn't even enter my consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.33,1:22:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 也许你得考虑一下现实了\N{\rEng}Okay. Well, maybe it should.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.39,1:22:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\rEng}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.76,1:22:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你这口气真像我妈 随便说说\N{\rEng}You sound like my mom. No offense.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.57,1:22:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你倒像个小屁孩\N{\rEng}And you sound like a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.41,1:22:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？我可够成熟的\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah? Clearly I'm old enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.64,1:22:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\rEng}And what is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.94,1:22:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,成熟到能在你东山再起的时候\N{\rEng}That I'm old enough to fuck you in your hotel room
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.69,1:23:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在酒店干你一场 还是你的酒店\N{\rEng}in the middle of your big comeback.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.62,1:23:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你真下流\N{\rEng}You're disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.14,1:23:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,祝演出顺利\N{\rEng}Break a leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.82,1:23:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 不过我在外地\N{\rEng}No, I know, but I was out of town
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.64,1:23:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这信我昨天才刚收着\N{\rEng}so I only just received it yesterday for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.50,1:23:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去日本行程已经订好了 改不了了\N{\rEng}Well, look, not coming to Japan is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.96,1:23:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦跟拉姆·塞西说 全额的\N{\rEng}Okay, well, just let Mr. Sethi know that a cashier's check in the full amount
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.19,1:23:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,银行担保的赔付支票已经寄出\N{\rEng}is already on the way to him. It's in the mail.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.63,1:23:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意 只是...\N{\rEng}No, that's fine, but just...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.71,1:23:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别在现场一见到我就惊讶\N{\rEng}I don't want any confusion about my attendance.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.76,1:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定到场 开赛时肯定见得着我\N{\rEng}I'm gonna be there. I'm gonna be there when the tournament starts.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.82,1:23:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到了 - 太好了 太好了 太好了\N{\rEng}- I got it! - Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.14,1:23:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能值多少钱？\N{\rEng}How much do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.69,1:23:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是假货 - 假货？你什么意思？\N{\rEng}- This is not real. - What do you mean it's not real?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.31,1:23:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完全赝品 - 这可是从大富婆脖子上摘下来的\N{\rEng}- Total fake. - It came from the neck of a millionaire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.52,1:23:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看着摘下来的\N{\rEng}I saw it come off her neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.94,1:23:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管来路 这玩意不值钱\N{\rEng}I don't care where it came from. It's total garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.97,1:23:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 装饰用的仿制品 - 装饰用的？\N{\rEng}- Costume jewelry. - Costume jewelry?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.59,1:23:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 该死\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.36,1:23:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,想卖的话 我最多给你两块钱\N{\rEng}If you want, I can give you two bucks for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.07,1:23:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 喂 迪翁 是我\N{\rEng}- Hello. - Hey, Dion. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.30,1:23:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,忙不忙啊\N{\rEng}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.43,1:24:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑哪去了？你答应过要准备经销商名单的\N{\rEng}Hey, where have you been? You promised me we'd have a list of distributors.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.35,1:24:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸今晚就回来了\N{\rEng}My dad lands tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.48,1:24:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就回去 全力做这件事\N{\rEng}I'll come back now and give you my undivided attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.23,1:24:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,先让我跟我妹说句话\N{\rEng}Let me just talk to my sister for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.84,1:24:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 马蒂来电话了\N{\rEng}Rachel, Marty's on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.67,1:24:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 你在哪儿？ - 喂 瑞秋 听好了\N{\rEng}- Hi. Where are you? - Hi, Rachel, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.44,1:24:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我夹克里有个狗项圈\N{\rEng}There's a dog collar in my jacket, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.76,1:24:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有个人狗在新泽西丢了\N{\rEng}I know a guy who lost a dog out in New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.70,1:24:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他会付大笔赏金\N{\rEng}He'll pay a big reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.26,1:24:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 他家车钥匙在门口小碗里\N{\rEng}Also, there's a set of car keys in a bowl by the front door.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.02,1:24:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见了吗？ - 看见了\N{\rEng}- You see them? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.24,1:24:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上钥匙 把车开来 别让迪翁瞧见\N{\rEng}Grab the keys, and make sure Dion doesn't see you do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.00,1:24:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 迪翁\N{\rEng}Hey, Dion.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.08,1:24:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,能去商店帮我买点生姜吗？\N{\rEng}Can you go to the store and grab me some ginger?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.08,1:24:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我晨吐反应特别厉害\N{\rEng}I'm having really bad morning sickness.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.50,1:24:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.45,1:24:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 加油站打样了\N{\rEng}Sorry, station's closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.99,1:24:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我们不是来加油的\N{\rEng}That's okay. We're not looking for service.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.26,1:24:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们附近有看到跑丢的狗吗？\N{\rEng}Did you see a dog come around here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.16,1:24:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没 没见着 你瞧见狗了吗？\N{\rEng}Nah, I ain't seen nothing. You seen a dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.25,1:24:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 差不多这么高 - 什么时候丢的？\N{\rEng}- He's this tall. - When did you lose it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.14,1:24:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,几天前\N{\rEng}A few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.41,1:24:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,克兰伯里有个收容所 往那走大概八公里\N{\rEng}There's a pound down in Cranberry. About five miles that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.96,1:24:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 问问他们 - 我打过电话了\N{\rEng}- Maybe try there. - I called there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.17,1:24:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 帮不上忙 - 好吧\N{\rEng}- Sorry, can't help you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.97,1:24:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.50,1:25:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没人看到狗\N{\rEng}They didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.07,1:25:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们去那里试试\N{\rEng}Let's go try that place.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.98,1:25:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在家吗？\N{\rEng}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.82,1:25:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗?\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.10,1:25:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪？ - 我去后面瞧瞧\N{\rEng}- Where are you going? - Just gonna check out back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.02,1:26:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,“我们非常感谢全国各地的唱片商和艺术家们”\N{\rEng}"We're grateful to the record manufacturers and artists
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.69,1:26:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,“全国各地的艺术家们”\N{\rEng}all over the country."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.04,1:26:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我去 摩西\N{\rEng}Oh, shit. Moses.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.93,1:26:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 狗狗 嘿 嘿 摩西\N{\rEng}Hey, buddy. Hey. Hey, Moses.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.86,1:26:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 马蒂 乖狗狗\N{\rEng}It's Marty. Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.27,1:26:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.19,1:26:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\N{\rEng}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.07,1:26:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西 摩西\N{\rEng}Moses. Moses!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.00,1:26:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静 冷静 我来带你回家\N{\rEng}Hey, buddy. Calm down. Let's get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.38,1:26:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,想不想回家？走 咱们回家\N{\rEng}You wanna go home, right? Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.24,1:26:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 别 别 别\N{\rEng}Okay. Hey. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.32,1:26:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,“刚才为您播放的是佩珀敏特·哈里斯”\N{\rEng}"And that was Peppermint Harris
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.22,1:26:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,“以及他的那首金曲...”\N{\rEng}"and that great record of his...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.58,1:26:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,“不过现在是时候暂别这档节目了”\N{\rEng}"But it's time to hang up the old blunderbuss for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.19,1:26:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,“记住 如果你想...”\N{\rEng}"Remember, if you want any..."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.00,1:27:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好？ - 有事吗？\N{\rEng}- Hi, how are you? - Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.33,1:27:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们狗丢了 正在找狗\N{\rEng}We were just searching the area for a lost dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.16,1:27:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们？ - 我和我丈夫\N{\rEng}- "We"? - My husband and I.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.70,1:27:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的狗几天前在加油站附近丢了\N{\rEng}We lost our dog a couple of days ago out near the gas station
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.06,1:27:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们叫我们来这边瞧瞧...\N{\rEng}and they told us to come and check over here...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.56,1:27:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你是最近的一户人家 - 谁？\N{\rEng}- seeing that you're the closest house. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.08,1:27:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你来的？哪个加油站？\N{\rEng}Who? Which gas station?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.32,1:27:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说不上来 - 嘿\N{\rEng}- I don't know. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.50,1:27:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是加油站伙计说的\N{\rEng}It was one of the guys that work there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.65,1:27:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老兄 你终于来了 - 我丈夫\N{\rEng}- Oh, man, I'm so excited you're back. - There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.55,1:27:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看来你捡到了我们的狗 - 你们在私闯民宅\N{\rEng}- I think you might've found our dog. - You're trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.34,1:27:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别误会 抱歉打扰了 我们听到后院有狗叫\N{\rEng}No. I'm sorry, that's not our intention. We heard barking in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.16,1:27:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说啥\N{\rEng}I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.85,1:27:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我的狗 被你捡到了\N{\rEng}My dog. You found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.74,1:27:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我没捡过狗\N{\rEng}I didn't find any dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.03,1:27:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\rEng}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.43,1:27:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然确定 你呢？\N{\rEng}Yeah, I'm sure. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.06,1:27:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊...\N{\rEng}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.55,1:27:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我趴着你那窗户\N{\rEng}I looked through your window.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.65,1:27:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了我的狗 - 你竟然偷看我窗户？\N{\rEng}- I saw my dog. - You were looking through my window?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.28,1:27:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不看怎么找到的\N{\rEng}Yeah, It was a good thing I did, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.45,1:27:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,趁我报警前 赶紧滚出我的地盘\N{\rEng}Get the hell off my property before I call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.09,1:27:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,该叫警察的是我才对\N{\rEng}You call? I should call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.76,1:27:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 要不要再核实下看清楚？\N{\rEng}Okay. You wanna get a closer look at him?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.01,1:27:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 近距离看清楚？ - 是的 麻烦了\N{\rEng}- You wanna closer look? - Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.35,1:27:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,行 我就让你看清楚\N{\rEng}Okay, good, good. I'll give you a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.19,1:27:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rEng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.06,1:28:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\rEng}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.49,1:28:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我很冷静\N{\rEng}I am calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.62,1:28:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这张犹太脸... - 你认真的？\N{\rEng}- If I see your kike face... - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.46,1:28:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...再敢偷瞄我窗户 - 马蒂 快上车\N{\rEng}- ...looking through my window again... - Marty, get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.62,1:28:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗？ - ...我我就把你脸打烂\N{\rEng}- Are you out of your mind? - ...I'm gonna shoot it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.57,1:28:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别把事搞大 我们这就走 马蒂 快上车\N{\rEng}There's no need for that. We're leaving. Marty, get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.33,1:28:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.77,1:28:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 快上车 - 不行 必须得拿到狗\N{\rEng}- Get in the car, Marty! - No! I need the dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.12,1:28:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快上车 - 看我不打爆你的脸\N{\rEng}- Get in the car! - Next one's going to your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.32,1:28:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 快...\N{\rEng}Marty, get...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.55,1:28:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 不 别开枪 别开枪\N{\rEng}No, no, no, no! Don't shoot! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.15,1:28:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 快帮我\N{\rEng}Rachel! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.16,1:28:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 快上车\N{\rEng}Marty, get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.21,1:28:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快跑 快跑\N{\rEng}Come on, come on, come on. Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.87,1:28:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,上车 上车 上车\N{\rEng}Get in! Get in! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.25,1:28:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,开车 开车 开车 快开 瑞秋 快\N{\rEng}Go, go, go straight, Rachel. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.22,1:28:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,超前开 快 开进玉米地\N{\rEng}Straight! Go! Go in the corn!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.13,1:28:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快开 快开 快开 - 天呐 天呐 天呐\N{\rEng}- Go, go, go, go, go, go, go. - Oh, my god! Oh, my god! Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.06,1:28:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.28,1:29:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 喂\N{\rEng}- Hello? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.89,1:29:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是...\N{\rEng}Hi, did you...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.99,1:29:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是丢了一只叫摩西的狗？\N{\rEng}Did you by any chance lose a dog named Moses?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.83,1:29:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,丢了 怎么了？\N{\rEng}Yeah, I did. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.31,1:29:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？太好了 我们刚好捡到他\N{\rEng}Oh, you did? Amazing! 'Cause we just found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.84,1:29:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的假的？ - 真的\N{\rEng}- For real? - I did, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.64,1:29:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他怎么样 还喘不喘？ - 实话跟你说\N{\rEng}- How is he? How's his breathing? - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.21,1:29:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始他呼吸挺虚的\N{\rEng}When we got him, his breathing was a little shallow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.54,1:29:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶紧谈钱 - 把你地址给我\N{\rEng}- The money. - Give me your address.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.55,1:29:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上到\N{\rEng}I'm gonna come right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.07,1:29:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,事情没那么简单\N{\rEng}Well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.93,1:29:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\rEng}The thing? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.08,1:29:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿按惯例\N{\rEng}'Cause you know in situations like these it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.58,1:29:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,应该给点赏钱吧？\N{\rEng}it's kind of customary to give the person a reward, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.79,1:29:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那你想要多少？\N{\rEng}Yeah, fine. How much you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.19,1:29:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开价太高了吧？ - 不高 他有的是钱\N{\rEng}- It's too much money. It's too much. - No, say it. He's fucking loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.66,1:29:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 快说\N{\rEng}- Hello? - Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.64,1:29:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说2000挺合适的\N{\rEng}I was thinking maybe $2,000 seems fair for this kind of a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.85,1:29:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,挺公道的\N{\rEng}That seems pretty fair to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.37,1:29:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只要2000 - 你开玩笑吧？\N{\rEng}- Two thousand. - You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.73,1:29:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没开玩笑 - 你他妈在耍我吧\N{\rEng}- No, no. No. - That's fucking ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.38,1:30:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 听着...\N{\rEng}Look, look...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.69,1:30:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这跟你没关系 但...\N{\rEng}I know it's really not your problem, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.65,1:30:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但我快生了 而且我一个人 没丈夫\N{\rEng}I'm about to have a baby, and, look, I got no husband right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.45,1:30:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,也没工作 这钱就算行善积德了\N{\rEng}I got no job, and this money would really, really help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.51,1:30:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们行善吧\N{\rEng}And, you know, let's be good people and...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.47,1:30:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那狗是我在收容所白领的 知道吗？\N{\rEng}You realize I got that dog for free at the pound, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.46,1:30:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想就错了\N{\rEng}Well, that's kind of the wrong way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.21,1:30:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 错了？ - 对 错了\N{\rEng}- Oh, really? - Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.48,1:30:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那我该怎么想？\N{\rEng}How am I supposed to look at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.00,1:30:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,比方说我不是在谈狗\N{\rEng}'Cause let's just say that I'm not calling about a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.78,1:30:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,比方说我是在说你母亲\N{\rEng}Let's say that I'm calling about your mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.77,1:30:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是医生 要做急救手术\N{\rEng}and I'm a doctor, and I gotta perform emergency surgery on her
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.45,1:30:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不然她会死 你该怎么办？\N{\rEng}or she's gonna die. What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.10,1:30:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你能因她不是买来的就不救吗？\N{\rEng}Refuse the surgery because you got your mother for free?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.66,1:30:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的 你会救你母亲\N{\rEng}No! That's crazy. You're gonna take the surgery
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.50,1:30:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你爱她 - 这是什么胡扯比喻\N{\rEng}- because you love your mother. - That's the stupidest thing I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.50,1:30:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那就说明你不懂爱\N{\rEng}Well, then I guess you don't know anything about love.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.04,1:30:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 别扯了 把地址给我 我现在就来\N{\rEng}All right, forget it. Give me your address, okay? I'll come now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.90,1:30:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 带钱来 - 抱歉 但不行\N{\rEng}- I'll bring you the cash. - I'm sorry, but no.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.23,1:30:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行？ - 不行\N{\rEng}- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.77,1:30:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别误会 你听着也像好人\N{\rEng}it's really not your fault, and you sound like a very nice person.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.87,1:30:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但我以前被坑过太多次了\N{\rEng}It's just I've been ripped off one too many times in the past,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.41,1:30:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这回不能冒险\N{\rEng}and I'm just not willing to let that happen to me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.31,1:31:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 这次必须先拿到钱\N{\rEng}So, we're just gonna need to find a way to get me the money first.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.46,1:31:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你懂吗？ - 懂\N{\rEng}- You know? Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.98,1:31:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,给我听好了 你这蠢娘们\N{\rEng}Listen to me, you fucking dumb bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.80,1:31:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一分钱都别想拿到 - 你嘴怎么那么脏？\N{\rEng}- You're not getting one red cent... - What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.92,1:31:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,....除非我亲眼见到狗\N{\rEng}...without me laying eyes on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.48,1:31:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真不在乎的话... - 听明白了吗 妹子？\N{\rEng}- If you really don't give a shit about... - You understand, sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.76,1:31:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...既然狗是白领的 我就把他送去做实验\N{\rEng}...your dog that you got for free, how about I donate him to medical science?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.50,1:31:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想那样吗？ - 我就说这行不通\N{\rEng}- Would that be something you want? - I told you this wasn't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.28,1:31:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该料到 我到底在想啥\N{\rEng}I should have known better. What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.04,1:31:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是个烂主意 - 马蒂\N{\rEng}- It was a terrible idea. - Marty!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.29,1:31:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 烂透了 - 抱歉 我...\N{\rEng}- It was moronic. - I'm sorry, I was--
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.71,1:31:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是想碰碰运气\N{\rEng}I'm sorry. I was trying to give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.96,1:31:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不怪你 是这事就不对头 - 好了 别慌\N{\rEng}- It's not your fault. It was stupid. - All right. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.61,1:31:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那狗是什么颜色的？\N{\rEng}What color is the dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.59,1:31:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,问这干嘛？棕色的\N{\rEng}Why? Who cares? It's brown.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.93,1:31:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样 我老板认识所有狗贩\N{\rEng}Okay, because my boss knows all of the local breeders,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.83,1:31:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没准能找只长差不多的\N{\rEng}and maybe we can get one that looks the same,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.95,1:31:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他不一定看得出来\N{\rEng}and the owner won't be able to tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.64,1:31:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他能认不出他心爱的狗？\N{\rEng}You don't think he's gonna recognize his own dog that he loves?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.52,1:31:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是说不会立马发现 - 我现在该练球的\N{\rEng}- But I'm saying maybe not at first. - I should be working on my game right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.79,1:31:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,结果跑到这个旧车场\N{\rEng}Instead, I'm in a used car lot
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.48,1:31:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,丢人现眼 整这些没用的电话\N{\rEng}making a mockery of my life, doing prank calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.85,1:32:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们从哪来的？ - 老兄 你怎么还没睡？\N{\rEng}- What are you guys doing? - Hey, pal. What are you still doing up?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.83,1:32:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,小点声 我爸妈在睡觉\N{\rEng}Keep your voice down. My parents are sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.83,1:32:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们回来了？ - 我告诉过你了\N{\rEng}- I didn't know they were back. - I told you they were back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.59,1:32:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我爸的车呢？ - 就在车库\N{\rEng}- Where's my dad's car? - It's in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.77,1:32:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天经历的 绝对让你惊掉下巴\N{\rEng}You're not gonna believe, Dion, when I tell you the day that we had.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.90,1:32:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你骗了我 - 没有啊 你瞎说什么\N{\rEng}- You tricked me. - No, I didn't. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.86,1:32:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确实骗了 你这骗人的死丫头 - 喔\N{\rEng}- Yes, you did, you lying bitch. - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.08,1:32:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴放干净点 你这死肥猪\N{\rEng}Hey, you watch your mouth, you fat piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.04,1:32:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不许你骂我 - 别骂他\N{\rEng}- Don't talk to me like that. - Don't talk to him like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.83,1:32:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是我最铁的朋友\N{\rEng}He's one of my favorite people on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.04,1:32:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫他别骂我 - 你也别骂她\N{\rEng}- Tell him not to talk to me like that. - Don't talk to her like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.77,1:32:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别骂他 - 小声点\N{\rEng}- Don't talk to him like that. - Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.64,1:32:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别怪她 是我让她干的\N{\rEng}I'm the one that told her to do it. She wouldn't have if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.77,1:32:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把车钥匙给我 - 行 就在这儿 给你\N{\rEng}- Give me the car keys. - Okay, they're right here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.09,1:32:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有点小剐蹭... - 什么？\N{\rEng}- We got into a little fender bender... - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.68,1:32:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...但没大碍\N{\rEng}...but it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.78,1:32:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是小伤 我会赔的 - 拿什么赔？什么时候赔？\N{\rEng}- It's minor damage. I can pay for it. - How? When?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.45,1:32:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 这么晚了 咱们都该歇歇了\N{\rEng}Dion, it's very late right now. We should all get a little bit of rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.58,1:32:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,明天早饭时我来跟你爸解释\N{\rEng}I'll smooth it over with your father at breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.08,1:32:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有我在你别... - 你们不能在这过夜\N{\rEng}- I know your father-- - You're not staying here!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.84,1:32:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们没别的地方可去了 - 你们必须得走\N{\rEng}- We got no other place to stay. - You guys gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.08,1:32:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 迪翁 我们必须得留下\N{\rEng}No. Dion. We have to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.50,1:32:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没别的地方... 迪翁 别这样 - 不行 嘘\N{\rEng}- We have nowhere-- Dion. Stop it. - No. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.42,1:32:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她都怀孕八个月了 你疯了吗？\N{\rEng}She's eight months pregnant. Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.30,1:32:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们坐下来谈谈好不好 - 声音小点\N{\rEng}- Please can we just talk about it? - Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.01,1:32:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,深更半夜把我们赶出去是吧\N{\rEng}Gonna throw us out in the street in the dead of night?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.28,1:32:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 进去收拾东西 - 我们真没地方去了\N{\rEng}- Yeah, yeah. Get in. - We've got nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.87,1:32:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,收拾东西赶紧走\N{\rEng}Get your shit and leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.86,1:32:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我们今天经历了什么吗？\N{\rEng}Do you have any idea what we've been through today?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.82,1:32:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不理你\N{\rEng}I'm not talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.94,1:33:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不理我？\N{\rEng}You're not talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.42,1:33:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你彻底不打算理我了？\N{\rEng}Now you're not talking to me, period?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.36,1:33:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这啥事啊\N{\rEng}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.67,1:33:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,含金汤匙的人\N{\rEng}Must be nice being born with a silver spoon in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.61,1:33:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,体会不到谋生的苦\N{\rEng}Meanwhile, some of us have to work for a living.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.61,1:33:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂什么叫谋生吗？\N{\rEng}You ever heard that word, "work"?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.53,1:33:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,整天在房里瞎玩\N{\rEng}Instead of doodling in your room all day?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.30,1:33:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然把朋友往街上赶...\N{\rEng}Throwing your friends out on the street...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.97,1:33:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,别盯着我们看 看墙去\N{\rEng}Can you not stare at us? Can you look at the wall?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.77,1:33:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别像监狱看守那样\N{\rEng}You're creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.28,1:33:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能去哪儿？\N{\rEng}Where are we gonna go? Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.15,1:33:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不住 这儿明明有床... - 没事的\N{\rEng}- I'm sorry. You have a bed right here... - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.33,1:33:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...我本来能睡这的 - 没事的\N{\rEng}- ...and I could be sleeping on it. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.16,1:33:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我怀着孩子 我怀着孩子\N{\rEng}And I got a baby in me. I got a baby in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.15,1:33:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 看你干的好事\N{\rEng}It's okay. See what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.42,1:33:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大半夜的把孕妇赶到街上\N{\rEng}You're throwing a pregnant woman out on the street in the dead of the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.97,1:33:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这事会让你一辈子良心不安\N{\rEng}It's gonna live on your conscience forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.01,1:33:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛要自找苦吃？ - 对不起\N{\rEng}- Why would you do this to yourself? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.97,1:33:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,给我几分钟行吗？我得安抚下她\N{\rEng}Can I have a moment with her, please? Just to comfort her,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.60,1:33:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,让我跟我妹单独呆会儿\N{\rEng}in privacy with my sister, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.18,1:33:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让她小声点 - 我尽量 我尽量 我先把她安抚好\N{\rEng}- Keep her voice down. - I'm gonna try, but I gotta calm her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.56,1:33:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEng}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.29,1:33:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么办啊 这怎么办啊\N{\rEng}I don't know what to do. I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.55,1:33:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,演得真好\N{\rEng}That was really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.98,1:33:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞秋 演得太好了 - 谢谢\N{\rEng}- That was amazing, Rachel. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.61,1:33:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 这招也许行得通\N{\rEng}That was so good, it might work.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.82,1:33:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要是被赶了 下一步去哪？ - 他估计不会赶咱们了\N{\rEng}- Where are we gonna go if he kicks us out? - He might actually let us stay now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.03,1:33:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏你这套苦肉计\N{\rEng}That acting was so brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.81,1:34:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还真哭出来了？ - 不要 马蒂 你干嘛\N{\rEng}- Are you actually crying? - No. Marty, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.63,1:34:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 怎么了？\N{\rEng}- What is that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.70,1:34:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是化妆吗？\N{\rEng}Is this makeup?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.36,1:34:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别急\N{\rEng}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.59,1:34:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别急 听我解释 这不怪我 好吗？\N{\rEng}Just wait. Because I can explain. It's not my fault. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.90,1:34:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别说话\N{\rEng}No talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.13,1:34:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也是被逼无奈 你懂吗？ - 够了 求你别说了 住嘴\N{\rEng}- I didn't have a choice, you know? - Stop. Stop, please. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.78,1:34:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞秋 别说了 - 我必须得逃出来\N{\rEng}- Rachel, stop. - I needed to get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.39,1:34:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我冷静吗？但快到头了 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- See how calm I am? It's not gonna last. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.46,1:34:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚出去\N{\rEng}Get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.12,1:34:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 要走... - 赶快滚出去\N{\rEng}- No. What I think-- - Get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.73,1:34:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要走一起走 因为... - 闭嘴\N{\rEng}- I think that we should both go because... - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.25,1:34:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我妈一个套路\N{\rEng}This is the kinda shit my mother would do to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.90,1:34:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你这么好 你怎么下得了手\N{\rEng}How could you of all people do this to me, the way I treat you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.27,1:34:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我下得了手？ - 对 你怎么下得了手？\N{\rEng}- How could I do this to you? - Yes, knowing what I'm going through?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.60,1:34:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那你怎么忍心对我下手 - 别吵 嘘 你在干嘛\N{\rEng}- How about what you're doing to me? - Stop. Shh. What are you doing...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.91,1:34:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你有认真想过自己在做啥吗？\N{\rEng}Have you ever for one second thought about what you're doing--
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.89,1:34:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 你才闭嘴 你这自私自大的王八蛋\N{\rEng}- Stop. - Shush yourself, you narcissistic prick.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.87,1:34:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹了 你在干什么？ - 别碰我\N{\rEng}- Stop. What are you doing? - Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.77,1:34:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要把我爸妈吵醒了 闭嘴 - 去他妈的爸妈\N{\rEng}- You're gonna wake my parents up. Shut up. - Enough about your fucking parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.12,1:34:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,30了还爸妈？\N{\rEng}Aren't you, like, 30 years old?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.61,1:34:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗？我还有四周就要生了\N{\rEng}You realize I'm due in four weeks?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.36,1:34:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四周就要生了 - 孩子又不是我的\N{\rEng}- I am due in four weeks! - It's not my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.55,1:34:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他的孩子 这王八蛋的孩子\N{\rEng}And it's his baby, by the way. It's his fucking baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.80,1:34:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他连这种事都骗了你\N{\rEng}He's lying about that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.65,1:35:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在我家闹什么呢？ - 爸 我只是请了几个朋友来\N{\rEng}- What's going on in my house? - I was just having some friends over, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.30,1:35:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\rEng}Buddy, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.39,1:35:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 明早咱们得和斯伯丁开个会\N{\rEng}Hey, we have a meeting with Spalding first thing in the morning
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.66,1:35:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谈至尊球的事 - 迪翁 醒醒吧\N{\rEng}- for the Supreme samples. - Dion, come on. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.64,1:35:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别做白日梦了\N{\rEng}That's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.25,1:35:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你已经骗了我儿子的钱了 - 您在说什么呢？\N{\rEng}- You've taken my son's money. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.56,1:35:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 你看不出来吗？\N{\rEng}I don't believe it. D, don't you see what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.15,1:35:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我受不了了... - 你一直在骗我儿子\N{\rEng}- Unbelievable. Un-fucking... - You're conning my son all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.35,1:35:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没骗你儿子 - 你卷走了他所有的钱\N{\rEng}- I am not conning your son. - You're taking all his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.96,1:35:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 我让他有追求 你用钱来敷衍\N{\rEng}No, I give him meaning. All you do is give him money.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.93,1:35:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我给了他奋斗目标 - 你给我听好\N{\rEng}- I give him purpose. - You listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.77,1:35:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我滚蛋 - 你天天骂他 看看他被你吓得\N{\rEng}- Get out of here right now! - He won't even fucking look at you, he's so petrified of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.93,1:35:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？我们能去哪？\N{\rEng}What are we gonna do, huh? Where do you expect us to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.85,1:35:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你真想让我睡大街？我怀孕了\N{\rEng}You really want me to sleep on the street? I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.12,1:35:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 别 迪翁 迪翁\N{\rEng}No, no, no. Dion! Dion!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.41,1:35:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 瑞秋 我开门见山说吧 没别的意思\N{\rEng}All right, I gotta tell you something, Rachel. It's not intended to be mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.57,1:36:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我有人生目标 而你没有\N{\rEng}I have a purpose. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.14,1:36:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别以为这是好事\N{\rEng}If you think that's some sort of blessing, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.66,1:36:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你反倒在拖累我\N{\rEng}It puts me at a huge life disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.97,1:36:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个非常明确的目标\N{\rEng}It means I have an obligation to see a very specific thing through.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.39,1:36:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我得为它放弃一切 明白吗？\N{\rEng}And with that obligation comes sacrifice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.94,1:36:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一步步才走到今天的\N{\rEng}My life is the product of all the choices I've had to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.57,1:36:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而你那人生...\N{\rEng}Your life is the product of...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.94,1:36:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在不知道咋形容\N{\rEng}I don't even know what your life is the product of.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.69,1:36:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是走一步算一步的人\N{\rEng}You're making it up as you go. That's the kind of person you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.76,1:36:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是这种人 明白吗？\N{\rEng}That's not the kind of person I am, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.00,1:36:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你得为自己的烂决定承担后果\N{\rEng}You're responsible for the shitty decisions you've made.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.10,1:36:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没逼你嫁人\N{\rEng}I never told you to get married, not once.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.06,1:36:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别把你的烂摊子丢给我 - 我知道了\N{\rEng}- You cannot pawn them off onto me. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.82,1:36:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你在宠物店一年挣多少？\N{\rEng}How much do you make a year at the pet store?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.71,1:36:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多1200块钱\N{\rEng}About $1200.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.82,1:36:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了 我一周内得弄到1500块\N{\rEng}Okay, in case you forgot, I have a week to make $1500,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.84,1:36:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还没算机票呢\N{\rEng}not including air fare.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.14,1:36:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,现在必须专心 别让我分心\N{\rEng}I need to focus right now, no distractions.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.60,1:36:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的很抱歉 - 没事\N{\rEng}- I'm really sorry. - No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.01,1:36:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会和你安定下来的\N{\rEng}It goes without saying, I'm in no position to settle down right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.05,1:36:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没法跟你过日子 打消这个念头 明白吗？\N{\rEng}Get that out of your mind. I will not settle down right now. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.92,1:36:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你真打算离开艾勒 我不会丢下你\N{\rEng}If you're serious about leaving Ira, I will not abandon you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.34,1:36:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,作为朋友 我会帮你\N{\rEng}As your friend, I will help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.14,1:36:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们打听打听 找个靠谱的产院收你\N{\rEng}We'll do the research, we'll find a great maternity home.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.77,1:36:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子生了再找个好人家送走\N{\rEng}They'll take you in, they'll ensure the baby's got a good family.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.11,1:36:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还能...不行吗？不行吗？\N{\rEng}We could do a-- No? No?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.03,1:37:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那就回家去吧 瑞秋 回家去吧\N{\rEng}Then go home, Rachel. Just go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.60,1:37:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么跟他解释啊 - 自己想办法 快回去吧\N{\rEng}- What am I gonna say? - You'll figure it out. Go home, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.37,1:38:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,艾勒 醒醒\N{\rEng}Ira, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.97,1:38:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子不是你的\N{\rEng}It's not your baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.23,1:38:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,死贱人 不许抬头\N{\rEng}Stupid bitch, look at the fucking ground,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,臭婊子\N{\rEng}like a dumb fucking whore.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.26,1:38:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\rEng}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.91,1:38:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈的 滚那边去\N{\rEng}Fucking bullshit. Fucking go over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.12,1:38:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,给我面壁去\N{\rEng}Stand in the fucking corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.79,1:38:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我要抽死你...想试试吗？\N{\rEng}I'm gonna smack... You wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.59,1:38:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那野种肯定长成像他死爹那样的无赖\N{\rEng}That baby's gonna be a pimple-faced bum just like its fucking father.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.04,1:38:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,或者像她娘一样下贱\N{\rEng}Or it's gonna be a whore like its fucking whore mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.14,1:38:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快开门 - 又怎么了\N{\rEng}- Open up the door right now! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.81,1:38:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,大半夜的还让不让人睡觉了\N{\rEng}There are people trying to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.61,1:39:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 够了 别闹了 - 瑞秋 快看 你的新婆婆来了\N{\rEng}- Stop this! Quiet! - Hey, Rachel. It's your new mother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.08,1:39:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾勒 别那样说她 - 恭喜你了 马蒂他妈\N{\rEng}- Ira! Don't say that to her! - Hey, congratulations, Mrs. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.88,1:39:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你快要当奶奶了 - 什么？\N{\rEng}- You're gonna be a grandmother. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.05,1:39:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来 瑞秋现在是你的累赘了 拿好她的破烂\N{\rEng}Here, she's your problem now. Here, take her shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.41,1:39:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 需要帮忙吗？\N{\rEng}Rachel, do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.01,1:39:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹了 要帮忙吗？ - 对不起\N{\rEng}- That's enough. Do you need help, honey? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.86,1:39:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 大家都回去休息吧 - 她可会装可怜了\N{\rEng}- No, I'm okay. Everyone, go back to bed. - Yeah, great. She's so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.43,1:40:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就是瑞秋吧 - 你是伊兹拉？\N{\rEng}- Are you Rachel? - You're Ezra?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.65,1:40:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 狗在哪儿？ - 先交钱 再交狗\N{\rEng}- Where is he? - Give me the money and I'll bring him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.24,1:40:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,先交钱？见不到狗 你一分钱也得不到\N{\rEng}Money? You ain't getting a nickel unless I see my dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.08,1:40:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,先说清楚 我有后援 一帮人看着呢\N{\rEng}Just so you know, I'm not alone, okay? I got people watching all around me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.16,1:40:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我才他妈不管谁看着\N{\rEng}I don't give a shit who's watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.46,1:40:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我被保护着 你别耍花样\N{\rEng}I'm letting you know I'm very protected right now in case you try anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.67,1:40:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 好了 要狗吗？\N{\rEng}- What? - Okay, do you want your dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.31,1:40:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,狗在我这里\N{\rEng}I have your dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.49,1:40:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抢什么？ - 我不在乎项圈\N{\rEng}- What are you doing? - I don't want that collar.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.09,1:40:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要的是狗 - 把钱亮出来\N{\rEng}- I want what's inside the collar. - Show me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.53,1:40:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我没你的狗 我哪会有这项圈？\N{\rEng}Would I have this if I didn't have your dog? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.25,1:40:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱拿出来 我就去领狗\N{\rEng}So show me the money, and I'll go and get him for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.14,1:40:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\rEng}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.92,1:40:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,妹子 你知不知道你惹的是谁？\N{\rEng}You don't know who you're playing with, girl. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.12,1:40:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是钱 - 我才不管你是谁\N{\rEng}- Here's the money. - I don't fucking care.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.07,1:40:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把信封打开\N{\rEng}Show me what's inside the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.69,1:40:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道里面是不是钱\N{\rEng}How am I supposed to know there's anything in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.49,1:40:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想看是吧？看清楚没？看清楚没？ - 行 挺好\N{\rEng}- Here, you wanna see? Here, look. Okay? - Yes. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.51,1:40:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你往哪儿去？ - 她到底带没带狗来？\N{\rEng}- Where you going, girl? - Does she have the dog or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.91,1:40:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谁他妈知道\N{\rEng}Who the fuck knows?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.02,1:41:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.07,1:41:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 布拉尼斯通酒吧 - 喂 是我\N{\rEng}- Yeah, Blarney Stone. - Hi, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.51,1:41:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\rEng}Who's "me"?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.12,1:41:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 可以把狗牵出来了 谢谢\N{\rEng}Yeah, thank you. You can bring the dog out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.42,1:41:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才把狗留这的是你？你说马上回来 这叫马上？\N{\rEng}You're the one that left the dog? What happened to "coming right back"?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.35,1:41:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,都准备好了 牵出来吧\N{\rEng}We're ready, so you can walk him outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.29,1:41:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那畜生尿了一地 - 好的 待会儿见\N{\rEng}- The thing's pissed all over the floor. - Okay. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.22,1:41:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？ - 别急 听我说\N{\rEng}- What is going on? - Listen to me for a second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.26,1:41:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,看 那边 瞧见没？\N{\rEng}Look. Right over there. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.22,1:41:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那个绿篷\N{\rEng}The green awning.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.41,1:41:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友马上会牵狗出来\N{\rEng}My friend's gonna come out in a second with the dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.74,1:41:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你先把钱给我 我打电话通报\N{\rEng}Once you give me the money, I'm gonna call and say we're squared up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.13,1:41:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 牵着狗出来了 没骗你吧\N{\rEng}Look, there he is right now with the dog. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.12,1:41:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我吧\N{\rEng}So hand me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.71,1:41:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\rEng}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.38,1:41:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 把钱给我\N{\rEng}Hey! Hey, give me my money.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.86,1:41:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那我的钱呢 喂\N{\rEng}What about... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.33,1:42:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抓贼 拦住那两个人\N{\rEng}Thief! Stop those two.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.22,1:42:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们抢了我的钱包 - 嘿\N{\rEng}- They took my wallet. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.92,1:42:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,拦住他们\N{\rEng}Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.10,1:42:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 别走\N{\rEng}Where you going? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.43,1:42:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 滚开 松手 - 别跑了\N{\rEng}- Get off of me. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.77,1:42:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 还有那个 那个打石膏的\N{\rEng}Hey, him too! Him with the cast!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.09,1:42:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那个打石膏的\N{\rEng}With the cast.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.19,1:42:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然抢孕妇\N{\rEng}What are you doing trying to steal from a pregnant woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.19,1:42:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 快喊警察\N{\rEng}- Shit. - Hey, police!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.63,1:42:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈什么玩意儿？\N{\rEng}What the fuck is this, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.11,1:42:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是摩西\N{\rEng}That not Moses. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.53,1:42:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的狗\N{\rEng}That's not my dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.03,1:42:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摩西在哪儿？有个女的叫我牵狗出来的\N{\rEng}- Where's my Moses? - Yo, I'm out here. The lady said to come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.89,1:42:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他妈的耍我是吧 - 别过来 喂\N{\rEng}- Fucking playing games with me? - Stay away. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.16,1:42:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的耍我是吧\N{\rEng}Fucking playing games with me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.00,1:42:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼把戏\N{\rEng}What kind of fucking shit you playing with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.56,1:42:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放手 滚开 退后 - 嘿 别激动 该死\N{\rEng}- Hey, get the fuck off me. Back up, man. - Hey, calm down. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.78,1:42:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 糟了 - 站住\N{\rEng}- Shit. - Stop there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.53,1:42:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快救她\N{\rEng}Someone help her!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.13,1:42:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命 救命啊 - 抓到你了 你这混蛋\N{\rEng}- Somebody! Help! - I got you, you fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.12,1:42:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 住手\N{\rEng}Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.35,1:42:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有事吗？\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.70,1:42:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你好吗 - 你来这儿干什么？\N{\rEng}- Hey, how are you doing? - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.51,1:42:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都12点半了 要不要一起去吃个午饭？\N{\rEng}It's 12:30. I was wondering if you wanted to get lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.87,1:42:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 今晚要首演\N{\rEng}It's out of the question. I have a show opening tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.47,1:42:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能借你一小时吗？ - 不行\N{\rEng}- Well, can I steal you away for an hour? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.45,1:43:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能跟你说句话吗？拜托 - 我很忙\N{\rEng}- Can I talk to you for a second? Please. - I'm very busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.16,1:43:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就几句话 拜托了\N{\rEng}Please, it'll just take a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.92,1:43:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说实话我真的有点羞愧 - 怎么了？\N{\rEng}- I feel kind of nervous telling you this. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.94,1:43:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我承认 这是我偷的\N{\rEng}All right, uh, I stole this from you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.65,1:43:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我想还给你\N{\rEng}And I want to return it. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.26,1:43:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我本打算把它卖了 再也不见你\N{\rEng}I'm sorry. My plan was to sell it and never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.32,1:43:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你住进我心里了 偷你的东西是不对的\N{\rEng}But I can't stop thinking about you, and I can't steal from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.47,1:43:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\rEng}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.56,1:43:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那是假首饰吧？\N{\rEng}You know that's costume jewelry, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.22,1:43:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 假的？我真傻 - 演出道具\N{\rEng}- This is costume jewelry? I'm an idiot. - From the production.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.11,1:43:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是常说要靠自己吗 那话去哪儿了？\N{\rEng}What happened to doing it all on your own? Where did that speech go?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.15,1:43:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是装腔作势行了吧\N{\rEng}I know, I'm completely full of shit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.15,1:43:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我走投无路才偷了你的东西\N{\rEng}I was in a tight spot, and I stole from you cause I needed some money,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.40,1:43:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\rEng}and it was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.86,1:43:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我穷得叮当响\N{\rEng}I'm broke.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.28,1:43:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没门路\N{\rEng}Look, I got no resources.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.74,1:43:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,下周要去日本打比赛 我连路费都没有\N{\rEng}I got the championship next week in Japan. I got no way to get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.91,1:43:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我没招了 没人能帮我 凯\N{\rEng}I got no options. I got no one looking out for me, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.77,1:43:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 这不关你的事 我只是来还东西的\N{\rEng}Which isn't your problem. Which is why I'm returning it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.67,1:43:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你猜我怎么想吗？ - 怎么想？\N{\rEng}- You know what I think? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.06,1:43:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道这是假货 卖不出去跑来装可怜 - 不是的\N{\rEng}- I think you went to sell that and discovered it was junk. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.04,1:43:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还用这种蹩脚的把戏\N{\rEng}And now you've shown up here with this ridiculous strategy
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.49,1:44:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,想让我心软掏钱\N{\rEng}to get me to have some sympathy and open my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.38,1:44:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,太荒唐了 我会这样侮辱你的智商吗？\N{\rEng}That's absurd. You think I would insult your intelligence like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.90,1:44:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还没演够？ - 演什么？\N{\rEng}- Are you gonna keep going? - Keep going what?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.53,1:44:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续演这出戏 - 我在说实说啊\N{\rEng}- Are you gonna keep on with this? - Just being myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.14,1:44:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你满嘴谎话 - 才没有\N{\rEng}- You're lying through your teeth. - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.41,1:44:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的诚实写在脸上 - 你到底还有没有脸？\N{\rEng}- It's me being me. - This is pathetic. You're being you?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.78,1:44:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的可是实话\N{\rEng}I am telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.02,1:44:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我偷了 然后很后悔很内疚\N{\rEng}I stole from you and then I feel bad about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.47,1:44:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以我来弥补 - 省省吧 我才不在乎\N{\rEng}- so I'm trying to make amends. - You're wasting your energy. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.92,1:44:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,换成我也会偷的\N{\rEng}I would have stolen from me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.60,1:44:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,凯\N{\rEng}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.30,1:44:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 打断你们了吧\N{\rEng}- Hi. - Looks like I'm interrupting something.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.87,1:44:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\rEng}No, no. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.95,1:44:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是马丁 我朋友卡萝的儿子 他正要走\N{\rEng}This is Martin, my friend Carol's son. He was just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.70,1:44:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这位是默尔 我的宣传人 - 你好\N{\rEng}- This is Merle, my publicist. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.29,1:44:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,马丁想当演员 可惜演技不怎么样\N{\rEng}Martin would like to be an actor, but unfortunately he's not very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.37,1:44:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在百老汇当个门童也挺好的\N{\rEng}Ah, well, you know, Broadway needs ushers too.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.01,1:44:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,座位安排的怎么样了？\N{\rEng}So what's happening with the seating?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.66,1:44:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟米尔顿谈过了 他会派全体职工来\N{\rEng}I spoke to Milton. He's sending all of his employees.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.76,1:44:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,算是公司总动员了\N{\rEng}It's like a mandate. Like, a company mandate.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.84,1:44:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样糊弄我吗？\N{\rEng}This is supposed to make me happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.29,1:44:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说要座无虚席吗？\N{\rEng}Well, I mean, it's a full house. Isn't that the point?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.89,1:44:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,全是不识货的 - 不 不是的\N{\rEng}Full of fucking morons. - No, no. You got some--
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.35,1:44:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 弗雷德·阿斯泰尔也会来 - 我先走了 不打扰你们了\N{\rEng}- Fred Astaire is coming. - Okay, I'm gonna get out your hair...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.44,1:44:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别急着走 记得给他留张今晚的票\N{\rEng}No. Make sure you give him a ticket for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.23,1:44:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.24,1:45:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小伙子 你这下有福了\N{\rEng}Oh. You are in for such a treat, young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.03,1:45:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你看她演一回就知道\N{\rEng}When you see this lady act,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.36,1:45:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫千秋难得一见 吸引四海八荒了\N{\rEng}you're gonna feel like you got your cock sucked by a vacuum cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.31,1:45:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 默尔 - 她脸红了 看见没？\N{\rEng}- Merle! - She's blushing. See her?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.70,1:45:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么呢\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.67,1:45:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,坐好别乱动\N{\rEng}Take your stinking seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.86,1:46:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\rEng}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.46,1:46:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你发什么神经？\N{\rEng}Have you lost your damned mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.19,1:46:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,小杰 我在跟你说话呢\N{\rEng}Jed. I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.32,1:46:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 我只是练练枪法\N{\rEng}I was just practicing my aim, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.31,1:46:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你不一直催我找准目标吗？\N{\rEng}You always said to shoot for the stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.01,1:46:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.56,1:46:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走\N{\rEng}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.10,1:46:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我来晚了 脱不开身\N{\rEng}I'm sorry I'm late. I couldn't get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.62,1:46:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呵 我信你 - 他一直缠着我\N{\rEng}- Oh, I bet. - He was all over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.66,1:46:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你今晚演得棒极了 太精彩了\N{\rEng}You were incredible tonight. That was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.50,1:46:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有样东西给你 - 给我？\N{\rEng}- I have something for you. - For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.94,1:46:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,转过去\N{\rEng}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.36,1:46:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,每周年我丈夫都会送我一件首饰\N{\rEng}Every year my husband gives me a piece of jewelry for our anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.44,1:46:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我有25件了 每件都代表受了一年的苦\N{\rEng}I have 25 of them. One for each year of misery.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.18,1:46:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这条够你那趟路费了 没准还能剩\N{\rEng}That should cover your trip and then some.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.27,1:46:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着让我浑身不自在\N{\rEng}Wearing it makes me feel like shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.68,1:47:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,完了 停下 停下 停下\N{\rEng}Oh, shit. Stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.51,1:47:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\rEng}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.39,1:47:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 喂 你们在干什么呢？\N{\rEng}Hey! Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.10,1:47:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完了 天呐 - 站起来\N{\rEng}- Shit. Oh, God. - Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.74,1:47:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 躺着别动 - 我看见你们了 站起来\N{\rEng}- Lay still. - Stand up, I see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.06,1:48:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我数到三就跑 一 二 三 起来\N{\rEng}When I tell you, run. One, two, three. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.06,1:48:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 走 - 嘿\N{\rEng}- Come on. Go. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.07,1:48:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊 拦住他们\N{\rEng}Joey, stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.80,1:48:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走 快走\N{\rEng}Come on. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.59,1:48:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们往哪儿去？跑这儿干嘛呢？\N{\rEng}Hey. Hey. Where are you guys going? What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.72,1:48:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没干嘛 - 不 不 不\N{\rEng}- Nothing. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.84,1:48:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把手举起来 - 铐上那小子\N{\rEng}- Let me see both of your hands. - Cuff him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.34,1:48:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 我们只是... - 我们什么都没干\N{\rEng}- Oh, my God. We were just... - We didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.22,1:48:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,饶了我们吧 我们只是在草地上找她的耳环\N{\rEng}Give us a break. We were looking for her earrings in the grass.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.18,1:48:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我的耳环掉了 只是在耳环\N{\rEng}My earring came off. We were looking for my earring.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.27,1:48:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你耳朵上不是戴了两只耳环吗\N{\rEng}It looks like you've got two earrings in your ears there.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.38,1:48:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这只 不是刚才掉的 还有一只\N{\rEng}Not this earring. There was... From before. There was another earring.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.44,1:48:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,白天还丢过另一对耳环\N{\rEng}There's another pair of earrings from earlier in the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.78,1:48:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我认出你了\N{\rEng}I recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.22,1:48:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 天呐 - 你是凯·斯通\N{\rEng}- Oh, God. Oh, God. - You're Kay Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.93,1:48:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 我太清楚你是谁了 - 见鬼了\N{\rEng}- Yes. I know exactly who you are. - This is not happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.28,1:48:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把手给我 - 你认真的吗？\N{\rEng}- Let see your hands. - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.33,1:48:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 我回家取个钱包\N{\rEng}You know, I will go home,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.87,1:48:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,给你们些钱赔偿\N{\rEng}and I'll get my wallet, and I will get you some cash
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.37,1:48:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟给你们添麻烦了\N{\rEng}because we've put you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.93,1:48:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请你行行好 警官 她这就回家拿钱包 给你们现金\N{\rEng}Please, officer. She's gonna go home and get her wallet. And give you cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.44,1:48:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有证件吗？ - 没 没证件\N{\rEng}- Got ID? - No. No ID.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.12,1:48:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把她也铐上 - 不要 求你了\N{\rEng}- Cuff her. - No, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.73,1:48:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没证是吧？让我搜搜 - 求你了 求你了\N{\rEng}- No ID, huh? Let's see. - Please, please. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.12,1:48:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求你了 让我回家拿钱包吧 - 求你了\N{\rEng}- Please, will you just let me go home? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.10,1:48:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\rEng}I'll give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.56,1:49:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 瞧瞧 这项链可真漂亮啊\N{\rEng}Wow, lookie here. That's a really nice necklace.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.76,1:49:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去 拿去吧 归你了\N{\rEng}Take it. Take it. It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.67,1:49:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不客气了\N{\rEng}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.32,1:49:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\rEng}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.67,1:49:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能再拿条项链给我吗？\N{\rEng}Do you think you could grab me another necklace?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.53,1:49:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗？\N{\rEng}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.61,1:49:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说这项链对你没价值吗 就几分钟的事\N{\rEng}You said them mean nothing to you. It'd just take you a couple of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.72,1:49:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我都消失了半小时 不能进去又立刻出来\N{\rEng}I was just gone for half an hour. I can't go up and come right back down.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.22,1:49:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给警察倒是挺爽快的啊 - 我妈就在屋里\N{\rEng}- You'd do that for the police officers. - My mother is up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.62,1:49:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 我的头发都乱了 - 我在走廊等你\N{\rEng}- Oh, my God. My hair. - I'll wait in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.16,1:49:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不准跟来\N{\rEng}No, you will not.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.82,1:49:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\rEng}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.03,1:49:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.47,1:49:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你真漂亮\N{\rEng}You look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.53,1:49:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 你有25条呢\N{\rEng}Please, you have 25 of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.95,1:49:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.59,1:49:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 待在这儿 明白吗？ - 好 我就在这里等\N{\rEng}- Stay here. Do you understand me? - I'll stay here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.84,1:49:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别乱跑 - 好\N{\rEng}- Do not move. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.38,1:49:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,倒霉\N{\rEng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.42,1:49:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 很高兴见到你们\N{\rEng}Hello. Lovely to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.81,1:50:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大卫 你好吗？ - 挺好 你呢？\N{\rEng}- David, how are you? - Good. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.56,1:50:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你死哪去了？\N{\rEng}Where the fuck have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.42,1:50:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我出去透透气 有意见吗？\N{\rEng}I needed a moment to myself. Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.75,1:50:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,出门还得请示吗？\N{\rEng}I didn't realize I needed a permission slip.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.96,1:50:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你操办了这一切 你现在却让我丢面子\N{\rEng}I put this whole thing on for you and you're making me look like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.12,1:50:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}God.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.93,1:50:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 默尔已经跟《纽约时报》那边联系上了\N{\rEng}Look. Merle's on the phone right now with The New York Times.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.19,1:50:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的假的？ - 他找到个能念出明天剧评的人\N{\rEng}- What? - He's got a printer who's gonna read the review.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.93,1:50:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.58,1:50:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在乎不在乎？ - 找着他了 我找着他了\N{\rEng}- Or do you not care? - I got him! I have him!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.68,1:50:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 来了 - 快来 快来\N{\rEng}- Oh, my God. Okay. - Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.54,1:50:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\rEng}Coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.67,1:50:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 拿到剧评了 - 来了\N{\rEng}- Hurry, he has the review! - I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.40,1:50:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,剧评出来了\N{\rEng}The review!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.77,1:50:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\N{\rEng}Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.28,1:50:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快来 - 来了\N{\rEng}- Come on, come on. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.11,1:50:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这是拉乌尔 她是凯\N{\rEng}Raoul, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.11,1:50:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好 标题是《凯·斯通复出》 作者罗伯特...\N{\rEng}Okay. Title, "Kay Stone Returns" by Robert...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.44,1:50:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 别关门 大家都要下来了\N{\rEng}- Have a good night. - Leave it open. Everyone's coming down.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.67,1:50:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是的\N{\rEng}- Are they? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.53,1:50:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,庆祝会结束了\N{\rEng}Party's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.03,1:51:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\rEng}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.41,1:51:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,庆祝会结束了\N{\rEng}The party's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.67,1:51:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们说散场了 - 什么意思？咱们才刚到啊\N{\rEng}- They're asking us to leave. - What do you mean? We just got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.23,1:51:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么门口不拦还让我们进？\N{\rEng}They should've stopped us at the door. Why'd they let us in?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.73,1:51:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,完了 聚会没了\N{\rEng}It's done, the party's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.39,1:51:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下 请问凯在哪儿？\N{\rEng}Excuse me. Do you know where Kay is?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.16,1:51:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她在楼上卧室里 - 好的\N{\rEng}- She's upstairs in her bedroom. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.33,1:52:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 凯在屋里吗？\N{\rEng}Hi. Is Kay in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.44,1:52:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不方便\N{\rEng}This is not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.61,1:52:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 能让我跟她说下吗\N{\rEng}Okay, but can I just speak to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.63,1:52:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我都说了 现在真不方便\N{\rEng}As I said, it's really not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.85,1:52:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,年底结账 能赚钱的就留着\N{\rEng}At the end of the year, if the guy made you money, you keep him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.75,1:52:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不赚钱的就踢出去呗\N{\rEng}And if not, you throw the bum out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.46,1:52:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下\N{\rEng}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.43,1:53:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您好 - 开啥玩笑啊\N{\rEng}- Hi. - You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.22,1:53:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉登门打扰了 - 你怎么混进我家的？\N{\rEng}- I'm sorry to disturb you in your home. - How did you fuck get in my house?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.17,1:53:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,求您再给我一次机会 我求您了\N{\rEng}Please give me another chance. I am on my hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.87,1:53:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去日本 还需要1500块才能参加世锦赛\N{\rEng}I need a ride to Japan and I need $1,500 so I can compete in the championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.40,1:53:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这活对我太重要了\N{\rEng}I need this job very, very badly.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.81,1:53:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我求您了\N{\rEng}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.35,1:53:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全听您安排 输球也行\N{\rEng}I'll work for you however you want. I will lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.51,1:53:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一目标就是把您的活动办成功\N{\rEng}I'll have no personal point of view apart from making your event a success.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.26,1:53:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 人生没有第二次机会\N{\rEng}Marty, there are no second chances in life.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.16,1:53:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么不行？ - 我给过你机会 你当时拒绝了\N{\rEng}- Why not? - I offered you the job and you said no!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.59,1:53:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我当时太冲动了 我很后悔\N{\rEng}I know, because I was impulsive. And I regret it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.35,1:53:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,除了后悔呢？\N{\rEng}And?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.49,1:53:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没礼貌 还自负\N{\rEng}And I was rude and overconfident.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.38,1:53:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我得意忘形 还耍架子\N{\rEng}And I was cocky, and I copped an attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.33,1:53:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还有呢？\N{\rEng}And?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.17,1:53:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证不会再犯了 对不起\N{\rEng}And it won't happen again. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.09,1:53:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,求您再给我一回机会 罗克韦尔先生\N{\rEng}Please just give me another chance, Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.28,1:53:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我任您发落 您吩咐什么我就做什么\N{\rEng}I'm throwing myself at your mercy. I'll do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.99,1:53:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么看？该给这小混蛋一次机会吗？\N{\rEng}What do you guys think? Should I give this little asshole a second chance?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.26,1:53:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 求您了 - 别问我\N{\rEng}- Yes, please! - Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.93,1:53:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这对我太重要了 求求您了\N{\rEng}You don't know how important this is to me. Please. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.75,1:53:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,求您让我跟您上飞机去日本\N{\rEng}Just let me go on your plane, and let me join you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.32,1:53:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,求求您了 我正跪着求您\N{\rEng}Please, I'm humbling myself before you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.23,1:53:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这副模样真恶心 - 对不起\N{\rEng}- You're making me sick. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.63,1:54:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 站起来! - 好的 行\N{\rEng}- Stand up! - Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.81,1:54:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,求您了 让我做什么都行\N{\rEng}Please. Okay? I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.79,1:54:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么都行？ - 对 什么都行\N{\rEng}- Anything? - Yes. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.28,1:54:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.37,1:54:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,顺着走廊走 右手边第二间是我办公室\N{\rEng}Go down the hall. Second door on the right is my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.86,1:54:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,去把球拍拿来\N{\rEng}Grab the paddle and bring it back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.55,1:54:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这要比刚才那出戏还精彩了\N{\rEng}This is more dramatic than the play.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.79,1:54:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 可不是吗\N{\rEng}- Okay. - That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.69,1:54:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 把球拍给我\N{\rEng}Oh, Marty. Give me the paddle.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.00,1:54:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的做\N{\rEng}So here's what I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.06,1:54:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你趴那椅子上 把裤子脱了\N{\rEng}I want you to bend over that chair and drop your pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.29,1:54:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你认真的吗？\N{\rEng}Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.68,1:54:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小子调皮过头了 得好好打屁股了\N{\rEng}You've been a really bad boy. Now you're gonna get a spanking.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.16,1:54:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 你认真的吗？\N{\rEng}Come on. Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.85,1:54:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想去日本吗？\N{\rEng}You wanna get to Japan, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.20,1:54:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我想去日本 可这真是你想要的？\N{\rEng}Yeah, I wanna go to Japan. But this is what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.29,1:54:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是代价 趴好\N{\rEng}That's what it's gonna take. Now bend over.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.65,1:55:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 先说好\N{\rEng}Okay, so to be clear,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.25,1:55:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你会带我去日本 然后还给我钱吗？\N{\rEng}you're gonna bring me to Japan and then you're gonna compensate me?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.62,1:55:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,明早八点半 拉瓜迪亚机场 我们就动身去日本\N{\rEng}Tomorrow morning, 8:30, LaGuardia. We're on our way to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.28,1:55:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还要买票吗？ - 飞机是我的\N{\rEng}- Do I need a ticket? - I own the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.42,1:55:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你说话算数？\N{\rEng}How do I know you're gonna honor this?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.20,1:55:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道 你没资格跟我讨价还价\N{\rEng}You don't. Because you have no power here.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.09,1:55:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,趴好\N{\rEng}Now bend over.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.73,1:55:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,手放这儿 弧度要漂亮点\N{\rEng}Put your hands over here. I want a nice arc.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.00,1:55:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,趴好\N{\rEng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.50,1:55:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.09,1:55:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 我准备好了\N{\rEng}Okay, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.63,1:55:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这一下是替我儿子打的\N{\rEng}This one is for my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.11,1:55:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.58,1:55:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这一下是给我解气的\N{\rEng}This one is for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.66,1:55:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呦\N{\rEng}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.23,1:55:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,下面是加赛环节\N{\rEng}Now the bonus round.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.63,1:56:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,多好的球拍 一面是木头 一面是海绵\N{\rEng}Beautiful paddle. One side's wood and the other is foam.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.39,1:56:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 马蒂 怎么样？ - 你好 泰德 你好 劳伦斯\N{\rEng}- Hey, Marty, how you doin'? - Hey, Ted. Hey, Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.24,1:56:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 近来可好？\N{\rEng}Aw, damn. Hey, man. How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.86,1:56:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我今晚能住后屋吗？\N{\rEng}You think I could stay in the back room tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.69,1:56:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真不巧 后屋今晚给布赖恩了 - 好吧\N{\rEng}- Wow, man. I got Brian staying there tonight. - I get it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.15,1:56:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我真想让你到我家歇 但我老婆不答应\N{\rEng}I would let you stay at the house, man, but the wife ain't havin' it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.13,1:56:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我就在这儿晃悠到起飞吧\N{\rEng}No, It's all right. I'm just gonna hang around until my flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.26,1:56:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪?\N{\rEng}Where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.43,1:56:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,去日本 明早八点出发\N{\rEng}Going to Japan. Tomorrow morning, 8:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.05,1:56:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 好样的小伙子\N{\rEng}- Oh, yeah! - My man!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.79,1:56:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哟 你真要去啦 弄到钱了 - 是啊 是啊\N{\rEng}- Yo, you goin'! You got that money. - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.31,1:56:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺你 小伙计\N{\rEng}Good for you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.16,1:56:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你表情怎么这么沉啊\N{\rEng}You ain't even look like you excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.87,1:56:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我...挺好的 我挺好的\N{\rEng}No, I'm-- I'm good. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.48,1:56:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你那哥们沃利在后头 他一直在等你\N{\rEng}You know your boy back there, Wally, he's been waitin' on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.57,1:56:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 沃利在这儿吗？ - 沃利在啊\N{\rEng}- Wally's here? - Wally, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.98,1:56:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他怎么样？ - 沃利挺好 挺淡定的 伙计\N{\rEng}- How'd he seem? - Wally's good. He cool, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.40,1:56:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在里面\N{\rEng}He's back there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.70,1:56:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他很看好你 - 当时大家都在掏钱\N{\rEng}- He believes in you. - He has a dollar. She has a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.51,1:56:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你好\N{\rEng}Hey. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.65,1:57:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 哇 见到你真好\N{\rEng}Oh, wow! How you doing? Nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.02,1:57:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想联系你\N{\rEng}I've been trying to get in touch with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.62,1:57:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 是啊 你家狗怎样了 摩西怎么样？\N{\rEng}- Oh, really? - Yeah. How's your dog? How's Moses doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.17,1:57:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你能别扯了吗？\N{\rEng}You wanna cut the bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.34,1:57:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没胡扯 我是真关心那狗的\N{\rEng}No bullshit. I'm genuinely concerned about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.13,1:57:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 马蒂 有麻烦吗？ - 没事 没事\N{\rEng}- Marty, Marty, Marty. You good, man? - Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.71,1:57:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 听着 听着\N{\rEng}Now, listen to me. Listen. Listen. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.76,1:57:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你那小妞就在楼下车里 她正等你呢\N{\rEng}I got your girl downstairs in the car. She's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.06,1:57:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你扯什么呢？你抓了瑞秋？\N{\rEng}What the fuck are you telling me? You got Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.14,1:57:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.20,1:57:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟我说狗在新泽西某处 你知道地址\N{\rEng}She told me my dog's in Jersey somewhere. And you got the address.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.67,1:57:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 咱们走\N{\rEng}- Okay. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.13,1:57:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 好吧 让我...\N{\rEng}Okay. All right. Let me, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.69,1:57:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,额 行吧 让我先...\N{\rEng}Um, okay, let me just...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.27,1:57:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,给我两秒钟 我就跟我哥们说句话\N{\rEng}Give me two seconds. I just wanna say one thing to my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.88,1:57:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给你两秒钟行 但老子可不等你\N{\rEng}Give you two seconds, yeah, but I'm not gonna be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.15,1:57:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不等我你干嘛？ - 我干嘛？\N{\rEng}- Where you gonna be? - Where am I gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.11,1:57:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就下楼用锤子敲烂她那肚子\N{\rEng}I'm gonna be downstairs taking a hammer to your girl's stomach.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.45,1:57:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我要干的事\N{\rEng}That's where I'm gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.11,1:57:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好 好\N{\rEng}Okay. All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.59,1:57:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 小毛毛\N{\rEng}Yo, Mouse!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.02,1:57:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 别磨蹭 - 好吧\N{\rEng}- Come on. Let's go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.12,1:57:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他的遗产大部分也被我拿了\N{\rEng}Well, I took most of his share of the money that our parents left us.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.97,1:57:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你拿了你弟那份？ - 是的\N{\rEng}- You spent your brother's money? - Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.47,1:57:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呵 看来你挺疼你弟的\N{\rEng}Yeah, you love your brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.80,1:58:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,疼啊 要不你给我弟安排个差事 他人不错\N{\rEng}Yeah. Maybe you could give my brother a job. You know he's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.10,1:58:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,让他取代你 行了吧？米奇 帮个忙\N{\rEng}I'll give him your job, okay? Mitch, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.64,1:58:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.91,1:58:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 行吗？\N{\rEng}Stop talking. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.28,1:58:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 看到那加油站没？\N{\rEng}Okay. See the gas station there?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.14,1:58:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,往左那个房子就是\N{\rEng}it's the house to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.35,1:58:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 前面左转？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Next left? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.35,1:58:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\rEng}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.70,1:58:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,下车 赶紧的\N{\rEng}Get out of the car. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.68,1:58:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 下来\N{\rEng}Mitch, come.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.45,1:58:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲁本 你留下看着她 - 好的\N{\rEng}- Reuben, you wait with her. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.47,1:58:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,老实坐着\N{\rEng}Sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.02,1:59:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 使劲敲\N{\rEng}Come on. Louder.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.68,1:59:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,使劲敲\N{\rEng}Knock louder.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.60,1:59:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的狗\N{\rEng}That's my dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.86,1:59:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西 喂\N{\rEng}Moses! Yo!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.27,1:59:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧开门\N{\rEng}Open up!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.27,1:59:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真黑 摩西\N{\rEng}Fuck. Moses.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.88,1:59:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开门 - 我讨厌死那狗了\N{\rEng}- Come on. - I hate that fuckin' mutt.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.59,1:59:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西\N{\rEng}Moses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.68,1:59:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西\N{\rEng}Moses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.51,1:59:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的狗 摩西\N{\rEng}That's my dog. Moses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.87,1:59:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西\N{\rEng}Moses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.81,1:59:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,里头看见啥没？\N{\rEng}See anything in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.25,1:59:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没 没看到什么\N{\rEng}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.60,1:59:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 该死\N{\rEng}- Marty! - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.48,1:59:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 快跑\N{\rEng}Marty! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.11,1:59:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂\N{\rEng}Marty!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.28,2:00:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下\N{\rEng}Get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.15,2:00:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.01,2:00:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 马蒂 我中弹了\N{\rEng}Marty! Marty! I got shot!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.83,2:00:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\rEng}Help!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.39,2:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 马蒂 快帮帮我\N{\rEng}Help, Marty! Please help!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.45,2:00:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\rEng}Help!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.12,2:00:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？噢不 你没事吧？\N{\rEng}Are you okay? Oh, no! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.81,2:00:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 这他妈是怎么回事？\N{\rEng}- Are you okay? - What the fuck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.21,2:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 没事的\N{\rEng}Okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.67,2:00:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我流血了 流血了\N{\rEng}I'm bleeding, I'm bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.57,2:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 没事的 没事的 没事的\N{\rEng}Okay. It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.98,2:00:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真对不起 - 对不起\N{\rEng}- I'm so sorry. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.70,2:00:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快去拿钱 - 什么钱？\N{\rEng}- Go get the money. - What money?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.03,2:00:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拿钱 就在他口袋里 在他兜里\N{\rEng}Go get the money. It's in his pocket. It's in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.08,2:00:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\rEng}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.18,2:00:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱 就在他口袋里 - 好的 知道了 知道了\N{\rEng}- The money! It's in the inside pocket! - Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.22,2:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.08,2:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是什么啊\N{\rEng}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.57,2:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你个王八蛋...\N{\rEng}Oh, you motherfucker...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.83,2:01:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了 没事了 没事了\N{\rEng}Okay. Okay. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.56,2:01:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.78,2:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,放手 你要去哪儿？\N{\rEng}Get off me! Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.63,2:01:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\rEng}it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.62,2:01:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.39,2:01:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿到了吗？拿到了吗？ - 嗯 拿到了 拿到了\N{\rEng}- You got it? You got it? - Yeah. I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.00,2:01:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱拿到了吗？ - 嗯 拿到了 拿到了\N{\rEng}- You got the money? - Yeah. I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.39,2:01:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱多吗？ - 很多 很多\N{\rEng}- Is there a lot of money? - There's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.45,2:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能去日本了 - 我知道 你做得真棒\N{\rEng}- You can go now. - I know. You did amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.60,2:02:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你可以去参赛了 - 我就知道你行 太棒了\N{\rEng}- You can go on your trip now. - I knew you could do this. So good.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.72,2:02:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮了大忙\N{\rEng}You did such a good job.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.17,2:02:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\rEng}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.89,2:02:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你预产期什么时候？ - 怎么了？孩子没事吧？\N{\rEng}- Honey, when is your due date? - Why? Is the baby okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.56,2:02:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子没事 你得冷静下来\N{\rEng}The baby is fine. I just need you to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.83,2:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是她丈夫吗？ - 不是 我是她朋友\N{\rEng}- Are you the husband? - No. I'm her friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.77,2:02:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她还有四周就生 孩子会没事吧？\N{\rEng}She's due in four weeks. The baby will be okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.85,2:02:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子没事 你不能进了\N{\rEng}The baby is okay. It's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.44,2:02:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能进？ - 手术室只允许家属进去\N{\rEng}- I can't go? - Only family in the operating room.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.48,2:02:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不\N{\rEng}No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.15,2:02:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,会没事的 瑞秋 都会没事的 放心\N{\rEng}It's gonna be fine. Rachel, it's fine. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.05,2:02:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 马蒂 别走\N{\rEng}No, no, no! Marty, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.11,2:02:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在外面等着\N{\rEng}He'll be right outside.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.56,2:02:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 别走\N{\rEng}Marty, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.93,2:02:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 我进不去 他们不让我进\N{\rEng}Rachel, I can't go. They're telling me I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.91,2:02:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不想让你... - 冷静下来\N{\rEng}- I don't want you to-- - Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.50,2:02:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 别走 求你别走 - 冷静点\N{\rEng}- Marty, don't go, please! - Please try calm down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.04,2:02:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,求你别走 马蒂\N{\rEng}Please don't go! Marty!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.43,2:02:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.08,2:02:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,罗克韦尔先生 欢迎来到日本 祝您愉快\N{\rEng}Thank you very much. Welcome to Japan, Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.01,2:02:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\rEng}- Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.40,2:03:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）好了 下一轮比赛
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.48,2:03:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.05,2:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语）这位挑战者是早川先生 大家掌声欢迎\N- （日语）远藤加油
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.44,2:04:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）你有信心吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.25,2:04:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）有
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.51,2:04:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.38,2:04:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）让我们拭目以待
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.48,2:04:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）那么接下来有请
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.83,2:04:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤出场
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.06,2:04:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）有点可惜
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.47,2:04:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语）远藤加油\N- （日语）下面请下一位挑战者上场
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.74,2:04:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,毛瑟先生 毛瑟先生\N{\rEng}Mr. Mauser. Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.55,2:04:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,罗克韦尔说让你排到最后\N{\rEng}Ah. Mr. Rockwell says the back of the line.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.04,2:04:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他还不想让你上场\N{\rEng}He doesn't want to begin yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.91,2:04:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这位才11岁...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.49,2:04:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.20,2:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我学 日语管啤酒叫“比鲁” - 来 干杯\N{\rEng}- Practice beer "biiru". - Okay, kanpai.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.55,2:05:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,塞西先生 塞西先生\N{\rEng}Mr. Sethi? Mr. Sethi.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.62,2:05:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 是我 马蒂·毛瑟\N{\rEng}Hey. It's me. It's Marty Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.73,2:05:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 真没想到能在这碰到您\N{\rEng}How you doing? I'm surprised to see you here, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.97,2:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 此话怎讲？ - 我不知道 我...\N{\rEng}- Why's that? - I don't know. I--
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.08,2:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来这里宣传锦标赛\N{\rEng}We do have a tournament to promote.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.38,2:05:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 当然 当然\N{\rEng}No, of course, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.00,2:05:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.67,2:05:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想给您道个歉 伦敦的事\N{\rEng}I think I owe you an apology for the way I acted in London.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.46,2:05:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那确实不像话\N{\rEng}I was a jackass.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.40,2:05:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,做人要有分寸 毛瑟先生\N{\rEng}There is such a thing as a code of courtesy, Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.76,2:05:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我知道 我知道 只是...\N{\rEng}No, I know, I know. It's just--
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.88,2:05:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我出身的环境\N{\rEng}It's every man for himself where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.31,2:05:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,为了混口饭谁都不讲究 懂吗？\N{\rEng}That's just how I grew up. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.95,2:05:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候我老毛病也会犯...\N{\rEng}And sometimes I feel like I don't even have control--
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.61,2:05:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想听这些借口\N{\rEng}I'm really not interested in your excuses.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.38,2:05:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 知道 这不是借口\N{\rEng}No, no, I know. It's not an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.02,2:05:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我会改掉那些做派\N{\rEng}Look, the point is I'm gonna proceed with a much better attitude.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.59,2:05:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要是今天我上台表现粗鲁\N{\rEng}And by the way, if you see me acting rude up there today,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.69,2:05:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那是演的 事先安排好的 我会以21比14输掉\N{\rEng}that's a character. This is scripted. I'm gonna lose 21-14.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.71,2:05:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这不代表我 下周赛场上你们会看到规规矩矩的我\N{\rEng}This isn't a real thing. The real me, the polite me, you'll see next week.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.06,2:05:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下周？ - 世锦赛上\N{\rEng}- Next week? - At the championship.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.48,2:05:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,世锦赛跟你没关系\N{\rEng}You're not playing in the championship.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.32,2:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你今年被禁赛了\N{\rEng}- What? - You're not participating this year.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.34,2:05:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 您搞错了\N{\rEng}No, no, no. I think you're confused.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.26,2:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是借这活动来凑齐罚款的\N{\rEng}That's what I'm doing the event for, so I can pay off the rest of my fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.74,2:05:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我去找罗克韦尔谈谈\N{\rEng}Come talk to Mr. Rockwell right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.37,2:06:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛还有不到两周就开始了\N{\rEng}The tournament is less than two weeks away.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.42,2:06:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对阵表都排好了 - 不 咱们可以重排\N{\rEng}- All the bracketing has been set. - No, but we'll redo the bracketing.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.86,2:06:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会为个自以为是的美国人把整个安排打乱\N{\rEng}I'm not gonna tear up the entire schedule on behalf of one entitled American.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.76,2:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不 塞西先生 塞西先生 你看...\N{\rEng}No, Mr. Sethi. Mr. Sethi. Look...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.72,2:06:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经来了\N{\rEng}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.70,2:06:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我千里迢迢赶来的 您根本想象不到有多难\N{\rEng}I don't think you know how difficult that was, for me to come here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.04,2:06:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在可真到日本了\N{\rEng}I'm in Japan right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.51,2:06:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你走得还不够远\N{\rEng}You haven't come far enough, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.68,2:06:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 你来这儿就是徒劳\N{\rEng}- What? - You have wasted your time coming here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.01,2:06:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真荒唐啊\N{\rEng}This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.11,2:06:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）来看看这位挑战者
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.79,2:06:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）哎呀 真可惜啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.99,2:06:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）请两位选手互相握手
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.86,2:06:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）友谊第一 比赛第二
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.86,2:06:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语）下面请出下一位挑战者\N- （日语）下一位
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.20,2:06:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）请站到这里来
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.99,2:06:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）请问您叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.94,2:06:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）哎呦
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.84,2:07:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）太意外了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.49,2:07:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）他是马蒂·毛瑟 美国的顶尖选手
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.09,2:07:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）大家掌声欢迎
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.74,2:07:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我千里迢迢跑到日本\N{\rEng}I've traveled many miles here to Japan
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.19,2:07:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了挑战我的死对头远藤\N{\rEng}to challenge my great nemesis, Endo!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.35,2:07:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂\N{\rEng}Come on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.41,2:07:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）你要怎么做 远藤选手？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.82,2:07:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\rEng}What's he say?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.46,2:07:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他不想让你再丢脸了\N{\rEng}He doesn't want to embarrass you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.23,2:07:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,让我丢脸？我的脸早没了\N{\rEng}Embarrass me? I am beyond embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.15,2:07:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说...你们的冠军就是个冒牌货 还是个怂包\N{\rEng}Tell him he's a-- Your champion is a fraud and a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.31,2:07:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个怂包\N{\rEng}He's chicken!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.31,2:07:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤先生同意比赛\N{\rEng}Mr. Endo agrees to the match.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.82,2:07:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Great.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.82,2:07:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不过有个条件...\N{\rEng}On the condition that...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.76,2:07:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,输的人得当着全场观众亲一头猪\N{\rEng}the loser has to kiss a pig in front of the entire audience.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.15,2:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲猪？ - 是的\N{\rEng}- A pig? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.46,2:07:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,亲猪？开什么玩笑？\N{\rEng}A pig? What?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.15,2:08:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你要是摆出猪样\N{\rEng}He said if you are going to act like a pig,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.65,2:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他很乐意帮你配个种\N{\rEng}he will happily mate you with one.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.70,2:08:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这话什么意...\N{\rEng}What does that--
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.42,2:08:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）大家或许没听懂
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.82,2:08:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）输了的人要当众亲一头猪
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.81,2:08:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在比分19比14
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.17,2:08:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）轮到远藤发球
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.07,2:08:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这一球至关重要
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.53,2:08:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟已经走投无路了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.82,2:08:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）好险
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.59,2:08:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这根该死的电线绊着我了\N{\rEng}It's this cord in the fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.69,2:08:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绊着我了 把线挪开 - （日语）他说输是被电线害的\N{\rEng}I'm stepping on the cord. Move the cord.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.67,2:08:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快把线挪走 别害的我再被绊倒\N{\rEng}Move the cord over there so I don't slip on it next time!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.93,2:08:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 对不起 - 我可不想被绊倒摔断腿\N{\rEng}- I'm sorry. I'm sorry. - So I don't break my ankle!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.42,2:08:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）20比14 远藤的赛点
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.44,2:08:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）决定性一球
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.48,2:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤发球
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.42,2:08:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤加油 远藤加油
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.05,2:08:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.10,2:08:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）胜负已分
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.39,2:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）本场获胜的是...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.07,2:09:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）更强的远藤选手
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.07,2:09:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）请给他热烈掌声
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.20,2:09:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这场比赛真是激烈
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.21,2:09:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）不过好戏还在后头
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.95,2:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语） 现在有请一位特邀嘉宾上台
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.49,2:09:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会说英语吗？ - 会\N{\rEng}- You speak English? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.26,2:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说什么？\N{\rEng}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.52,2:09:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,“有请一位特邀嘉宾上台”\N{\rEng}"We are welcoming a special guest."
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.26,2:09:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,“有请 拉姆·塞西先生”\N{\rEng}"Mr. Ram Sethi. Come on up."
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.46,2:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.55,2:09:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,同时感谢罗克韦尔先生主办这场难忘的盛会\N{\rEng}And thank you, Mr. Rockwell, for hosting such an unforgettable event.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.47,2:09:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才不过是下周精彩对决的开胃菜\N{\rEng}What we have just witnessed is a mere taste of what is to come next week
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.07,2:09:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,下周世界顶尖选手将与\N{\rEng}when the finest players in the world will be competing
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.87,2:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的英雄远藤功人一较高下\N{\rEng}against your hometown hero, Koto Endo-san.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.29,2:10:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤加油
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.53,2:10:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）可一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.51,2:10:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不多说了 现在请小猪阿古上台\N{\rEng}No more words from me. Let's bring on Agu the pig
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.55,2:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让这位美国人来个亲猪表演\N{\rEng}and see the American plant a kiss on him.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.23,2:10:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,“现在把猪请上台”\N{\rEng}"Now we bring the pig onto the stage."
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.53,2:10:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下 等一下\N{\rEng}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.99,2:10:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\rEng}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.18,2:10:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我要求先打一场真比赛 然后再亲猪\N{\rEng}I want to play him in a real game first before I kiss the pig.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.97,2:10:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,打一场真刀真枪的比赛\N{\rEng}I want to play him in a real game.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.63,2:10:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他 我想来场不掺水的比赛\N{\rEng}Tell him I want to play him in a game that's not a sham.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.69,2:10:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他\N{\rEng}Tell him!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.71,2:11:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你 告诉观众 刚才是假的 掺水的\N{\rEng}You, tell the audience that was a fake game, and was a sham.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.48,2:11:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们是在演戏 我想跟他来场真的\N{\rEng}Tell them it was a sham and I want to play a real game against him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.80,2:11:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能说 - 凭什么不能？\N{\rEng}- I cannot do that for you. - Why can't you do that?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.22,2:11:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才是场假比赛 是提前安排好的\N{\rEng}That was a fake game. That was staged.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.63,2:11:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没一点是真的\N{\rEng}No part of that was real.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.36,2:11:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本没拿出实力来\N{\rEng}I was not playing to the best of my ability.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.33,2:11:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这是对大家的侮辱\N{\rEng}It was an enormous form of disrespect to everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.00,2:11:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大家听着 你们想不想看真比赛？\N{\rEng}Hey, listen, who wants a real game?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.43,2:11:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要看真比赛的举个手 举手\N{\rEng}Show of hands. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.87,2:11:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 有人举手 有人举手\N{\rEng}Wait, this man. This man.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.33,2:11:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）要打就真打
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.00,2:11:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 你说得对 我们要看真比赛\N{\rEng}Marty, you're right. We want to see the real game!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.37,2:11:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\rEng}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.20,2:11:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）要真打
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.93,2:11:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）要真打
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.37,2:11:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）要真打
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.76,2:11:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）要真打
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.16,2:11:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）要真打
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.25,2:11:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 你要跟他们同流合污吗？\N{\rEng}En-do, you're gonna side with them?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.88,2:11:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,翻译 赶快翻译这句\N{\rEng}Translate. Translate this.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.18,2:11:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,问他要跟他们同流合污吗？\N{\rEng}He's gonna side with them, really?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.05,2:11:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,问他是不是真想给美国公司当摆设？\N{\rEng}An American company selling their product off of his back like he's a mascot?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.22,2:11:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你又不是人家的玩物\N{\rEng}You're not a mascot.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.56,2:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 布莱恩 把他弄走 - 你是冠军你有权\N{\rEng}- Brian, get him down. - You can throw that 'cause you're the winner.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.16,2:11:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们来场真的 观众想看真比赛\N{\rEng}Let's give them a real game. They want a real game.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.81,2:11:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,行了行了\N{\rEng}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.08,2:11:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 该下一个环节了\N{\rEng}Thank you, thank you. We need to move it along.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.25,2:11:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我下周没法去打世锦赛\N{\rEng}I'm not gonna be at the championship next week
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.13,2:12:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为这混蛋作梗 我去不了了\N{\rEng}'cause of this asshole. I'm not gonna be at the championship.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.84,2:12:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,给我个机会 你已经让我丢脸了 丢大脸了\N{\rEng}Give me a chance. You humiliated me. You roasted me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.82,2:12:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了 远藤 求你\N{\rEng}Please, please, Endo. Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.88,2:12:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托了 就当帮我 行吗？ - 好吧\N{\rEng}- Please, for me. Yes? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.64,2:12:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 他同意了 - 好？他答应了？\N{\rEng}- Yes. Okay. - Good? He says yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.97,2:12:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他同意了\N{\rEng}He says yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.14,2:12:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 远藤 谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you, Endo. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.18,2:12:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他答应了 太好了\N{\rEng}He said yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:16.10,2:12:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）想不到
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.62,2:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）比赛竟然还要继续
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.48,2:12:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）欢呼过后 比赛再度开打
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.45,2:12:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤再度对决
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.43,2:12:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）美国选手马蒂·毛瑟
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.94,2:12:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语）两位冠军的真刀真枪对决现在开始 - 这小畜生\N{\rEng}This little fuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:35.83,2:12:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\rEng}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.81,2:12:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤先发球
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.07,2:12:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）比赛开打
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.18,2:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.07,2:12:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）太好了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.23,2:12:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤 得分
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.08,2:12:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）1比0
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.42,2:13:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 振作起来\N{\rEng}Okay, Marty. All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.73,2:13:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别输给他 马蒂\N{\rEng}Don't let him beat you, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.13,2:13:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）拉锯战开始了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.80,2:13:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤好样的
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.16,2:13:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）又得一分
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.94,2:13:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）2比0
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.42,2:13:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤发球
Dialogue: 0,2:13:22.63,2:13:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟也不甘示弱
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.44,2:13:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）马蒂·毛瑟 得分
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.18,2:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤领先只剩一分
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.00,2:13:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）比分2比1
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.80,2:13:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语） 马蒂·毛瑟 再次得分 - 太好了\N{\rEng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.89,2:13:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语）目前比分2比2 平局 - 加油 马蒂 加油 小伙子\N{\rEng}Yeah, Marty! Go boy!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.05,2:13:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟毫不退让
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.48,2:14:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤加油 远藤加油 远藤加油
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.50,2:14:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在轮到毛瑟发球
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.07,2:14:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤和马蒂都在全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.01,2:14:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在比分是17比17 平局
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.37,2:14:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）比赛已经白热化
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.12,2:14:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）马蒂·毛瑟 得分
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.77,2:14:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤失分了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.86,2:14:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）被对手追上来了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.45,2:14:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）追上来了一分
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.29,2:14:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟领先一分
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.84,2:14:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在比分是18比17
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.05,2:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语）这才是真正的对决 大家给点掌声加油吧\N- （日语）借过 借过
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.16,2:14:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,省省吧 我知道钱没戏了\N{\rEng}You can save your breath. I know I'm not getting paid.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.14,2:14:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,赢不赢都别想拿到钱 我倒是好奇你怎么回家\N{\rEng}Win or lose, you get nothing. I wonder how you're gonna get home.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.67,2:14:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你别想坐我的飞机 - 无所谓\N{\rEng}- You're not getting on my plane. - It doesn't matter, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.43,2:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你打算叫停这活动 否则没有什么好说的\N{\rEng}Unless you're planning on shutting down the event, we got nothing to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.94,2:15:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真觉得这么简单吗？ - 对 我就这么觉得\N{\rEng}- You think it's that simple? - Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.63,2:15:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我来给你讲明白\N{\rEng}Let me explain to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.85,2:15:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我生在1601年 是个吸血鬼 我活得太久了\N{\rEng}I was born in 1601. I'm a vampire. I've been around forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.68,2:15:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过太多像你这样的马蒂\N{\rEng}I've met many Marty Mausers over the centuries.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.82,2:15:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有人顶撞过我 有人不守规矩\N{\rEng}Some of them crossed me, some weren't straight. They weren't honest.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.63,2:15:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而那些人我让他们永远受罪\N{\rEng}And those are the ones that are still here.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.85,2:15:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是赢了 我会让你永远受罪\N{\rEng}You go out and win that game, you're gonna be here forever too.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.79,2:15:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让你求生不得 求死不能\N{\rEng}And you'll never be happy. You will never be happy.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.24,2:15:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.68,2:15:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 罗克韦尔先生\N{\rEng}Okay, Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.94,2:15:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）休息结束 比赛继续
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.74,2:15:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）目前比分18比17
Dialogue: 0,2:15:35.84,2:15:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟领先一分
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.76,2:15:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤加油 远藤加油 远藤加油
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.78,2:15:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在由远藤发球
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.01,2:15:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）开局不错
Dialogue: 0,2:15:45.92,2:15:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）又是一轮拉锯战
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.04,2:15:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）漂亮
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.45,2:15:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤 得一分
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.97,2:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤终于把比分扳平
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.80,2:15:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤加油 远藤加油 远藤加油
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.60,2:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）欢呼声越来越响亮了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.80,2:16:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）目前比分是18比18
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.54,2:16:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）精彩继续
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.05,2:16:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\rEng}There we go!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.49,2:16:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）可惜了 毛瑟得分
Dialogue: 0,2:16:21.86,2:16:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在比分19比18
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.00,2:16:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟毫不让步
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.87,2:16:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）又要发球了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.77,2:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）打过去了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.14,2:16:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）又被打回来了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.95,2:16:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）打回去了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.37,2:16:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这球...远藤进攻成功
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.12,2:16:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤又追平了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.16,2:16:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）比分19比19
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.56,2:16:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现场气氛越来越热闹了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.49,2:16:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）比赛继续
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.29,2:17:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤发球
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.40,2:17:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）击出
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.63,2:17:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）接得好
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.08,2:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）打得好
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.59,2:17:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）接得好
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.45,2:17:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.46,2:17:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）太惊心动魄了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.33,2:17:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）20比19
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.32,2:17:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤到达了赛点
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.73,2:17:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）日本观众们 一起为他加油吧
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.54,2:17:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）进入赛点 比赛更紧张精彩了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.70,2:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- （日语） 远藤能再得一分吗？ - 到赛点了\N{\rEng}Match point.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.59,2:17:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）大家拭目以待
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.45,2:17:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤必胜
Dialogue: 0,2:17:38.41,2:17:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）加油吧 毛瑟
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.06,2:17:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）加油吧
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.69,2:17:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）能接住吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.11,2:17:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）仍在僵持
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.86,2:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）又是猛攻
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.49,2:17:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）天呐
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.86,2:17:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）马蒂·毛瑟
Dialogue: 0,2:17:57.74,2:18:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）再次得分
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.46,2:18:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）再次扳回比分的是马蒂·毛瑟
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.22,2:18:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）20比20
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.02,2:18:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）20分后 远藤必须连拿两分才能获胜
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.48,2:18:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在由毛瑟发球
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.56,2:18:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）球差点擦网
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.02,2:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）双方都在用正手击球
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.74,2:18:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）现在换到反手了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.96,2:18:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）马蒂·毛瑟正手得分
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.84,2:18:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.38,2:18:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）双方你追我赶
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.25,2:18:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）日本观众陷入了沉默
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.63,2:18:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）马蒂只要一分就能战胜远藤
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.85,2:18:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤被逼到了绝境
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.98,2:19:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟能撑住吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:02.33,2:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）毛瑟撑住就能赢
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.39,2:19:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）接下来会发生什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.24,2:19:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别输给他 马蒂 - 马蒂 加油 加油\N{\rEng}- Don't let him getcha, Marty! - Yeah, Marty! Go boy!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.27,2:19:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这是最后一球吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.87,2:19:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）谁能笑到最后？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.42,2:19:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）是毛瑟还是远藤？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.40,2:19:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）最后一局了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:22.67,2:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤能撑住吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.40,2:19:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）别眨眼
Dialogue: 0,2:19:25.94,2:19:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）拉锯战又开始了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.32,2:19:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤处于劣势
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.72,2:19:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）要是毛瑟得分 远藤就输了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.71,2:19:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）打回去了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.34,2:19:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）打得异常激烈
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.71,2:19:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）胜负已分
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.81,2:19:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）获胜者是马蒂·毛瑟
Dialogue: 0,2:19:41.97,2:19:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）精彩的对决
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.90,2:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）多么精彩的致胜一击
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.21,2:19:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）马蒂·毛瑟创造了历史
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.29,2:19:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.48,2:19:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 打得好 打得好\N{\rEng}Thank you. Good game. Good game.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.75,2:19:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个可敬的对手\N{\rEng}You're a great player.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:58.27,2:20:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,世锦赛你一定要加油 我真心希望你赢\N{\rEng}Good luck at the championship, okay? I hope you win.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.75,2:20:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）本场比赛获胜者是马蒂·毛瑟
Dialogue: 0,2:20:48.35,2:20:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,贝尔维尤医院 有什么可以帮您？\N{\rEng}Bellevue Hospital. May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.36,2:20:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 是的\N{\rEng}Hi, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.10,2:20:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,请帮我转接瑞秋·米兹勒 谢谢\N{\rEng}I was hoping to be connected with Rachel Mizler, please?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.77,2:20:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,请问她在几楼？\N{\rEng}Do you know what floor she's on?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.39,2:20:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她应该刚做完手术\N{\rEng}Well, she would have gotten out of surgery.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.45,2:20:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,应该待在安置术后病人的地方吧\N{\rEng}So wherever you keep people like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.51,2:21:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我查一下\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.62,2:21:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这写着她昨晚被转到了产科病房\N{\rEng}So it looks like she was moved to the maternity ward last night.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.52,2:21:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 产科病房？ - 是的\N{\rEng}- The maternity ward? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.41,2:21:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么要去产科？ - 抱歉 我不清楚细节\N{\rEng}- What do you mean, "the maternity ward"? - I'm sorry, I don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.16,2:21:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她没事吧？她生了吗？预产期还有四周啊\N{\rEng}Is she okay? Did she have the baby? She's not due for four weeks.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.70,2:21:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道 她是被急送过去的...\N{\rEng}This is all the information that I have, that she was rushed--
Dialogue: 0,2:21:15.45,2:21:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,急送？什么意思？还转到了产科\N{\rEng}"Rushed"? What are you saying, "rushed"? First you said, "moved,"
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.62,2:21:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又急送 什么意思？ - 先生 请您冷静一下\N{\rEng}- now you're saying, "rushed"? - Sir, can you please calm down?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:19.63,2:21:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,直接帮我把电话转到产科 谢谢\N{\rEng}Just put me through to the maternity ward, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.05,2:21:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 嘿\N{\rEng}- Daddy! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.78,2:21:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 产科的病房在哪儿？\N{\rEng}Excuse me. Maternity ward's here?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.75,2:21:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 往前走 - 好 往前走 谢谢\N{\rEng}- Yes, down the hall. - Down the hall. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.34,2:21:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 先签名登记 - 不 不用 我是孩子他爸\N{\rEng}- Sir, you need to sign in. - No, no. I'm the father.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.07,2:21:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.70,2:22:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 睡吧 我在这 我在这 没事的\N{\rEng}It's okay, sleep. I'm here. I'm here. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.25,2:22:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别怕 我不会走的 我哪儿也不去\N{\rEng}I'm right here. Don't worry, I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.81,2:22:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,继续睡吧\N{\rEng}Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:46.67,2:22:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\rEng}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.46,2:23:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,米兹勒的\N{\rEng}Mizler.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:50.99,2:23:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,四号箱 对吧？\N{\rEng}You said four, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.91,2:24:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要我抱起来给您看看吗？\N{\rEng}Do you want me to pick him up?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.35,2:24:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,跟爸爸打个招呼吧\N{\rEng}Say hi to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:29.82,2:24:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看那是爸爸 叫爸爸\N{\rEng}Yeah, there he is. Say hi.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.62,2:24:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对 爸爸\N{\rEng}Yes. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:58.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 趁还有机会 跳起来吧 ♪\N{\rLyricsEng}♪ Let's dance in style, let's dance for a while ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:02.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 别靠天命 活在当下吧 ♪\N{\rLyricsEng}♪ Heaven can wait, we're only watching the skies ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:05.33,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 盼着好事 也做好最坏打算 ♪\N{\rLyricsEng}♪ Hoping for the best but expecting the worst ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 明天会不会就烟消云散？ ♪\N{\rLyricsEng}♪ Are you gonna drop the bomb or not? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:12.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 要么痛快地死 要么好好活下去 ♪\N{\rLyricsEng}♪ Let us die young or let us live forever ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:16.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 命靠天定 但我们偏要逆流而上 ♪\N{\rLyricsEng}♪ We don't have the power but we never say never ♪
